assets/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3sj_xp-v1_jxx.js\",\"/creators-assets/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2njnkxjf39nsf.js\",\"/creators-assets/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0ph1ht6wvel_v.js\",\"/creators-assets/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2zfre20tirh12.js\",\"/creators-assets/_next/static/immutable/chunks/05i2jce8amocn.js\",\"/creators-assets/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0v-er0xp5q011.js\",\"/creators-assets/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2rn8ri2u5wuca.js\",\"/creators-assets/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2p6snucyfb6_0.js\",\"/creators-assets/_next/static/immutable/chunks/169pjay1xif06.js\"],\"StaticResourceGridWithToolbar\"]\n4f:T1692,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimer\u003c/strong\u003e: This is not an official Framer plugin.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnect your Framer projects to AI assistants using the Model Context Protocol (MCP). This plugin enables Claude, Cursor, and other MCP-compatible tools to directly interact with your Framer designs through a secure tunnel connection.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Ask Claude to rewrite your landing page copy based on SEO research\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Create custom code components and insert them directly into your canvas\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Update color styles across your entire project with a single command\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Export Framer components as production-ready React code\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Automate design updates using AI-generated content\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow It Works\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe plugin creates a secure WebSocket tunnel between your Framer project and MCP-compatible AI assistants. Your Framer user ID serves as a unique identifier, ensuring the connection remains consistent across all your projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhen you make a request through Claude or another MCP client, it travels through a Cloudflare Worker to your open Framer plugin, where it executes using Framer's Plugin API. The response then returns through the same secure channel.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe MCP URL includes your user ID and an optional session secret for enhanced security. This URL remains the same across all your Framer projects, so you only need to configure it once.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eAvailable Tools\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Project Structure - Get XML representation of pages, components, and code files\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Node Selection - Read and manipulate currently selected elements\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• XML Updates - Modify node attributes, text content, and structure\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Color Styles - Create, update, and apply project color styles\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Text Styles - Manage typography styles with full property control\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Font Search - Find and apply fonts from Framer's font library\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Node Operations - Duplicate, delete, or zoom to specific nodes\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• React Export - Convert Framer components to React code with \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://github.com/remorses/unframer\"\u003eunframer CLI\u003c/a\u003e (integrates with \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.framer.com/marketplace/plugins/react-export/\"\u003eReact Export plugin\u003c/a\u003e, shares the same \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://unframer.co/\"\u003esubscription\u003c/a\u003e)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Code Files - Create, read, and update TypeScript/React code components\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Component Insertion - Add components to canvas with proper positioning\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eConnecting to AI Assistants\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eClaude Desktop App:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. Open Claude Desktop settings (menu bar \u0026gt; Settings)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. Navigate to Developer tab \u0026gt; Edit config\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3. Add the MCP server URL from the plugin to your configuration\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e4. Restart Claude Desktop to activate the connection\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCursor IDE:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. Open command palette (Cmd/Ctrl + Shift + P)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. Search for \"Cursor Settings\" and select MCP option\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3. Add the server configuration to ~/.cursor/mcp.json\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e4. Refresh MCP servers in settings\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e5. Use Cursor in agent mode to access MCP tools\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eClaude Code:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. Install Claude Code CLI (without sudo)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. Run: claude mcp add \"framer-mcp\" \u0026lt;your-mcp-url\u0026gt;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3. The server will be available in all Claude Code sessions\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eTechnical Details\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe system uses three components working together:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Framer Plugin - Runs inside Framer, handles API calls and maintains WebSocket connection\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• MCP Server - Cloudflare Worker implementing the MCP protocol at mcp.unframer.co\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• WebSocket Tunnel - Bidirectional connection using your Framer user ID as identifier\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOnly one plugin instance can connect per user to prevent conflicts. Multiple MCP clients can connect simultaneously to the same plugin. All requests include a 5-second timeout for reliability.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe plugin supports request/response correlation via message IDs and implements automatic reconnection with exponential backoff. All tool operations are validated before execution to ensure design integrity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eSecurity Considerations\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Never share your MCP URL containing the session secret\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• The connection is tied to your Framer user account\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• All operations require explicit approval in your MCP client\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• The plugin only has access to the currently open project\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eExample Workflows\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eLanding Page Optimization:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eUse Claude to research keywords, then ask it to update your page headings and meta descriptions with SEO-optimized content.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign System Updates:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAsk Claude to create a consistent color palette and apply it across all components using color styles.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eComponent Development:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuild custom React components with Claude Code and insert them directly into your Framer project.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eContent Migration:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eExport existing components as React code and integrate them into your production application. The React Export feature integrates with the Framer React Export plugin—if you have an existing subscription, you can use it seamlessly with MCP.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAutomated Testing:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eUse MCP tools to verify all text styles follow accessibility guidelines and update non-compliant elements.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eSaving space in the Framer canvas\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis plugin needs to always remain open to use MCP. To save space and not consume too much space you can click the collapse button in the bottom right of the plugin. This minimizes the plugin window.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eUsing Framer MCP programatically\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis MCP can be used also with tools to control Framer programatically for agentic tasks. For example you will be able create an agent that uses Framer to add new blog posts based on SEO keyword research\u003c/p\u003e50:T61a,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuild eCommerce sites in Framer, finally.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFrameship is the only plugin you need to build Shopify stores in Framer. Design \u0026amp; publish your Shopify store with the Framer website builder. Sync Shopify with Framer to build faster than ever before.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow it works:\u003c/h2\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eQuickly connect your Shopify store with Framer in less than 60 seconds to start building.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFrameship automatically syncs your product data so you can use Framer with Shopify, together.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrag \u0026amp; drop our customisable components and we’ll do the rest. Focus on designing \u0026amp; less time on the technical stuff.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003ch2\u003eDesign everything in Framer\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuild \u0026amp; publish with the creativity of Framer, combined with the powerful ecommerce capabilities for Shopify. Use our library of 20+ components to bring eCommerce functionality to your Framer site!\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eZero sacrifice\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy setup\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO friendly\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eZero code (really)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne-time fee\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T5vWpBQRPuE\u0026amp;t=36s\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/T5vWpBQRPuE?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" start=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" data-youtube-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T5vWpBQRPuE\u0026amp;t=36s\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e51:T1071,\u003ch2\u003eOverview\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eFramer Commerce is the most advanced way to design Shopify storefronts in Framer. Sync your product data, design with 40+ Shopify components, and launch fast. Winner of Framer’s Best Plugin Award.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eShopify → Framer sync\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOne-click sync products,\u003c/strong\u003e variants, prices, descriptions, tags, collections, SEO data, and more\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImport custom text metafields\u003c/strong\u003e from Shopify\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCreate editable fields \u003c/strong\u003ein Framer CMS\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eControl every part of the product experience\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFlexible purchase buttons \u003c/strong\u003ewith Add to Cart, Quick Add, Buy Now, and Shop Pay buttons\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSell subscriptions\u003c/strong\u003e using selling plans (supports all Subscription apps)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdvanced variant selectors\u003c/strong\u003e with buttons, dropdowns, image \u0026amp; color swatches, and quick-add options\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuantity selector\u003c/strong\u003e with custom button \u0026amp; dropdown options and inventory-aware limits\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive stock status messaging\u003c/strong\u003e with custom states\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDynamic price \u0026amp; compare-at prices\u003c/strong\u003e based on selected variants\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDiscount badges \u003c/strong\u003ewith automatic percentage or amount saved\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct attribute fields\u003c/strong\u003e to allow customers to add text to their order\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdvanced variant control\u003c/strong\u003e using variant IDs on purchase buttons\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConnect variants to visuals\u003c/strong\u003e to trigger gallery state changes or scroll-sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSet max quantity limits \u003c/strong\u003eper product in the cart\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFilter, search, sort \u0026amp; favorite\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive product filters \u003c/strong\u003ewith variant and inventory data\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCustom search modals \u003c/strong\u003ewith product and keyword suggestions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSort options\u003c/strong\u003e using custom radio buttons or dropdowns\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLet users favorite products \u003c/strong\u003eand revisit without logging in\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eIncrease cart spend\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick adds on empty cart states\u003c/strong\u003e to push your top products\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCart promo progress bars\u003c/strong\u003e to encourage larger orders\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDynamic cart product cards \u003c/strong\u003ewith customizable options\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTrigger cart overlay\u003c/strong\u003e when add to cart is clicked\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive cart counter\u003c/strong\u003e with unique state for empty carts\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eSell globally with Shopify Markets\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay local prices \u003c/strong\u003ebased on region\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDesign custom market selectors\u003c/strong\u003e with branded UI\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShow market-specific content\u003c/strong\u003e based on region\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLocalized checkout \u003c/strong\u003eto send customers to checkout in their language and currency\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShow-once modals \u003c/strong\u003efor market selection or newsletter signup\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eAnalytics \u0026amp; tracking\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt-in advanced analytics\u003c/strong\u003e from Framer\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMeta Pixel and Conversions API\u003c/strong\u003e integration\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGoogle Analytics\u003c/strong\u003e with GTM support\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUTM parameter \u003c/strong\u003esupport (custom setup required on all headless stores)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003ePlans \u0026amp; pricing\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFree to start with Framer Commerce badge and Framer Domain\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePaid plans unlock custom domains, premium templates, and higher product limits\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eView plan details at framercommerce.com/pricing\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eStart with a free template (or sell your own)\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eExplore with our free OFFSIDE or starter templates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUse premium templates from creators like ena supply\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSell your own templates and keep 100% of sales\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eSupport\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eJoin our Slack community: framercommerce.com/slack\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eView docs and resources: framercommerce.com/resources/support\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSince we have a free tier, refunds are evaluated on a case-by-case basis\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e52:Tb6d,\u003ch2\u003eDrag and drop to build your site\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eNever run out of design inspiration again.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.kompa.design/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/Xfp834tigmg\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Xfp834tigmg?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eKompa trailer\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch2\u003e🎁 What do I get?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMassive, Ready-to-Use Library\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGet access to \u003cstrong\u003e1000+ clean, fully responsive components\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuild the structure with sections and components, then power it up with advanced code components.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLaunch faster using ready-made \u003cstrong\u003epage templates.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDrag-and-Drop everything\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInstantly insert high-quality sections and layouts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAutomatically adapts to your breakpoints.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUpdated Weekly\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e10+ sections and components added every Tuesday so you can stay up to date with evolving web design trends.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e💬 What Users Love\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e“I’m turning around entire websites in the same timeframe single pages used to take me.”\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e– Luca Da Corte (Product specialist @ Framer)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e“I’ve been way more profitable, which when you’re self-employed means food on the table and a roof over your head.”\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e– Sam Anthony (Freelance designer)\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e👥 Who can use it\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeal for:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFreelancers\u003c/strong\u003e wanting faster, more efficient project delivery\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAgencies\u003c/strong\u003e needing team alignment and styling consistency\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTemplate creators\u003c/strong\u003e leveraging a Framer-reviewed, universal system\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeginners\u003c/strong\u003e seeking a polished starting point without the overwhelm\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e💎 Great price\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOne‑time purchase\u003c/strong\u003e — no subscriptions, ever. Pay once and keep it forever. All updates are free and automatic.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTry before committing\u003c/strong\u003e — the free version includes core tools like text and color styling, plus basic components\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e📖 Support\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEnjoy responsive support via the plugin, with same-day responses.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAccess live help by scheduling a \u003cstrong\u003e30-minute video calls\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKompa\u003c/strong\u003e is packed with ready-made, responsive components, styled fast, updated weekly, and built to save time without compromising quality. If you\u0026#39;re looking for a design toolkit that scales with your creativity, Kompa has your back.\u003c/p\u003e53:Tf2a,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://framerformsconnect.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eFramer Forms Connect\u003c/a\u003e is the easy way to use Framer’s native design tools to build beautiful forms that connect directly to your favorite CRM and email marketing platforms.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eFeatures:\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e🎨  \u003cstrong\u003eKeep Your Design:\u003c/strong\u003e Use your design. No ugly iframes or generic widgets. All types of fields are supported.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e📨 \u003cstrong\u003eCustom States: \u003c/strong\u003echoose what to show after a submission, add a redirect - all Framer functions are supported.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong\u003eQuick setup:\u003c/strong\u003e log into a service with Framer Forms Connect, it will fetch the data automatically.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e♾️ \u003cstrong\u003eUnlimited forms\u003c/strong\u003e: add as many forms as you need, no restrictions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🛡 \u003cstrong\u003ePrivacy:\u003c/strong\u003e No third-party services. No data retention. No need for Zapier or Make.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🏷️ \u003cstrong\u003eTransparent pricing\u003c/strong\u003e: $10/mo, $69/year (save 40%), $99 \u003cstrong\u003elifetime access\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🏷️ \u003cstrong\u003e7 days free trial:\u003c/strong\u003e try until you buy. \u003cem\u003eNote: Lifetime purchase is instant. We suggest to try the monthly trial before buying lifetime access.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSupported Services:\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://framerformsconnect.com/resources/send-framer-forms-to-hubspot\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eHubSpot CRM\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://framerformsconnect.com/resources/send-framer-forms-to-mailchimp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eMailchimp\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://framerformsconnect.com/resources/send-framer-forms-to-brevo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eBrevo\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://framerformsconnect.com/resources/send-framer-forms-to-beehiiv\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eBeehiiv\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://framerformsconnect.com/resources/send-framer-forms-to-mailerlite\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eMailerLite\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://framerformsconnect.com/resources/send-framer-forms-to-jotform\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eJotform\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://framerformsconnect.com/resources/send-framer-forms-to-slack-discord\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eDiscord\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://framerformsconnect.com/resources/send-framer-forms-to-slack-discord\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eSlack\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://framerformsconnect.com/resources/send-framer-forms-to-drip\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eDrip\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eMissing a service? Let us know, and we\u0026#39;ll add it!\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e👌 Easy: just click log in to connect to a service.\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/737-framer-forms-connect-ffEibHxTMYpvBcDy3a2ojkdNdWkWfu\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch3\u003eDon\u0026#39;t have login details? Connect manually with:\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVideo Instructions:\u003c/strong\u003e Step-by-step video guides right inside the plugin.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHuman-Readable Errors:\u003c/strong\u003e If a form doesn’t go through, it will tell you exactly how to fix it in plain English.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSupport:\u003c/strong\u003e paid plan offers full support.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSecurity\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAt no point \u003c/strong\u003edo we collect, log or store your submissions. Feel free to request a tour to review our infrastructure.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e🚀  Start collecting submissions today with zero technical headaches.\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://billing.stripe.com/p/login/8x26oJfaHbkw1Ay1Ly1kA00\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eBilling\u003c/a\u003e - manage your subscription \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:annyeong@romans.design\"\u003eSupport\u003c/a\u003e - voted world\u0026#39;s friendliest support (by the support itself)\u003c/p\u003e54:T5c8,\u003ch2\u003eCreate beautiful moving gradients with ShaderGradient for your website.\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e🎨\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eFull customizability\u003c/strong\u003e : Gradients are made with webGL shaders, giving you the full customizability from colors, shapes to advanced effects like grains and lightings.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e📦\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eReady for production\u003c/strong\u003e : We made a huge improvement in performance and the size of the package.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🔥\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eCreate colorful interactions\u003c/strong\u003e : Using Framer’s smart component, you can make creative interactions with the gradient component. Check out some examples from our website and remix link!\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow to use\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eUse this plugin to add a gradient component from presets or with url from https://shadergradient.co/customize. You can customize properties like colors, shapes, effects from property controls.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFuture updates\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis is the first version of our Framer plugin, and we’ll continue updating the plugin for\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ecustom UI for property controls\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003enew Shaders\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eLinks\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor any inquiry or bug report, reach out to us via Twitter / Instagram (@shadergradient). Tag us if you create something cool!\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you’re interested in the original React package, visit our Github repository (https://github.com/ruucm/shadergradient)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you want to extract gradients in files like GIF and video, check out our Figma plugin (https://www.figma.com/community/plugin/1203016883447870818)\u003c/p\u003e55:T722,\u003ch2\u003eContext Picker\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eFramer\u0026#39;s native AI agent can see what you\u0026#39;ve selected on the canvas, using its built in select tool. External agents like Claude Code, Cursor, and Codex don\u0026#39;t get that. They only see plain text, so prompts like \u0026quot;make this headline red\u0026quot; leave them guessing which node \u0026quot;this\u0026quot; actually is.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eContext Picker closes that gap. Select any layer on the canvas or in the layer sidebar, and it instantly copies a compact JSON payload describing that selection: node ID, name, and the surrounding scope (web page, design page, or component). Paste it straight into your external agent\u0026#39;s prompt for precise, unambiguous edits.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhat gets copied\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNode ID and name of the selected layer\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eScope type and ID, whether you\u0026#39;re on a web page, design page, or inside a component\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eURL path, when the scope is a real website page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eReplica metadata (original node ID), when the selection is a variant or inherited component layer\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eHow to use it\u003c/h3\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpen Context Picker\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSelect any layer on the canvas or sidebar\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe JSON is copied automatically, no extra click\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePaste it into your external agent\u0026#39;s prompt\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNeed an earlier selection? Recent picks are saved and one click away\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhy it matters\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you\u0026#39;re driving Framer edits from an external coding agent like Claude Code, Cursor, or Codex, the agent is flying blind without canvas context. Context Picker gives it the same precision Framer\u0026#39;s native agent has with its select tool, so instead of vague prompts and trial and error edits, you can say exactly which node to touch and watch it land correctly the first time.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFree and open source.\u003c/p\u003e56:T893,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTRY IT OUT FOR FREE.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eTwo ways to use the plugin\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003eCopy Prompt — Best for AI coding\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eSelect a component, copy the prompt, paste into your AI tool. The AI reads your component and integrates it into your project.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eDownload ZIP — Standalone React code\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrefer to work without AI? Download your component as a self-contained React package. Drop it into any React project — Next.js, Vite, Remix, whatever you use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eHow it works\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IXsZSIYvNLI\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IXsZSIYvNLI?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eHow it works\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. Select: Click on any component in your Framer project\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. Choose: Copy Prompt for AI, or Download ZIP for standalone code\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3. Done: Your AI implements it, or drop the ZIP into your project\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWorks with\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClaude Code\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCursor\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCodex\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLovable\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ev0\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eReplit\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBolt\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eand other AI coding tools\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePricing\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFree 5-day trial\u003c/strong\u003e: Try both Prompt and ZIP modes on your components. No charge if you cancel before day 5.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAfter trial:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuarterly\u003c/strong\u003e — €9.99/month (billed every 3 months at €29.97)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMonthly\u003c/strong\u003e — €19.97/month\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eManage Subscription : \u003c/strong\u003eVisit \u003ca href=\"https://design-to-ai.lemonsqueezy.com/billing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://design-to-ai.lemonsqueezy.com/billing\u003c/a\u003e to manage subscription, update payment details, or cancel your trial.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e14-day refund\u003c/strong\u003e on your first charge, no questions asked — email \u003ca href=\"mailto:hey@design-to-ai.com\"\u003e olalekanisaaccb@gmail.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e57:T667,\u003ch3\u003eComplete Asset Overview\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eAsset Analyzer gives you a complete overview of every asset in your Framer project. It scans images, videos, PDFs, audio files, and documents across pages, components, CMS collections, and rich text, showing exactly where each asset is used.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSearch \u0026amp; Discover\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eQuickly find the assets you\u0026#39;re looking for by searching filenames, layer names, page paths, CMS fields. Use automatically detected image characteristics like orientation, colours, and content type as tags to further improve search.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eAlt Text\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eSee accurate alt text coverage across your project with tracking per image placement, not just per image. Update alt text across every instance at once or edit individual placements when needed, making accessibility audits fast and straightforward.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote:\u003c/strong\u003e Due to current limitations of Framer\u0026#39;s Server API, some image placements cannot be updated by plugins. This includes images embedded inside formatted (rich text) fields and a few other unsupported locations. These placements are clearly identified in Asset Analyzer so you know which ones require manual updates.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eFind \u0026amp; Replace Images\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eReplace images individually or in bulk without manually editing every instance. Asset Analyzer lets you swap an image everywhere it\u0026#39;s used, including images inside component instances, making project-wide updates fast and consistent.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePrivate \u0026amp; Free\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eAsset Analyzer runs entirely inside Framer with no account, sign-up, or API key required. Your project stays local, and the plugin is completely free to use.\u003c/p\u003e58:T775,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImage Manager\u003c/strong\u003e finds every image in your Framer project - on pages, inside components, and in your CMS - and lets you audit, fix and optimize them without ever leaving the canvas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eStop hunting through pages for that one bloated hero image. One panel, every image, grouped by where it actually lives.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat it does\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eFull project scan\u003c/strong\u003e - pages, components, design pages and CMS collections, in seconds\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eCMS included\u003c/strong\u003e - image fields and gallery fields, with alt text and one-click optimization\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eNo duplicates\u003c/strong\u003e - one entry per image, not one per breakpoint or component variant\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eSmart audit\u003c/strong\u003e - file size, dimensions, format and missing alt text at a glance\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eOne-click optimization\u003c/strong\u003e - resize and convert to WebP, applied directly to your project\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eBulk actions\u003c/strong\u003e - optimize, edit alt text, download or delete a whole selection at once\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eGroup by source\u003c/strong\u003e - Pages, Components, CMS collections, or everything at once\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eInline editing\u003c/strong\u003e - rename layers, write alt text, locate images on the canvas\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt for\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Designers who care about performance scores on client work\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Agencies juggling dozens of Framer projects\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Teams chasing alt text coverage and Core Web Vitals\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy it matters\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHeavy images drag down Core Web Vitals and search rankings. Missing alt text costs you on both accessibility and SEO. Image Manager surfaces both instantly and lets you fix them in seconds, without Photoshop, Squoosh, or a single export and re-upload round trip.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAvailable in English, French and Spanish. Dark and light themes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNeed help? Contact: \u003ca href=\"mailto:lacompagnieduweb@gmail.com\"\u003elacompagnieduweb@gmail.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e59:T50b,\u003cp\u003eFigma Sync connects your Figma files to Framer, so you can bring design styles and assets into your project without rebuilding them by hand.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eImport a Figma file, review what was found, then sync color styles, text styles, light/dark color modes, and image assets into Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFeatures\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eColor Style Sync\u003c/strong\u003eImport Figma color styles into Framer as reusable color styles. Keep your brand colors and design tokens easier to recreate across projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eText Style Sync\u003c/strong\u003eBring Figma text styles into Framer with matching font, size, weight, line height, and spacing where available. Useful for rebuilding typography systems quickly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLight and Dark Mode Colors\u003c/strong\u003eDetect matching light and dark color styles and sync them as paired color values in Framer. This helps move theme-ready color systems across with less manual setup.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAssets Import\u003c/strong\u003eFind image assets from your Figma file, preview them inside the plugin, and drag them into your Framer canvas. Good for moving visual assets alongside your styles.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow It Works\u003c/h2\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnect your Figma account.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePaste in a Figma file URL.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSync styles into Framer or drag image assets onto the canvas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e5a:T447,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eScroll Sequence makes it easy to create scroll-based image and video sequences in Framer.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eJust upload your images or a video, preview how the sequence feels while scrolling, and insert it into your page. It’s a simple way to build product reveals, storytelling sections, motion showcases, and more without setting everything up manually or struggling with code components which only allow single image uploads.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe plugin helps you move faster by turning your assets into a ready-to-use scroll sequence with a smooth workflow inside Framer, no pre or post setup needed on the page.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat it helps with\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eproduct reveals\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003estorytelling sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003emotion-heavy landing pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eeditorial-style transitions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow it works\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eupload multiple images at once or a video\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003epreview the sequence inside the plugin\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003einsert it into your page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eadjust the component further in Framer breakpoint if needed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e5b:T8f9,\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSEO Toolkit, the All-in-One SEO Plugin for Framer\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eRank your Framer site on Google without juggling five different tools. SEO Toolkit is a complete Framer SEO plugin that audits your active page in real time and tells you exactly what to fix. It checks meta tags, analyzes your focus keyword, validates headings, flags missing alt text, generates schema markup, previews your search and social cards, and runs a real speed test, all inside the Framer canvas. No code and no developer needed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Framer creators need an SEO plugin\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFramer gives you a few SEO fields in settings, but it does not tell you whether your title is the right length, whether your keyword appears in the first paragraph, or whether your images are missing alt text. There is no SEO score, no schema generator, and no on-page audit built in. SEO Toolkit fills those gaps and turns guesswork into a clear checklist.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat you get\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLive SEO score from 0 to 100 that updates as you edit your title, description, and focus keyword.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMeta tag editor with title and description length guidance for search results.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIssue analyzer that sorts problems into errors, warnings, and notes with plain-language fixes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlt text manager with optional AI generation using your own OpenAI key.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGoogle SERP previews plus Facebook, X, and LinkedIn social card previews.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eJSON-LD schema generator for FAQ, Article, Product, LocalBusiness, Event, Review, Breadcrumb, and Organization rich results.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNine-point technical checklist for H1 rules, canonical URLs, indexability, and OG images.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eReal Lighthouse speed audit for Core Web Vitals via Google PageSpeed Insights.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt the right way\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe core toolkit is free. AI alt text is bring-your-own-key, so there are no hidden fees. Nothing is injected into your live site, no tracking, and drafts auto-save per page.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWho it is for: solo designers, agencies managing client sites, and any Framer site owner who wants to rank on Google, Bing, and AI search.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupport: \u003ca href=\"mailto:connect@fecommerce.co\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003econnect@fecommerce.co\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e5c:T54a,\u003cp\u003e3D Shapes is a powerful Framer plugin that gives you instant access to a curated library of hundreds of abstract 3D shape images—all in one place. Designed to streamline your workflow, the plugin lets you quickly browse, select, and drag-and-drop high-quality visuals directly into your Framer projects. Whether you're building landing pages, portfolios, or modern UI concepts, these shapes help you add depth, texture, and a polished visual edge in seconds.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCompletely free to use, 3D Shapes is perfect for designers who want to elevate their work without spending hours searching for assets. With new visuals ready at your fingertips, you can spend more time designing and less time searching for assets.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCategories include:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClay\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMetallic\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIridescent\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlack\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlue\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePink\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eand more...\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eRoadmap\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eI'm planning to add these features in future updates\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eColorizer tool to apply colors and gradients to clay and metallic shapes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMore 3D shape assets.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eOpen-Source\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e3D Shapes plugin is open source! You can find the source code on \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://github.com/madebyisaacr/framer-3d-shapes\"\u003eGitHub\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e5d:T4b2,\u003ch2\u003eAI Agent\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI agent just landed into the plugin! \u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"robot\"\u003e🤖\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFounder members have received 10 free credits to try it out, and new users get 5 credits on signup.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFeatures\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI agent for image generation and edits from text/reference images\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrag \u0026amp; Drop, clipboard, URL or file image import\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eZoom, undo/redo, revert, copy, download, export, save\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCrop tools with presets and manual control\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eManage presets: clone, save, reset, shuffle\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFine-tune brightness, color, and style settings\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eApply powerful image effects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUpscale images up to 4× resolution\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRemove backgrounds with one click\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBrowse stock images and favorites\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProject history and gallery access\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWeb App\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eYour edits now sync between the plugin and the web app. Open an image anywhere, continue editing, keep your history, favorites, and assets in sync.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e👉 \u003ca href=\"https://editimage.studio\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ehttps://editimage.studio\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e5e:Tc23,\u003cp\u003eShaders by Paper brings \u003ca href=\"http://paper.design\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003epaper.design\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#39;s open source WebGL shader library into Framer as native components. Insert a shader from the gallery and every setting shows up as a regular Framer control: colors, sliders, toggles, and image inputs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eNative Framer variants and transitions\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe most valuable and unique feature of this plugin is the support for Framer variants: you can wrap a shader inside a native Framer component and create as many variants as you need.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis allows you to play with scroll triggers, scroll variants, hover states, clicks, etc. Basically all native Framer events and transitions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eDemos \u0026amp; walkthrough\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://shadersbypaper.framer.ai/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eDemo Site (Live link)\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://youtu.be/pxw9YFggXqg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eDemo Video (YouTube)\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://youtu.be/G5kWeZIlQAU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eWalkthrough tutorial\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://x.com/fw3d/status/2082772796430540974\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eMore demos and examples\u003c/a\u003e (x.com)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eNative easing curves\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor each of your variant, you can pick the easing and duration in the Transition control. Visitors who prefer reduced motion get the end state directly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e29 shaders, infinite combinations\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe library has 29 shaders in three categories:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eImage filters (6), such as Paper Texture and Fluted Glass\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLogo animations (3), such as Heatmap and Liquid Metal\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEffects (20), such as Mesh Gradient and Dot Orbit\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eEach shader ships with its original presets.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eImport straight from Paper\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you design in Paper, there is a shortcut: copy a shader on the Paper canvas and paste it into the plugin\u0026#39;s Paste import tab. It becomes a Framer component with the same settings, ready to use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eLicense\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe first shader in each category is free forever, with no watermark: Paper Texture, Heatmap, and Mesh Gradient. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA one-year license unlocks the other 26 shaders and the paste import:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e39€ for one Framer account\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eor 149€ for a team key that covers five Framer accounts \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eThere is no subscription, and everything you placed keeps working even if the license expires.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eAbout\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://framerlabs.com/documentation/paper-shaders-intro\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eRead the documentation here\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShaders by Paper for Framer is an independent product, not affiliated with \u003ca href=\"http://paper.design\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003epaper.design\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe shaders come from the open source \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/paper-design/shaders\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ePaper Shaders\u003c/a\u003e library, released under the Apache 2.0 license.\u003c/p\u003e5f:T481,\u003cp\u003eTweaker helps you apply practical CSS behavior tweaks quickly without manually managing repetitive custom code.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeal for improving various UX tweaks directly from one plugin panel without having to copy \u0026amp; paste css custom code manually every time.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeature Set\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOverscroll Control\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrevents rubber-band / bounce overscroll bounce behavior when reaching the top and bottom of the page.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHide Scrollbars\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHides native browser scrollbars for a clean look.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eScrollbar Gutter\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReserves scrollbar space to reduce horizontal layout shift.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTap Highlight Removal\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDisables default mobile tap highlight flash.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisable Image Drag\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrevents images from being dragged on desktop browsers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eText Selection\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDisables text selection on page content while keeping form fields usable.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMeta Bar Color (theme-color\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSet mobile browser top/status bar with custom colors.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e60:T859,\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShopify Connect - Build a Shopify storefront in Framer\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eShopify Connect brings your Shopify store into Framer and lets you build a complete, fully custom storefront without leaving the design tool. Sync your catalog into the Framer CMS in one click, or pull products live via API, then assemble product pages, listings, cart, and checkout with ready-made, drag-and-drop components. No themes, no code. Built on Framer Plugins 3.0 and free to use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow it works\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnect your store with your shop domain and a Storefront API access token.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSync products into a Framer CMS collection, or fetch live by handle in API mode.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrag components onto the canvas. They auto wire to your store and render real data.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eShoppers add to cart and check out through Shopify\u0026#39;s secure hosted checkout.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStorefront Components\u003c/strong\u003e  \u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct Page, Product Listing (search, sort, pagination), Variant Selector (pills, swatches, image switch), Add to Cart, Buy It Now, Quantity, Cart Drawer, Cart Page, Cart Icon, Mobile Sticky Cart, Price, Price Discount, SKU, Inventory Label and Counter, Tabs, Related Products, Share, and more. Changing a variant updates price, SKU, stock, and image everywhere on the page.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTwo data modes\u003c/strong\u003e  \u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS mode syncs products into Framer CMS with no API calls required. API mode fetches live data on demand. Switch anytime.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDesigned for designers \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eToggleable animations (scroll reveal, tab cross fade, hover zoom), deep styling controls, sale badges, light and dark mode, and full responsiveness across desktop, tablet, and phone.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSecure by design\u003c/strong\u003e \u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eYour Storefront token is never embedded in your published site. It is stored locally and used server-side through a secure proxy, with PCI handled by Shopify checkout.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSetup requires a Shopify Storefront API access token (public token). In Shopify admin: Sales channels, Headless, Manage API access, Storefront API, Public access token.\u003c/p\u003e61:Tdad,\u003cp\u003eTranslate your Framer site into any language in the world. Unlimited pages, unlimited languages. No external services. No monthly fees.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFrameLoc is a fully native localization plugin built specifically for Framer. It automatically detects all text layers on your pages, lets you translate them directly inside the plugin, and saves everything natively into your Framer project via code files. No third-party servers, no external APIs, no backend. Just fast, clean, native translations stored directly where your project lives.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWant to translate only certain pages? No problem. FrameLoc gives you full control over which pages you want to localize and which ones you want to leave untouched.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLearn more at \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://frameloc.framer.website\"\u003eframeloc.framer.website\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat makes it different:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFully native.\u003c/strong\u003e All translation data is stored directly in your Framer project as code files. There are no external services involved, which means your site loads fast, stays stable, and never depends on a third-party tool to display the right language to your visitors.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUnlimited languages, unlimited pages.\u003c/strong\u003e Translate your entire site, static pages and CMS collections, into any language in the world. There are no language caps, no page limits, and no usage tiers to worry about.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWorks with static and CMS pages.\u003c/strong\u003e Whether your content is hardcoded on a canvas or driven by a Framer CMS collection, FrameLoc handles both. Every text layer, on every page type, can be translated.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart auto-detection with manual override.\u003c/strong\u003e When you open the plugin on a page, it automatically scans and lists all text layers present on the current canvas. In the rare case a layer is missed, a manual mode lets you add it yourself so nothing ever gets left behind.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMultiple translation view modes.\u003c/strong\u003e The plugin interface has been carefully designed with the user experience in mind. Switch between different translation views to get a clear and organized overview of your content, no matter how large your project is.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTwo native Language Selector components.\u003c/strong\u003e After setting up your translations, drop one of the two included Language Selector components directly onto your canvas. The first one is a fully flexible, design-free component where you can customize every frame property directly within Framer's native UI, shapes, colors, fonts, spacing, and more. The second is a more straightforward prop-based variant, perfect if you want a quick and clean selector without deep customization.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAutomatic save and sync.\u003c/strong\u003e Once you have entered your translations, hit Save and everything is instantly written to the corresponding code file for that page. The process is fast, reliable, and completely automatic, no manual file editing, no copy-pasting into external tools.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOne-time payment.\u003c/strong\u003e Pay once and get lifetime access. No subscriptions, no per-language billing, no per-page limits. Translate as many pages and languages as your project needs, today and in the future.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReady to get started? Get FrameLoc here: \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://elias.lemonsqueezy.com/checkout/buy/97631ec2-07c7-43a3-9eb5-10c10338f205\"\u003ehttps://elias.lemonsqueezy.com/checkout/buy/97631ec2-07c7-43a3-9eb5-10c10338f205\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e62:T5af,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTranslate your Framer site in one click. No API key, no copy-paste.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePick your languages, hit Translate, done. Page Translator runs the AI translation in-app and creates fully translated pages at /fr, /de, /es, or any of the 31 supported languages.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNeed more control? Advanced mode gives you your own DeepL key for large volumes, or the prompt flow for ChatGPT, Claude and Gemini if you want to review every word. If instant translation is ever unavailable, the plugin falls back to those automatically and keeps your page selection.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat makes it different:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReal Framer pages. Translated pages are actual pages in your project, not overlays or iframes. They exist at real URLs, they are editable, and they stay even if you stop using the plugin.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGoogle indexes them properly. Hreflang tags between all language versions, plus the correct lang and text direction per locale (RTL supported for Arabic, Hebrew, Farsi, Urdu).\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSync when you update. Changed a paragraph? Sync detects exactly which texts changed and re-translates only those.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLanguage Switcher included. Generated after translation, added to your canvas in one click.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFree plan: 1 target language, 1 instant run, LLM and DeepL modes included. Pro: 31 languages, unlimited pages and runs, batch translation, sync, hreflang, Language Switcher, priority support. One-time payment, all future updates included.\u003c/p\u003e63:T3db6,\u003ch3\u003eThe #1 Native Form Builder Plugin for Framer - No Code, No Embeds, No External Platforms.\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eForms Plugin lets you create any type of form directly inside Framer's editor. Build contact forms, lead capture forms, registration forms, feedback forms, survey forms, order forms, booking forms, quote request forms, application forms, newsletter signup forms, inquiry forms, appointment forms, client onboarding forms, and waitlist forms - all without writing a single line of code, embedding iframes, or leaving Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eYour forms live natively inside your Framer project. No separate platforms. No copy-paste code snippets. No third-party form builders. Everything stays exactly where your design lives - inside Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/FpZP8WG54d0\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FpZP8WG54d0?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" start=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/FpZP8WG54d0\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch3\u003eBuild Form with AI 🆕\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eStop building forms from scratch. Just describe your use case in plain English and let AI generate a complete, ready-to-use form for you in seconds.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow AI Form Builder works:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpen Forms Plugin - Click \"Build Form with AI\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDescribe what you need (e.g., \"I run a marketing agency and need a lead form to collect name, email, phone, company, project type, and message. The form should integrate with Brevo or HubSpot.\")\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI understands your business, identifies the right fields, structures the form layout, and generates it - ready to publish\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eUnlike Weavely AI Forms which generates forms outside Framer, our AI form builder creates forms natively inside your Framer project with full design control.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Start AI Templates:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLead Generation Form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact Form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClient Onboarding Form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvent Registration Form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupport Request Form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustomer Feedback Form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI Credits included with your plan. No prompt engineering needed - just describe what you want and the AI handles everything: field selection, form structure, layout, and labels.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect for designers, freelancers, and agencies who need to build client forms fast without spending time on manual field setup.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e📋Multi-Step Forms\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eSplit long forms into focused, paged steps for higher completion rates. PageFlow ships 5 components: PageFlow Engine, Navigation Buttons, Step Indicator, Progress Bar, and Step Caption. Add progress bars and step indicators with one click. Use conditional page jumps to skip steps based on user answers. Per-step validation keeps users on track. Perfect for client onboarding, lead qualification, surveys, job applications, and multi-page registration flows.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e🔀Conditional Logic\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eMake your forms smart. Show or hide fields based on what users pick. For example, only ask \"What's your budget?\" if the user says they have a project. You get 5 actions: show, hide, make required, disable, or reset a field. Mix multiple rules with AND/OR for more control. Works on every field type and across multi-step forms, even skipping whole steps based on answers. Set it up right inside Framer's panel.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e🔗 Native CRM, Email Marketing \u0026amp; Newsletter Integrations\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eAutomatically send form submissions and newsletter signups directly to your favorite marketing tools, CRM platforms, and newsletter services - no Zapier, no Make, no external automation, no webhooks required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you are building a newsletter signup form, a lead capture form, or a customer onboarding form - your submissions flow directly to your email marketing and newsletter platform in real time.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSupported integrations:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBrevo (Sendinblue)\u003c/strong\u003e - send leads and newsletter subscribers directly to your Brevo contact lists and email campaigns\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHubSpot\u003c/strong\u003e - push form submissions into HubSpot CRM for lead management, sales pipelines, and automated email workflows\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMailchimp\u003c/strong\u003e - add subscribers to your Mailchimp audience, newsletter lists, and trigger automated email sequences\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConvertKit (Kit)\u003c/strong\u003e - grow your ConvertKit newsletter and email list with native form-to-subscriber sync\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMailerLite\u003c/strong\u003e - capture leads and newsletter signups, sync directly to MailerLite subscriber groups\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKlaviyo\u003c/strong\u003e - connect e-commerce forms to Klaviyo for personalized email, SMS marketing, and newsletter campaigns\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eActiveCampaign\u003c/strong\u003e - automate lead nurturing by sending form data to ActiveCampaign contacts, newsletters, and automations\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDrip\u003c/strong\u003e - push subscriber data to Drip for targeted e-commerce email and newsletter workflows\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeehiiv\u003c/strong\u003e - grow your Beehiiv newsletter subscriber list directly from your Framer forms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eUnlike Lead Form or Contact Form plugins that only support basic email or webhook delivery, Forms Plugin connects natively to 9 major CRM and newsletter platforms with zero middleware.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow integration works:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdd the integration component to your form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEnter your API key and list ID\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMap your form fields to your CRM, email, or newsletter platform fields\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePublish - submissions and newsletter signups go directly to your subscriber lists\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo external automation tools needed. No Zapier. No Make. No middleware. Your form data and newsletter subscriptions flow directly from your Framer website to your marketing platform in real time.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSubmission History \u0026amp; Tracking:\u003c/strong\u003e View successful and failed submissions sent to your integrations. Track every form submission, monitor delivery status, and debug issues - all from inside the plugin.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e🧩 30+ Field Types - Every Input You'll Ever Need\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuild any form with 30+ ready-to-use field types - more than Framer Form Kit, FramerForms, Lead Form, or any other form plugin on the Framer Marketplace:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eText Input\u003c/strong\u003e - single-line and multi-line text fields, name fields, short answer fields\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEmail Field\u003c/strong\u003e - collect email addresses for newsletters, signups, and lead generation\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePhone Number Field\u003c/strong\u003e - capture phone numbers with validation\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDropdown / Select Menu\u003c/strong\u003e - single-select dropdown menus for options, categories, and choices\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCheckbox\u003c/strong\u003e - multi-select checkboxes for preferences, terms acceptance, and consent\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRadio Buttons\u003c/strong\u003e - single-choice radio button groups for surveys, quizzes, and selections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDate Picker\u003c/strong\u003e - calendar date selector for appointments, bookings, and scheduling\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTime Picker\u003c/strong\u003e - time selection for meeting booking and appointment scheduling\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFile Upload\u003c/strong\u003e - accept documents, PDFs, spreadsheets, and any file type directly through your form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImage Upload\u003c/strong\u003e - let users upload images, photos, screenshots, and profile pictures\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAudio Upload\u003c/strong\u003e - collect audio files, voice messages, and sound recordings\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVideo Upload\u003c/strong\u003e - accept video files and screen recordings from users\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eColor Picker\u003c/strong\u003e - color selection input for design preferences and customization forms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eE-Signature / Digital Signature\u003c/strong\u003e - collect legally binding electronic signatures for contracts, agreements, waivers, and approvals\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Recording\u003c/strong\u003e - allow users to record and submit voice notes directly in the form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHidden Fields\u003c/strong\u003e - pass tracking data, UTM parameters, referral sources, and custom values\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNumber Input\u003c/strong\u003e - numeric fields for quantities, budgets, ratings, and scores\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eURL Field\u003c/strong\u003e - collect website links and portfolio URLs\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTextarea / Long Text\u003c/strong\u003e - multi-line text areas for messages, descriptions, and detailed responses\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePassword Field\u003c/strong\u003e - secure password input for registration and login forms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCountry Selector\u003c/strong\u003e - dropdown with country list for international forms and geo-targeting\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRating Field\u003c/strong\u003e - star rating or numeric rating input for reviews and feedback forms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNet Promoter Score (NPS)\u003c/strong\u003e - NPS scale input for customer satisfaction and loyalty surveys\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSlider / Range Input\u003c/strong\u003e - adjustable slider for budget ranges, quantities, and preference scales\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e🛡️ CAPTCHA \u0026amp; Spam Protection - Block Bots, Keep Submissions Clean\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt-in spam protection and bot prevention with five CAPTCHA options - no need for separate CAPTCHA plugins or components like those required with SupportRetriever Forms or PlumSpace Form Builder:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGoogle reCAPTCHA\u003c/strong\u003e - the most widely used CAPTCHA service for spam filtering and bot detection\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ehCaptcha\u003c/strong\u003e - privacy-focused CAPTCHA alternative for GDPR-compliant form protection\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCloudflare Turnstile\u003c/strong\u003e - invisible, user-friendly CAPTCHA for frictionless spam prevention\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNumber CAPTCHA\u003c/strong\u003e - simple number-based challenge, no third-party service required\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMathematical CAPTCHA\u003c/strong\u003e - arithmetic-based verification for lightweight bot blocking\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo more junk submissions. No more bot spam. Your form data stays clean and reliable.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e📎 File Upload \u0026amp; Media Attachments - Collect Any File Type\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eLet your users attach and upload files directly through your forms:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDocument uploads (PDF, DOCX, TXT, CSV, XLS)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eImage uploads (JPG, PNG, GIF, SVG, WEBP)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAudio uploads (MP3, WAV, OGG)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eVideo uploads (MP4, MOV, AVI, WEBM)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAny custom file type you need\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect for job application forms, support request forms, client onboarding forms, quote request forms with attachments, portfolio submission forms, and feedback forms with screenshots.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e🎨 Full Design Control - Match Your Brand Perfectly\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eStyle every element of your form to match your Framer website design. Customize fonts, colors, spacing, padding, borders, border radius, backgrounds, hover states, focus states, error states, success states, placeholder text, labels, button styles, and form layout - all natively within Framer's visual editor.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eUnlike iframe-based form tools like Tally Forms, Formflow, PlumSpace Form Builder, or Smartarget Popup Forms that embed external widgets into your site, Forms Plugin works 100% natively inside Framer. No external platforms loading inside your pages. No third-party styling conflicts. No slow-loading embedded forms. Your forms are part of your Framer project - not bolted on from the outside.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAnd unlike other native Framer form solutions like Framer Form Kit, FramerForms, or Framer Forms Connect, Forms Plugin gives you AI-powered form generation, 30+ field types, built-in CRM and newsletter integrations, and ready-made templates - all inside a single plugin. No need to combine multiple tools or install separate components.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo ugly iframes. No generic form widgets. No design compromises. Your form looks and feels like a native part of your website because it IS a native part of your website.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e📦 Ready-Made Form Templates - Start in Seconds\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eDon't start from scratch. Choose from professionally designed form templates for the most common use cases:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContact Form Template\u003c/strong\u003e - simple name, email, and message contact form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLead Generation Form Template\u003c/strong\u003e - high-converting lead capture form for landing pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClient Onboarding Form Template\u003c/strong\u003e - collect client details, project scope, and preferences\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEvent Registration Form Template\u003c/strong\u003e - event signup and RSVP form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSupport Request Form Template\u003c/strong\u003e - customer support and help desk ticket form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCustomer Feedback Form Template\u003c/strong\u003e - collect reviews, testimonials, and satisfaction ratings\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNewsletter Signup Form Template\u003c/strong\u003e - email subscription, mailing list, and newsletter form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuote Request Form Template\u003c/strong\u003e - service inquiry and price quote form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBooking Form Template\u003c/strong\u003e - appointment and meeting scheduling form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplication Form Template\u003c/strong\u003e - job application and submission form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOrder Form Template\u003c/strong\u003e - product order and purchase form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSurvey Form Template\u003c/strong\u003e - multi-question survey and poll form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRegistration Form Template\u003c/strong\u003e - user signup and account registration form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWaitlist Form Template\u003c/strong\u003e - early access and beta signup form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery template is fully customizable. Edit fields, change design, add or remove inputs - or just use AI to generate a custom form from your description.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e⚡ How It Works - 3 Simple Steps\u003c/h3\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOpen Forms Plugin\u003c/strong\u003e inside your Framer project\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChoose a template, use AI to generate a form, or build from scratch\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCustomize fields, connect CRM or newsletter integrations, and design\u003c/strong\u003e - then publish\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003eThat's it. Your form is live and connected to your CRM or newsletter platform. No server setup. No backend configuration. No external automation services needed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e🔍 Perfect For\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFreelancers and designers building client websites in Framer\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAgencies managing multiple Framer projects with form, CRM, and newsletter requirements\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSaaS companies adding lead capture forms connected to HubSpot or ActiveCampaign\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eE-commerce stores collecting orders and syncing leads to Klaviyo or Drip\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNewsletter creators growing their Beehiiv, Mailchimp, or ConvertKit subscriber lists\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStartups building waitlist, early access, and beta signup forms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePortfolios and personal websites adding contact and inquiry forms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eService businesses collecting quote requests, bookings, and appointments\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNonprofits and communities building volunteer, donation, and event registration forms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAnyone looking for a better alternative to Tally Forms, Formflow, PlumSpace Form Builder, Framer Form Kit, FramerForms, or Framer Forms Connect\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSupport\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNeed help? Our team is here to assist you.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupport: \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:team@formsplugin.com\"\u003eteam@formsplugin.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWebsite: \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://formsplugin.com/\"\u003ehttps://formsplugin.com/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e64:Ta34,\u003cp\u003eGenerate and edit images with AI directly in Framer. Create raster images, editable vectors, illustrations, icons, and logos for websites and web projects with Recraft AI models, including the latest \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.recraft.ai/blog/introducing-recraft-v4-design-taste-meets-image-generation?utm_source=external\u0026amp;utm_medium=plugins\u0026amp;utm_campaign=framer\"\u003eRecraft V4\u003c/a\u003e with built-in design taste and exceptional prompt understanding.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e30 credits (up to 30 images) available daily for free. More credits and advanced features are available on \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.recraft.ai/pricing\"\u003epaid plans\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eImage generation\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.recraft.ai/ai-image-generator?utm_source=external\u0026amp;utm_medium=plugins\u0026amp;utm_campaign=framer\"\u003eGenerate high-quality visuals\u003c/a\u003e using Recraft’s V3 and V4 model families. Create photorealistic images, illustrations, logos, icons, and product visuals.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eVector generation\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.recraft.ai/ai-vector-generator?utm_source=external\u0026amp;utm_medium=plugins\u0026amp;utm_campaign=framer\"\u003eGenerate clean SVG vectors\u003c/a\u003e with Recraft’s V3 Vector, V4 Vector, and V4 Vector Pro models. Create icons, logos, and scalable graphics for web projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eTemplates\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eBrowse curated collections of images with prompt examples inside the plugin. Use them as references or as a starting point for your own generations.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eVectorize images\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.recraft.ai/ai-image-vectorizer?utm_source=external\u0026amp;utm_medium=plugins\u0026amp;utm_campaign=framer\"\u003eConvert raster images\u003c/a\u003e into clean, scalable vector graphics ready for use in your designs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eBackground removal\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.recraft.ai/background-remover?utm_source=external\u0026amp;utm_medium=plugins\u0026amp;utm_campaign=framer\"\u003eRemove backgrounds\u003c/a\u003e in seconds to isolate objects and prepare assets for your projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eUpscaling and enhancement\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eImprove image quality and \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.recraft.ai/image-upscaler?utm_source=external\u0026amp;utm_medium=plugins\u0026amp;utm_campaign=framer\"\u003eupscale images\u003c/a\u003e up to 4K resolution with two options: • Crisp upscale to increase resolution • Creative upscale to enhance details, refine textures, and improve anatomy\u003c/p\u003e65:T7b9,\u003ch2\u003eHugeicons Icon Library for Framer\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eYour UI deserves icons that feel as good as the product you're building. Hugeicons gives designers and developers 50,000+ beautifully crafted icons — directly inside Framer, ready to use in seconds.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhat you get\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e5,000+ free SVG icons for personal and commercial use\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e50,000+ Pro icons across 59 categories\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMultiple icon styles including Stroke, Solid, Two-tone, Duotone, Bulk and more\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFast search and filtering by name, tag, style, and category\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne-click insert as editable SVG layers in Framer\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy to recolor, resize, and customize\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConsistent grid, stroke, and visual balance across your UI\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhy Hugeicons\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBroad coverage for product, marketing, and dashboard UIs\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt for speed: lightweight SVGs, instant preview, quick insert\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFree vs Pro\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFREE: 5,000+ icons, all 59 categories\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePro: 50,000+ icons, all styles and categories, priority updates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUpgrade in‑plugin (optional)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eGetting started\u003c/h2\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInstall the plugin in Framer\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpen the plugin → search or browse\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePick a style and click Insert\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRecolor/resize the SVG in Framer as needed\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003ch2\u003eSupport \u0026amp; Policy\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWebsite \u0026amp; docs: \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://hugeicons.com/\"\u003ehttps://hugeicons.com/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmail: \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:hugeicons@halallab.co\"\u003ehugeicons@halallab.co\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLicensing: Free icons usable in personal/commercial projects; Pro requires an active license. See full license on our site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrivacy: The plugin fetches icon metadata and SVGs from Hugeicons servers; we don’t upload your project content.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e66:Tb2a,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://dub.frameauth.com/Z7e8Ozl\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eSign Up Free\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eQuickstart:\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://frameauth.com/guides-v2/quickstart\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eAdd FrameAuth to your site in minutes.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFrameAuth Templates (Free \u0026amp; Paid)\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://frameauth.com/powered-by-framerauth\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eExplore templates powered by FrameAuth\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eOverview\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eFrameAuth enables membership functionality in Framer effortlessly without writing any code. With just a few clicks, visitors can purchase your digital products, sign up for an account, and unlock exclusive content.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeal for creators who want to restrict access to premium content, manage memberships, sell products, or create personalized experiences for their users—all without needing technical expertise.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://framerauth.com/pricing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eView pricing\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eKey Features\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContent Gating: Easily restrict access to specific pages or sections until a user completes a purchase or signs up.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSeamless Integration: Designed to work natively with all Framer sites.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustomizable Authentication: Drag and drop our sign-in, sign-up, forgot password, user accounts, and sign-up components into your site then customize to match your site’s branding.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct-Specific Access: Restrict access to content based on the purchase of specific products.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOverrides for Flexibility: Overrides allow you to easily customize the content on your site to create the ideal membership experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eSupport\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor questions and help, please visit our support page to chat with our team.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://frameauth.com/support\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eGo to support\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eTypes of Auth\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePurchase required: Require a purchase via Stripe or Lemon Squeezy in order to access to locked content.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSign-up required: Allow any visitor to sign up and create an account on your website before granting access to locked content.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eComponents Available\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSign in\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSign in via OTP (one-time-password)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSign up\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eForgot Password\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUpdate Password\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMember Profile\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProfile Photo\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAction Button:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSign in/up with Google or GitHub\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLaunch checkout (Stripe, Lemon Squeezy)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSign out\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eRefund Policy\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://frameauth.com/refund-policy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e30-day refund guarantee\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e67:Tcd4,\u003ch2\u003eWhat\u0026#39;s new?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003eIntroducing Social Proof Sections\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eBeautiful, conversion-focused sections powered by your real Google reviews. Publish once, drop into Framer, and instantly add powerful social proof to your landing pages with modern, design-led layouts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully customisable section structure: \u003cstrong\u003eeyebrow, headline, body copy, review content, and CTA\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned to \u003cstrong\u003espan the full page width\u003c/strong\u003e and take meaningful visual real estate\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt for \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-impact conversion zones\u003c/strong\u003e such as hero follow-ups, mid-page proof blocks, and pre-CTA reinforcement\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eSocial Proof Sections are available exclusively to \u003cstrong\u003ePro \u003c/strong\u003eand \u003cstrong\u003eEnterprise\u003c/strong\u003e users.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eCkLbvK37RE\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eCkLbvK37RE?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRevuKit\u003c/strong\u003e lets you add live Google review widgets to Framer using a \u003cstrong\u003enative Code Component\u003c/strong\u003e — no embeds, no manual styling.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnect your Google Business once, Reviews auto-sync in the background, so your site always shows your latest social proof.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhy RevuKit?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNative Framer Code Component with insert-to-canvas\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign-first widgets built for modern Framer sites\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eResponsive by default\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGoogle reviews stay automatically synced — no imports, ever\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOnly your best reviews are shown\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWidgets for every layout: compact badges, full-width review pages, animated mosaic galleries and more\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePricing\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eBasic — Free\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAll widgets · Up to 5 random reviews · 250 views/month · RevuKit watermark · Monthly review refresh · \u003cstrong\u003eNo\u003c/strong\u003e AI · \u003cstrong\u003eNo\u003c/strong\u003e Social Proof Sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePro — Free\u003c/strong\u003e for 14 days then - \u003cstrong\u003e$9/month\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAll widgets · Many reviews · 50,000 views/month · Best reviews only · No watermark · All future widgets included · Daily review refresh · AI integration · All Social Proof Sections (new) · Up to 5 connected businesses\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnterprise — Free\u003c/strong\u003e for 14 days then - \u003cstrong\u003e$30/month\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEverything in Pro · Unlimited views · Up to 15 connected businesses\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eExplore plans and widgets \u003ca href=\"https://www.revukit.com/framer-pricing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eHelpful links\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.revukit.com/framer/complete-guide-to-framer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://www.revukit.com/framer/complete-guide-to-framer\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.revukit.com/framer/complete-guide-to-framer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://www.revukit.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://localhost:3000/framer/google-review-widgets-framer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e/framer/google-review-widgets-framer\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e68:T1227,\u003cp\u003eMore details: \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://framercmsfilter.com/?utm=marketplace\"\u003ehttps://framercmsfilter.com/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDemo: \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://framercmsfilter.com/demo?demo=template-store\"\u003eLive Demos - Framer CMS Filter\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eRecent Reviews\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/599-framer-cms-filter-Jc8L5fdL5afh4zr8kEllvwjjCWoAtE\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFramer CMS Filter\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdvanced Multi-Filter \u0026amp; Search System for Framer CMS — Without Code.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFramer CMS Filter gives you \u003cstrong\u003ereal-time, multi-condition filtering and search\u003c/strong\u003e for your CMS collections. No more duplicate variants, messy overrides, or limited single filters. Just clean, scalable filtering that works out of the box — and looks great on every site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re building a portfolio, directory, or real estate site — this plugin makes it easy for your visitors to find what they want fast.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e💡 Why You Need This\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFramer’s built-in CMS filtering is limited — it only allows one condition per filter (e.g., category \u003cem\u003eor\u003c/em\u003e tag). That means:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou can’t combine multiple filters (e.g., “UI Design” + “Case Study” + “2024”).\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou can’t filter by price range, location, or multiple tags.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou can’t create advanced search + filter pages like real-world sites use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFramer CMS Filter fixes all that.\u003c/strong\u003eNow you can create \u003cstrong\u003emulti-filter, multi-category, live search\u003c/strong\u003e experiences like modern e-commerce and directory sites — all within Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e⚙️ Key Features\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e✅ \u003cstrong\u003eReal-Time Multi-Filtering\u003c/strong\u003eInstantly filters CMS items based on multiple categories, tags, or custom fields — without page reloads.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✅ \u003cstrong\u003eSearch + Filter Combo\u003c/strong\u003eCombine live search input with category, tag, or custom dropdowns to create flexible filtering systems.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✅ \u003cstrong\u003eQuery-String Sync (Deep Linking)\u003c/strong\u003eFilters stay in the URL (coming soon) — perfect for shareable searches and SEO-friendly pages.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✅ \u003cstrong\u003eInstant Setup (Copy \u0026amp; Paste Ready) \u003c/strong\u003eCopy the components from your Framer CMS Filter dashboard or use the plugin to insert them directly into your canvas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✅ \u003cstrong\u003eFully Customizable Controls: \u003c/strong\u003eChange layout, design, typography, spacing, and animations directly from Framer’s property controls — no extra styling needed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✅ \u003cstrong\u003eResponsive by Default\u003c/strong\u003eWorks across all breakpoints.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✅ \u003cstrong\u003ePerformance Optimized\u003c/strong\u003eUses real-time JS store updates with minimal re-rendering for smooth UX even with large CMS lists.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✅ \u003cstrong\u003ePlug-and-Play Plugin\u003c/strong\u003eYou can add filters directly inside Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e🧠 Perfect For\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAgencies \u0026amp; freelancers\u003c/strong\u003e building client sites with CMS collections.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePortfolio sites\u003c/strong\u003e with category/tag filters.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBlogs\u003c/strong\u003e with topic search and category filters.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDirectories\u003c/strong\u003e or \u003cstrong\u003emarketplaces\u003c/strong\u003e with location or type filters.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEcommerce - (filter by price, brand, stock etc)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReal estate\u003c/strong\u003e or \u003cstrong\u003eproduct listings\u003c/strong\u003e (filter by bed, price, or features).\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e⚡ How It Works\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e1️⃣ \u003cstrong\u003eInsert component: \u003c/strong\u003eUse the plugin to insert “CMS Filter” directly into your project.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2️⃣ \u003cstrong\u003eConnect your CMS collection\u003c/strong\u003eSelect your CMS data source (blog, portfolio, listings).\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3️⃣ \u003cstrong\u003eMap your filters: \u003c/strong\u003eAssign fields like category, tags, or price.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e4️⃣ \u003cstrong\u003eCustomize design: \u003c/strong\u003eUse Framer’s built-in controls for layout, colors, and spacing.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e5️⃣ \u003cstrong\u003ePreview live filtering: \u003c/strong\u003eHit preview, see instant filtering and search in action.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e💬 What Users Are Saying\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e“It’s easy to integrate into an existing project and customise”— \u003cem\u003eRick, Framer Designer\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e“I built a car rental site with 6 filters using this. Works perfectly and super fast.”— \u003cem\u003eJulien, Agency Owner\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e300+ designers and agencies are already using our products to ship sites faster and close more client deals.Have questions or need support, contact us via \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://framercmsfilter.com/contact\"\u003ehttps://framercmsfilter.com/contact\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e69:T8ee,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImageFX: bake dither, halftone, ASCII and pixel effects into your images\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTurn any image on your Framer canvas into print style artwork. Pick a preset, judge it with the Before and After slider, then apply. The effect bakes into a clean PNG, so your site ships a plain image with zero runtime cost.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat you get\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e4 engines: Halftone · Dither · ASCII · Pixel\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e2 modes. Engine replaces the image. Filter lays ink over the photo with coverage bands, polarity, opacity and blends\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e56 presets from the Frameion component line: Newsprint · Solar · Press · Bisect · Poster · Starlight · Process (CMYK) · Noir · Pop · Etch · Mono Print · Statue · Amber LED · CRT · Blueprint · Emberglow · Frost · Acid · Amber · Bitmap · Editorial · Truecolor · Ink · Ghost · Blur · Emissive · Neon · Datastream · Mosaic · Eight Bit · Dot Matrix · Lite Brite and more\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e18 measured ASCII charsets from Braille to Katakana\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMulti level dithering with 2 to 6 tones, square, dot and glow marks\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMYK separations at real press angles, duotone inks, rotated screens\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBig preview with Fit and 100% zoom and drag to pan\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eResolution normalized: identical results at any image size\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor heroes, portfolio cards, product shots and social graphics.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFree and licensed\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInstall free from this page. The free version is the full plugin with watermarked exports and 3 applies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eA license unlocks unlimited watermark free exports. One time $19 from the Upgrade button inside the plugin, no subscription\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eYour key works on 3 devices and updates are free for life\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmail support: \u003ca href=\"mailto:support@premshandilya.com\"\u003esupport@premshandilya.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLicense:\u003c/strong\u003e Single user license. Use ImageFX in unlimited personal and commercial Framer projects, including client work. Reselling, redistributing or repackaging the plugin is not permitted.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRefunds:\u003c/strong\u003e Try the free version first. License purchases are non refundable. If anything does not work as shown, email me and I will fix it fast.\u003c/p\u003e6a:T4c2,\u003cp\u003eBring your Framer sites to life with stunning, highly customizable WebGL shaders and dynamic gradients. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFrameShaders gives you access to a massive library of premium, interactive backgrounds that you can drop directly onto your canvas with a single click.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eAll thanks to Shaders by Paper for providing these awesome shaders.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMassive Shader Library\u003c/strong\u003e: Access over 40+ unique, high-quality shaders including mesmerizing 3D effects, fluid mesh gradients, and geometric patterns.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive Previews\u003c/strong\u003e: Browse and preview every shader in real-time before adding them to your project.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDeep Customization\u003c/strong\u003e: Easily tweak colors, animation speeds, geometry, and styling parameters directly inside the plugin to perfectly match your brand.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOne-Click Import\u003c/strong\u003e: Generate production-ready React components that insert seamlessly onto your Framer canvas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOptimized Performance\u003c/strong\u003e: Built specifically for Framer with lazy-loaded canvases and Intersection Observers to ensure your final site remains lightning-fast.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e6b:T82e,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBridging the gap between your Figma designs and Framer projects.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eStop wasting time manually copying hex codes, recreating text styles, and managing dark mode variants across platforms. Figma Sync is the ultimate bridge between your design tool and your Framer canvas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith just a single Figma File URL, this plugin instantly scans your design and generates native, fully-linked Framer Color and Text styles in seconds.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"sparkles\"\u003e✨\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e Key Features\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstant Style Import:\u003c/strong\u003e Automatically pull in all your solid colors and typography settings directly from your Figma file.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Dark Mode Mapping:\u003c/strong\u003e Names your Figma colors with \u0026quot;Light\u0026quot; or \u0026quot;Dark\u0026quot; prefixes? Figma Sync intelligently pairs them together to automatically generate Framer styles with built-in Light and Dark themes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNative Framer Styles:\u003c/strong\u003e Creates true Framer Color Styles and Text Styles—meaning if you update the style later, it updates everywhere across your entire Framer site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSecure OAuth:\u003c/strong\u003e Uses Figma\u0026#39;s official OAuth to securely connect to your account without ever storing your data.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNative UI:\u003c/strong\u003e Built with a clean interface that seamlessly adapts to Framer’s own light and dark mode for a native feel.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"rocket\"\u003e🚀\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e How to use\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConnect:\u003c/strong\u003e Log in with your Figma account directly inside the plugin.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eActivate:\u003c/strong\u003e Enter your \u003ca href=\"http://Polar.sh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ePolar.sh\u003c/a\u003e license key.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePaste:\u003c/strong\u003e Grab your Figma File URL (Click \u003cem\u003eShare\u003c/em\u003e -\u0026gt; \u003cem\u003eCopy Link\u003c/em\u003e in Figma) and paste it into the plugin.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSync:\u003c/strong\u003e Hit \u0026quot;Sync Figma File\u0026quot; and watch your Framer assets panel populate instantly!\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e6c:T9a5,\u003ch2\u003eFrameshop: The Ultimate E-commerce Plugin for Framer\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eUnlock the full potential of your Framer site with Frameshop, the all-in-one solution for building a complete, customized e-commerce experience. Tailored for designers, developers, and entrepreneurs, Frameshop lets you transform any Framer project into a professional online store with ease.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCustomizable Components\u003c/strong\u003e: Enjoy total design freedom by tailoring every aspect of your store to align with your brand. From product listings to checkout, each component is fully adaptable.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Product \u0026amp; Stock Management:\u003c/strong\u003e Easily manage your products and inventory within Framer’s CMS, allowing you to track stock levels and prevent overselling. Sync with Stripe for real-time, secure transactions. With just a single click, keep your store and inventory updated.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMulti-product Checkout\u003c/strong\u003e: Offer a streamlined shopping experience with Frameshop’s Cart and Checkout components, designed to handle multiple items effortlessly. Let your customers shop with confidence as they enjoy a smooth, intuitive interface.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntegrated Sales Tracking\u003c/strong\u003e: Stay on top of your store’s performance with built-in daily sales tracking. View your progress directly in Framer to make data-driven decisions that boost your business.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFlexible Payment Options\u003c/strong\u003e: Set up and manage payment methods directly within Stripe, offering a variety of choices to your customers. Secure payment processing is built-in, ensuring a safe experience for both you and your customers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOptional Customer Details Collection\u003c/strong\u003e: Collect customer addresses and phone numbers as needed to personalize the shopping experience. Enable or disable these features based on your requirements.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith Frameshop, there’s no need for coding or complex setups. Simply add our components to your Framer project, customize them to suit your needs, and watch your e-commerce vision come to life. Join a community of creative professionals who have already discovered the convenience and power of Frameshop.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eStart building the online store you’ve always envisioned—quickly, flexibly, and with complete control over every detail. Frameshop is your gateway to a customized e-commerce experience right within Framer.\u003c/p\u003e6d:T76d,\u003ch2\u003eFramer to React Exporter\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWarning\u003c/strong\u003e: To use this plugin you need React development knowledge. This plugin also requires a $50 (personal hobby plan) or $250 (commercial use plan) monthly subscription. If you are an open source project or non-profit organization you can get a discount by sending a message to the email on the right.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFramer to React Exporter\u003c/strong\u003e is a powerful plugin that bridges the gap between Framer’s intuitive design environment and your production-ready React codebase. By selecting components directly in the Framer interface and then running the `unframer` CLI, you’ll instantly have fully typed React components—ready to integrate into your Next.js, Remix, or any other modern React framework.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eKey Features\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull Type Safety\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAuto-Completed Props \u0026amp; Variables\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResponsive Breakpoints\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReusable Across Frameworks\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow It Works\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. \u003cstrong\u003eDesign in Framer:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eStart by crafting your UI in Framer’s visual editor—create headers, footers, banners, hero sections, and more.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. \u003cstrong\u003eSelect Components to Export:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePick which components you want to bring into your codebase. This can be an entire section of your site or just a small UI element.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3. \u003cstrong\u003eRun the `unframer` CLI:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eUsing the CLI, download the components as React files, accompanied by their `.d.ts` files for strict type checking and smooth developer experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e4. \u003cstrong\u003eIntegrate into Your Project:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eImport the generated components into your React project. You can fine-tune their styling, integrate them into your SSR setup, or even attach event handlers—like `onClick` or custom callbacks—directly in your code.\u003c/p\u003e6e:T8a2,\u003cp\u003e3Drop is the fastest way to bring 3D into your Framer projects. Turn images into AI-generated 3D models, or any SVG into 3D for free. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eUpload an image, generate a production-ready 3D model with AI, and drop it straight onto your canvas. No 3D software. No export pipelines. No technical overhead.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eMultiple 3D AI models, one plugin\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eChoose from a curated set of powerful generation engines including Tripo, Hunyuan, Meshy, Rodin, and Trellis. Single photo or multiple reference angles, 3Drop gives you the right tool for the job. Every model comes back fully textured and ready to use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSVG to 3D. Free. Forever\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrop any SVG into 3Drop and get back a fully 3D extruded model in seconds. Keep the original fill colors, adjust depth, metalness, and roughness, then add it straight to your Framer canvas. Your logo, your icons, your illustrations. All in 3D. No credits needed, no strings attached.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWeb-ready from the start\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery generated model is automatically compressed and optimized the moment it's created. You get beautiful 3D that actually performs in live Framer projects, without touching a single export setting.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eDrop it on the canvas, use it live\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eModels land on your canvas as native Framer code component instances. They're interactive, they're live, and they work exactly like anything else you'd build in Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePreview any model in the built-in 3D viewer before you commit\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOrbit, inspect, then insert with one click\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eYour full generation history lives inside the plugin, come back to any model anytime\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRe-insert, download the GLB, or drag straight onto the canvas whenever you need it\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eAlready have 3D assets?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe built-in GLB optimizer lets you upload any existing model and get back a compressed, web-ready version. Useful far beyond AI generation.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSimple, honest pricing\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo subscription. Ever. Buy credit packs when you need them and use them at your own pace. Every new account starts with 10 free credits so you can see what 3Drop can do before spending a thing.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e3D used to be a specialist skill. Now it's a Framer plugin.\u003c/h3\u003e6f:T587,\u003cp\u003eLayerwave adds production-ready realtime WebGL effects to your Framer site — interactive distortion and refraction that normally need shaders development.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBrowse the effect gallery, preview it live, pick an art-directed preset, and click Add to Canvas. The component is installed into your project automatically — you never paste code or copy a URL. Every parameter stays editable from Framer\u0026#39;s property panel afterwards.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded\u003c/strong\u003e • Liquid Media — an image or video deformed by cursor movement, with velocity-driven flow, chromatic aberration and idle motion. 6 presets. • Glass Lens — a refractive glass surface with shaped silhouettes, dispersion, frost, contour and highlights. 5 presets.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt for production\u003c/strong\u003e • Pauses when off-screen or when the tab is hidden • Lazy media loading, capped device pixel ratio, automatic quality tiers • Respects prefers-reduced-motion, with an optional mobile off switch • Full GPU cleanup — no leaks when instances are added and removed\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEffects render on the canvas as static media so the editor stays fast; flip Canvas Preview on any instance to art-direct it live. Glass Lens refracts the media you give it. Requires WebGL2.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTry it live here → \u003ca href=\"https://layerwave.netlify.app/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://layerwave.netlify.app/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e70:T7ff,\u003cp\u003ePageLock is the only Framer plugin where locked content never reaches the browser. Other tools hide pages with CSS or JavaScript, bypassed by viewing source. PageLock serves password-protected pages from a secure server only after a visitor signs in, so your gated content is never in the HTML, sitemap, or Google\u0026#39;s index. Real server-side protection, not a client-side CSS overlay.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSetup: pick a page, set a password, publish. No code required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLock a single page, multiple pages in one group, CMS pages and collections, or individual CMS items. Use it for a private page, hidden page, members only area, client portal, coming soon page, or gated content. Put a password gate on any page, restrict access, or make a page access controlled.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eProtect portfolio work before it is public: set a portfolio password on case studies, client work, a staging site, or a draft page.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eProtected Groups: one login for many pages. Create a group, add pages, and protect them all with one set of credentials. Visitors sign in once and get every page in the group. Sessions are scoped per group.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLock anything, including the CMS: pages, templates, whole collections, or single CMS items on their own slug. Lock one blog post, product, or download without locking the rest.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAuthentication your way: PIN code, passcode, username/password, magic link, multiple users per lock, or request-to-access. Visitors unlock with a password or PIN, with built-in recovery.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBranded login screens with your colors, fonts, and logo. White-label removes all Proofly branding. Automatic backups included; visitors stay signed in for 24 hours.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFree to start: lock pages on your staging domain with a PIN at no cost, the same server-side engine Pro uses. Pro unlocks your custom domain, full authentication (password, OTP, multiple users), and white-label branding. $15.99/mo or $159/yr, backed by a 7 day money back guarantee.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePassword-protect one page, a group, or your whole CMS. Every locked page is a secure page.\u003c/p\u003e71:T9a8,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstagram Feed\u003c/strong\u003e puts your live Instagram on your Framer site. Paste a handle, pick a layout, insert it on the canvas. New posts sync in on their own from then on.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo Instagram login, no Meta app review, no API keys, no token to renew. Any public profile works, yours or a client\u0026#39;s.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe only Instagram feed plugin you can buy once instead of renting forever.\u003c/strong\u003e Lifetime is $35, paid once. No subscription, ever.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhy Instagram Feed?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003e6 designed layouts\u003c/strong\u003e: Profile, Grid, Slider, a depth-blurred Carousel, an auto-scrolling Marquee and a fanned Rainbow deck. Built for Instagram, not adapted from a generic gallery.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eReal Framer controls\u003c/strong\u003e: columns, gap, corner radius and post count, right in the panel.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eA proper lightbox\u003c/strong\u003e: full caption, likes, date, carousel slides, video playback and arrow-key navigation.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eCurated mode\u003c/strong\u003e: hand-pick from your last 50 posts and lock the exact grid.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eNothing to maintain\u003c/strong\u003e: images are proxied and cached on our servers, so Instagram\u0026#39;s expiring URLs can never break your published site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eHow it works\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003ePaste a handle\u003c/strong\u003e: live preview with real posts, before you pay.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003ePick a layout\u003c/strong\u003e: flip through all six on your own feed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eInsert to canvas\u003c/strong\u003e: a real code component, auto-sized and styled.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003ePublish\u003c/strong\u003e: it keeps itself current after that.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTry every layout on a live feed: \u003ca href=\"https://vanssay.net/instagram-preview\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://vanssay.net/instagram-preview\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePricing\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLifetime, $35 once\u003c/strong\u003e: 2 feeds · up to 12 posts · weekly auto-sync · 50,000 views/mo · priority support\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003ewith a 7-day free trial\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStarter, $7.99/mo\u003c/strong\u003e: 1 feed · up to 18 posts · daily auto-sync · 10,000 views/mo\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePro, $17.99/mo\u003c/strong\u003e: 3 feeds · up to 18 posts · daily auto-sync · 50,000 views/mo · priority support\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eExtra feeds are $29 one-time on Pro and Lifetime. One plan covers all your Framer projects. Cancel anytime.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLinks\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWebsite: \u003ca href=\"https://vanssay.net/instagram\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://vanssay.net/instagram\u003c/a\u003e · Support: \u003ca href=\"mailto:support@vanssay.net\"\u003esupport@vanssay.net\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e72:T41e,\u003cp\u003eAuraBG generates beautiful mesh gradient and grain backgrounds directly inside Framer. Simply pick your desired aspect ratio and the plugin fills it with a stunning, atmospheric background.. ready to use on any frame.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeatures\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Generate mesh gradients and grain-textured backgrounds instantly\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Choose your aspect ratio and let AuraBG fill it automatically\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Works directly on your Framer canvas\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Lightweight and fast with no external dependencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHow to Use\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. Open the plugin from the Framer plugin panel\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. Select your preferred aspect ratio\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3. Customize the gradient style and grain intensity\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e4. Click generate.. your background is placed instantly on the canvas\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupport\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMade by \u003ca href=\"https://www.framer.com/@reem-magdi/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eReem\u003c/a\u003e. If something is not working or you have an idea, email \u003ca href=\"mailto:reem@ireem.net\"\u003ereem@ireem.net\u003c/a\u003e and I will take a look.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePricing\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFree.\u003c/p\u003e73:T797,\u003cp\u003eFREE DURING LAUNCH \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTranslo translates your Framer site with AI and writes every language into your project as real pages. French visitors land on /fr, Arabic visitors on /ar, on your own domain, inside your own project. Real pages Google can index, not a JavaScript overlay that search engines never see.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSetup: pick your languages, let the AI translate, review anything you want to change, publish. No code required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI translation that understands context. Translo reads your pages and translates them with tone and brand glossary control, so product names and brand terms stay exactly as you wrote them. Edit any sentence yourself and your edit is saved, never overwritten the next time you translate.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReal pages, real SEO. Every language gets its own URL with hreflang tags, so search engines know which version to serve to whom. Right to left languages including Arabic and Hebrew are supported, and every breakpoint you designed comes across with the page.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLocalize a landing page, a portfolio, a blog, or a full multilingual website. Website translation for headings, body text, buttons and navigation, across every page you choose. 41 languages available.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTranslation memory keeps a second run fast: only new or changed text is ever sent again, and anything you edited by hand is left alone.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eYour translations stay yours. Export everything as JSON whenever you like, and remove any language\u0026#39;s pages from your project in one action.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHow it works: Translo sends the text on your pages to Proofly\u0026#39;s servers, where AI translates it, then writes the results back into your project. Only the text is sent. No project name, no page addresses and no Framer identifiers ever leave the plugin. A free Proofly account is required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNot supported yet: CMS collection items, and styling applied to part of a sentence, such as one coloured word inside a heading, is not preserved.\u003c/p\u003e74:Te44,\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/Nn5l0GeJj-4\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Nn5l0GeJj-4?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eTutorial\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhat\u0026#39;s new?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e6 Layout Templates\u003c/strong\u003e — Choose from various layout styles and switch between them instantly from Framer\u0026#39;s property controls.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstagram-style Lightbox\u003c/strong\u003e — Click any post to open a full-size modal with the real Instagram layout: profile header, caption as comment, relative timestamps, likes count, and video playback with mute controls.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMore Options Menu\u003c/strong\u003e — Ellipsis menu on each lightbox post with quick links to view the original post on Instagram.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull Profile Header\u003c/strong\u003e — Displays avatar, handle, verified badge, bio, follower/following/post counts — just like the real Instagram profile page.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eRevuKit Instagram Feed\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eYour Instagram is social proof people actually believe. This plugin brings that proof directly into your Framer experience so it feels intentional, polished, and fully on-brand. Instead of sending visitors away, you keep them engaged on your site while they explore your latest content, feel your momentum, and gain the confidence to take action.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eShows real social proof exactly where visitors are deciding to trust you\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eKeeps people on your site longer by making content more engaging\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMakes your brand feel active, modern, and consistently updated\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHelps visitors see your product, culture, and customer love in real moments\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIncreases confidence before checkout, booking, or contact\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGives creators, founders, agencies, and local businesses a stronger “why choose us” section\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eQuestions? Feature requests? We\u0026#39;re here to help at \u003ca href=\"https://revukit.com/instagram-feed/support\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003erevukit.com/instagram-feed/support\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlready subscribed? Manage your subscription here - \u003ca href=\"https://www.revukit.com/instagram-feed/account\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003erevukit.com/instagram-feed/account\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eExamples\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://revukit-instagram-feed.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://revukit-instagram-feed.framer.website/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eHelpful links\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://revukit.com/framer/instagram-feed-framer-plugin-update\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://revukit.com/framer/instagram-feed-framer-plugin-update\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.revukit.com/framer/complete-guide-to-framer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://www.revukit.com/framer/complete-guide-to-framer\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrivacy Policy: \u003ca href=\"https://www.revukit.com/privacy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://www.revukit.com/privacy\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTerms and Conditions: \u003ca href=\"https://www.revukit.com/terms\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://www.revukit.com/terms\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFull data, provider, and runtime dependency disclosure: \u003ca href=\"https://www.revukit.com/framer/instagram-feed-disclosure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://www.revukit.com/framer/instagram-feed-disclosure\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e75:T70a,\u003ch2\u003eAdvanced CMS filters for Framer. Made simple. \u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupercharge your Framer CMS with advanced dynamic filtering, built for the CMS that needs to scale.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow It Works\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrop in the components you need, or run the setup wizard.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnect to your CMS collection.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStyle it to match your design.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePublish.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eTurn your CMS into a powerful search experience. Superfields lets you build advanced, fully customizable dynamic filtering experiences that let your visitors find the content they care for most, easily.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdvanced Filtering\u003c/strong\u003e - 23 components covering filtering, sorting and more. Stack and combine buttons, dropdowns, checkboxes, sliders, date pickers and more, to give visitors the best content search experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstant Sorting\u003c/strong\u003e - Let visitors reorder content by what matters most to them, from price and popularity to newest, oldest, rating or any custom CMS value.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFavoriting\u003c/strong\u003e - Add save and favoriting functionality to any CMS collection, so visitors can bookmark the content they want to return to later.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMap Upgrade\u003c/strong\u003e - Want maps too? Upgrade to Mapframe from inside the plugin and turn your CMS into a fully interactive map experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eComplete Control\u003c/strong\u003e - Control every filter and style everything to remain on brand, all inside Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eZero Code\u003c/strong\u003e - No technical setup required. Our plugin makes it too easy to build advanced CMS filters.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOne-Time Purchase\u003c/strong\u003e - No ongoing subscriptions. Pay once and it\u0026#39;s yours.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e76:Ta9c,\u003ch2\u003eAdd beautiful, fully customizable social feeds to any Framer site.\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeedSpring is a purpose-built social feed plugin for Framer that helps you \u003cstrong\u003eadd live Instagram, Google Reviews, TikTok, Dribbble and other feeds without ugly embeds or generic widgets.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuild your feed, choose a layout, paste it into Framer, and customize the design directly inside Framer. Adjust spacing, typography, colors, borders, radius and more so your feed matches your site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eInstagram, TikTok, Google Reviews and Dribbble feeds for Framer\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect for portfolios, agencies, SaaS sites, ecommerce stores, local businesses and client projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInstagram, Google Reviews, TikTok, Dribbble and more\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eComplete design control inside Framer\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePre-made responsive feed layouts\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustomize typography, spacing, colors, borders and radius\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAuto-sync your latest content\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFast global CDN delivery\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eZero layout shift\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUnlimited feed connections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo-code setup\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy FeedSpring?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMost social feed tools force you into slow widgets, limited layouts or ugly embeds that are hard to style.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeedSpring is different. It is built for Framer, so your feeds feel native to your website, not pasted on from a third-party tool.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eUse FeedSpring to showcase posts, highlight customer reviews, display social proof, keep marketing pages fresh, and bring real content into your Framer projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow It Works\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreate a feed in FeedSpring\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eChoose your platform\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCopy a Framer-ready component or layout\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePaste it into your Framer project\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdd your FeedSpring ID\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustomize the design in Framer\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePublish your site\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eBest For\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFramer websites\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAgency client projects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePortfolio websites\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSaaS landing pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStartup websites\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEcommerce stores\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLocal business websites\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRestaurant, café and hospitality websites\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreators and personal brands\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTemplate creators\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMarketing pages needing fresh social proof\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSupported Feeds\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInstagram\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGoogle Reviews\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTikTok\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDribbble\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMore platforms coming soon\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePricing\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFree to install with 1,000 views each month. Higher usage may require a FeedSpring plan.\u003c/p\u003e77:Tb47,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVanssay\u003c/strong\u003e brings your \u003cstrong\u003eGoogle and Trustpilot reviews\u003c/strong\u003e into Framer as a \u003cstrong\u003enative Code Component\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnect your business once and reviews \u003cstrong\u003eauto-sync\u003c/strong\u003e, so your site always shows your latest social proof. Pick a layout, drop it on the canvas, and it arrives already styled to match your site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhy Vanssay?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eGoogle + Trustpilot in one widget\u003c/strong\u003e — show either, or blend both into one feed\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eOne combined rating\u003c/strong\u003e — both scores merged into a single star average\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eMatches your site automatically\u003c/strong\u003e — reads your colors, fonts and radius; fine-tune after\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eLive preview\u003c/strong\u003e with your real reviews before you insert\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003e10 layouts\u003c/strong\u003e — from compact badges to review walls and animated mosaics\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e10 widget layouts\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eExplore them at \u003ca href=\"https://vanssay.net/reviews.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://vanssay.net/reviews\u003c/a\u003e or in the plugin\u0026#39;s Demo mode (no account needed).\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eHow it works\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eConnect\u003c/strong\u003e Google Business Profile and/or Trustpilot — just paste a link\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003ePick a layout\u003c/strong\u003e from the live gallery, previewed with your reviews\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eInsert\u003c/strong\u003e — auto-placed, auto-sized and matching your site\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eCustomize\u003c/strong\u003e anytime — colors, font, card size, radius, header, branding\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eBuilt for conversions \u0026amp; SEO\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eSEO stars\u003c/strong\u003e — widgets embed \u003ca href=\"http://schema.org\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eschema.org\u003c/a\u003e markup, so your rating can appear under your site in search\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eCuration\u003c/strong\u003e — pin your best reviews, hide the rest, set a minimum star rating\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eMulti-business\u003c/strong\u003e — manage up to 15 businesses from one account\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePricing\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFree\u003c/strong\u003e — 6 widgets · 1 business · combined Google + Trustpilot · 5 Google / 3 Trustpilot reviews · 300 views/mo · monthly refresh · \u0026quot;Powered by Vanssay\u0026quot; watermark\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePro — $9/mo \u003c/strong\u003e — all 10 widgets + future ones · 5 businesses · 25 reviews/platform · 50,000 views/mo · real-time auto-sync · best-reviews curation · SEO stars · \u003cstrong\u003eno watermark\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUltra — $29/mo\u003c/strong\u003e — all of Pro · 15 businesses · 50 reviews/platform · \u003cstrong\u003eunlimited views\u003c/strong\u003e · priority support\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne subscription covers all your Framer projects · 7-day money-back guarantee · cancel anytime.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLinks\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWebsite: \u003ca href=\"https://vanssay.net/reviews.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://vanssay.net/reviews\u003c/a\u003e · Support: \u003ca href=\"mailto:support@vanssay.net\"\u003esupport@vanssay.net\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e78:T448,\u003ch2\u003eThe ultimate icon library plugin for Framer\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eBrowse, customize and insert over 40,000 icons from 20+ popular free and open-source icon packs in one plugin. Insert icons directly into your project without leaving Framer. Complete with search, filter, and drag-and-drop functionality to speed up your design process.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eUse icons from Material UI, Tabler Icons, Lucide Icons, Simple Icons, and 20+ more icon sets in your websites.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eSearch and filter icons\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eIconStack has powerful search and filtering options to help you find the exact icon you need. Filter by outline, filled, rounded, sharp, and more icon styles in each icon pack. Pin your favorite icon packs to quickly access them again later.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eCustomize your icons\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eEdit the size and color of your icons before inserting to get a consistent look and style across your website.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e100% free\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eAll the icons in IconStack are from open-source icon packs. That’s why the plugin is completely free to use - no paywalls, sign-ups, or subscriptions. Just thousands of free icons for your websites.\u003c/p\u003e79:T461,\u003cp\u003eDesign faster with Grayblocks – your go-to library of professional blocks and components right inside Framer. Drag, drop, and customize ready-made components to create unique website designs without starting from scratch. Perfect for designers who want the speed of templates with the freedom of custom design.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eSections you will find:\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHero Area\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeatures\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContent\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePricing\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTestimonial/Review\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCTA\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBrand\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTeam\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHow It Works\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIntegration\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStats\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlog\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFAQ\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFooter\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eand many more...\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFeatures:\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasily Drag \u0026amp; Drop Inside Framer\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e1900+ Framer Components\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e1100+ Figma Components (Bonus)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e150+ Premium Figma Templates (Bonus)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully Customizable Blocks \u0026amp; Sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGet Weekly Updates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eResponsive Design Ready\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSmart Layout System\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e7a:Te3f,\u003ch2\u003eWhy Offload?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery new visitor downloads your heavy assets from Framer and it counts against your bandwidth. Offload moves those assets to its own infrastructure so your Framer meter barely moves. Real users see 90% less bandwidth usage after switching.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTrusted by 300+ Framer builders. 2 TB+ of bandwidth saved every month.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://offload.framercoder.com\"\u003e🌐 Learn more\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/aFbc1D_CQTs\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aFbc1D_CQTs?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" start=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/aFbc1D_CQTs\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eReduce Framer bandwidth once and for all\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch3\u003eHow It Works\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo technical setup. No workflow changes. Upload from your computer, pick assets from the canvas, offload CMS collections, or scan any live URL to find your heaviest files. Everything runs inside Framer. Drag, drop, optimize, insert, done.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAuto WebP Conversion — JPEG and PNG files auto-convert to WebP on upload. 50–90% smaller files, zero extra work.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eResponsive Image Optimization — Auto-generates tablet (1200px) and mobile (720px) variants with srcSet support. Visitors always download the right-sized file.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn-Framer Video Compression — Compress videos directly in Framer. Pick resolution (480p–2880p), adjust quality, strip audio, generate poster frames. No server upload needed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS Offloading — Offload images and videos from entire Framer CMS collections in bulk. Auto-creates organized folders per collection with full WebP and responsive variant support.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSite URL Scanner — Paste any live Framer site URL to detect and rank heavy assets by size and bandwidth impact. One-click offload per asset with estimated savings.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFolders \u0026amp; Asset Management — Search, sort, drag between folders, batch upload, bulk delete. Your complete media library inside Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCanvas \u0026amp; Batch Upload — Select one or more assets on the Framer canvas and offload in one click, or drop files from your computer onto any folder.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne-Click Insertion — Insert optimized assets (including tablet and mobile variants) straight back into your Framer canvas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBandwidth Savings Calculator — See real-time cost savings and track usage across projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGlobal CDN Delivery — Fast worldwide load times via Cloudflare's edge network.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWho Is Offload For?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFramer designers hitting bandwidth limits. Agencies managing multiple client sites with heavy video content. Solo creators building image-rich portfolios. Anyone getting bandwidth overage emails from Framer or trying to avoid upgrading to a higher Framer plan.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOffload scales from a single freelance site to a full agency workflow.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePricing\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eAll plans include unlimited bandwidth. You only pay for storage.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStarter (Free) — 250MB storage, 25 assets, 1 project\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreator — 5GB storage, unlimited assets, 10 projects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStudio — 50GB storage, unlimited assets, unlimited projects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAgency — 200GB storage, unlimited assets, unlimited projects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eStart free and upgrade anytime.\u003c/p\u003e7b:T70c,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor feedback please reach out to\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:parthgupta2008@gmail.com\"\u003eparthgupta2008@gmail.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFluidity helps you build responsive typography systems directly inside Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGenerate a complete fluid type scale from presets inspired by Tailwind, Material, Fluent, Carbon, Ant Design, Polaris, or your own custom ratio. Choose primary and secondary Framer library fonts, set your mobile-to-desktop viewport range, then create organized Framer Text Styles that scale smoothly with CSS clamp().\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo more manually nudging headings across breakpoints. No more rebuilding the same type system from scratch.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhat Fluidity does\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGenerate complete fluid type systems in seconds\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUse familiar preset scales or a custom modular scale\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePair primary and secondary Framer library fonts\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreate organized Framer Text Styles\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePreview the scaling curve before saving\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eScrub viewport widths to inspect exact font sizes\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCopy the generated clamp() CSS\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eApply fluid styles directly to selected text layers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePublish CSS clamp() rules automatically through Framer custom code\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eBuilt for real Framer workflows\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFluidity works with Framer Text Styles, so your typography stays reusable, editable, and organized. Use it for landing pages, client sites, product pages, design systems, and any project where type needs to behave across screens.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign the scale once. Let the browser handle the resizing.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFluidity’s preset scales are adapted for Framer workflows and are not official integrations with Tailwind, Material, Fluent, Carbon, Ant Design, or Polaris.\u003c/p\u003e7c:T870,\u003cp\u003eDesign Bridge MCP connects your project to AI assistants through the Model Context Protocol (MCP). It gives Claude, Cursor, and other MCP-compatible tools direct access to your canvas with 70 automation tools.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat it does:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCanvas\u003c/strong\u003e — Create and edit frames, text, images, and SVGs. Full layout control with stack and grid (columns, rows, spans, alignment), padding, gap, border, borderRadius, opacity, overflow, aspect ratio, and text truncation. Traverse the node tree, query by type, move nodes between parents, read bounding boxes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eComponents\u003c/strong\u003e — List project components and insert instances.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Tokens\u003c/strong\u003e — Read, create, update, and delete color styles and text styles. Browse fonts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePages\u003c/strong\u003e — List, create design pages and web pages.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCode Files\u003c/strong\u003e — List, read, create, and update TypeScript/JSX code files.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCMS\u003c/strong\u003e — Full CRUD for collections, items, fields, redirects, and enum cases. Create new collections. Rich text (formattedText) fields supported.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLocalization\u003c/strong\u003e — Read locale settings and translation groups.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProject\u003c/strong\u003e — Get project info, publish status, locales, and custom code.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRoadmap (coming soon):\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eText styling (fontSize, color, lineHeight) — pending Framer SDK support\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBreakpoint-aware editing (Desktop/Tablet/Phone)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBackground images and gradients on frames\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eServer API integration for expanded capabilities\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow to use:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInstall the plugin and open it in your project.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCopy the connection URL shown in the plugin.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClick \"Show Setup Guide\" for step-by-step instructions for Claude Code, Claude Desktop, or Cursor.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStart giving your AI instructions — it will read and modify your design directly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eBuilt and maintained by Orange Lamp Studio LLC.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e7d:T4eb,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFramer Crystal Clean\u003c/strong\u003e is the maintenance tool every Framer project needs. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs your site grows, unused components pile up, hidden layers stay forgotten, images stay uncompressed, and variant libraries bloat, slowing down your workflow and your site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eClean my Framer gives you a clear view of what's cluttering your project and lets you remove it instantly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHere’s what you get:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImage optimization\u003c/strong\u003e : Compress frame background images and CMS collection images to WebP. Set your compression level (80–100%) and apply it across every matching frame or CMS field in one click.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClean hidden layers\u003c/strong\u003e : Find and delete layers that are hidden across all breakpoints (Desktop, Phone, Tablet) — no more invisible dead weight.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClean unused resources\u003c/strong\u003e : Identify and remove unused components, text styles, and color styles that accumulate over time.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCheck used resources\u003c/strong\u003e : Get a full audit of which resources are actually being used in your project.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClean unused variants\u003c/strong\u003e : Remove variant combinations you no longer need and keep your component library tight.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e7e:T4ef,\u003ch2\u003eOverview\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eStay on top of your website’s performance with the Google Search Console plugin for Framer. This tool brings essential analytics directly into your design workspace, helping you monitor and optimize your site effortlessly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003ePerformance Insights on the Canvas\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eView your site’s performance directly within Framer’s canvas. No need to switch between tabs – access crucial data while you design.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eReal-Time Metrics and Graphs\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eTrack real-time clicks and impressions with detailed numbers and visual graphs. Instantly see how your site is performing and make data-driven decisions on the spot.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eTop Search Queries\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eUnderstand what’s driving traffic to your site by viewing your top search queries. Get insights into how visitors are finding your website, and optimize content accordingly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith real-time updates and detailed analytics, the Google Search Console plugin empowers you to optimize your site’s performance seamlessly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimer:\u003c/strong\u003e This plugin is not provided by, sponsored by, or endorsed by Google. It is not authorized by or affiliated with Google in any way. All trademarks, service marks, and company names are the property of their respective owners.\u003c/p\u003e7f:T8f8,\u003ch2\u003eOverview\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned specifically for Framer, \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.framer.com/workshop\"\u003eWorkshop\u003c/a\u003e bridges the gap between design vision and development reality, empowering everyone, regardless of coding experience, to turn ideas into working components. The intuitive chat interface enables rapid iteration, real-time refinements, and smart suggestions to continually enhance your creations.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/JJFRmHFcbD4\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JJFRmHFcbD4?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" start=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/JJFRmHFcbD4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eA brief overview of Workshop\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith Workshop, complex ideas become achievable, from interactive visuals to dynamic functionality––all without touching code. Create animated WebGL gradients, region-specific cookie banners, pricing calculators, multi-step forms, interactive quizzes, and image comparison tools directly within Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow it works\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSimply describe what you need in conversation and watch as Workshop generates your component in real-time. Refine it through simple chat instructions, then customize appearance using Framer's familiar property controls. Whether you\u003cstrong\u003e’\u003c/strong\u003ere experimenting creatively or building reusable utility components, Workshop is your conversational partner, helping you turn great ideas into reality, quickly and intelligently.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XmdLdYujuRI\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XmdLdYujuRI?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" start=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" data-youtube-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XmdLdYujuRI\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eLearn how to create your first Workshop component\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e80:T66b,\u003cp\u003eStop copying and pasting data. This plugin connects your Framer website directly to your Supabase PostgreSQL database, allowing you to import hundreds of rows into a Framer Managed Collection in seconds.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you are building a real estate directory, a product catalog, or a dynamic blog, this tool bridges your backend data with your frontend design seamlessly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eKey Features:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInstant Sync: Pull data from any Supabase table directly into a Framer CMS collection.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSmart Field Mapping: Automatically map database columns (like text, booleans, dates, and image URLs) to the correct Framer CMS field types.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSafe Data Coercion: Built-in safeguards ensure that empty fields or mismatched data types won't break your site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBatch Processing: Capable of handling large databases with safe, chunked data syncing to prevent crashes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo-Code Friendly: Just paste your Supabase URL and Anon Key, pick a table, and click sync!\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eHow it works:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEnter your Supabase Project URL and Service Role Key (saved locally \u0026amp; securely).\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eChoose the table you want to sync.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSelect your unique URL slug field.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAuto-map your fields (or adjust them manually).\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHit Sync!\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eStop dealing with CSV exports and manual copy-pasting. Supercharge your Framer sites with Supabase today.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eQuestions \u0026amp; Support:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReach out anytime at \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:hello@sillyweb.in\"\u003ehello@sillyweb.in\u003c/a\u003e — I'm happy to help.\u003c/p\u003e81:T87c,\u003ch2\u003eMapQ — Multi-Location Map Plugin for Framer\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003eCreate beautiful, interactive, and fully customizable multi-location maps directly in Framer with MapQ.\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eMapQ is a powerful multi-location map plugin for Framer that makes it easy to create interactive, engaging, and customizable map experiences without complicated setup or custom development.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdd multiple locations to a single map and showcase each place with custom markers, titles, descriptions, addresses, and other useful information. Visitors can explore locations directly on the map and quickly find the details they need.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdd and manage multiple locations on one interactive map \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreate custom markers for different locations\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDisplay detailed information for each location\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdd addresses, descriptions, and location details\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupport interactive map exploration\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdd routes and location-based navigation\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustomize the map to match your website design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eResponsive experience across desktop, tablet, and mobile\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy setup and configuration\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt specifically for Framer projects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePerfect For\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eMapQ is ideal for business websites, office directories, store locators, real estate websites, property listings, travel and tourism websites, hotels, restaurants, events, venues, local business directories, service-area businesses, and location guides.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eBuilt for Framer\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eMapQ fits naturally into your Framer workflow, giving you a simple way to add professional map functionality to your projects. No need to build a map system from scratch add your locations, customize the experience, and create a polished interactive map that works seamlessly with your design.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you need to showcase a few business branches or multiple locations across different areas, MapQ provides a flexible and engaging way to present location-based information.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreate interactive maps, showcase your locations, and give visitors a better way to explore your business or project with MapQ for Framer.\u003c/p\u003e82:T533,\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIcon Collection\u003c/strong\u003e: Transform the standard cursor with our rich Framer Cursor library. From sleek designs to classic pointers, create engaging interactive elements that capture visitors’ attention.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVisual Integration\u003c/strong\u003e: Embed components within your Framer Cursor to showcase products, animations, or calls-to-action. Create an immersive experience as users navigate your Framer site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSimple Customization\u003c/strong\u003e: Tailor your Framer Cursor's appearance with easy color, size, and animation adjustments to match your brand identity. No coding knowledge required - all changes made through an intuitive interface.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUniversal Compatibility\u003c/strong\u003e: Seamlessly works across all Framer projects regardless of complexity. Implement Custom Cursors in any section of your design without compatibility concerns.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNo impact on Performance\u003c/strong\u003e: Enjoy enhanced user experience without sacrificing site speed or performance, keeping your visitors engaged and your speed intact.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWeekly collections\u003c/strong\u003e: We update our users with new cursors on a weekly basis.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCursor trails\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cem\u003e- Coming soon\u003c/em\u003e\u003cem\u003eSupport email: framer@getwiretap.com\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e83:T746,\u003cp\u003eAs a Framer project grows, a few pages and components quietly pile up to hundreds or thousands of layers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThose are exactly the ones that make the editor lag, slow your published site, and turn a small edit into a wait. Project Analyzer finds them for you and helps you clear them out, making optimizing your project easy.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRun a quick health check before publishing or handing a project off.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProject health at a glance\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne bar splits every layer in your project into normal, hidden and unused, so you can see the shape of the problem before reading a single number. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFindings that tell you what to fix\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eQuick, plain language insights into what is holding your project back the most.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFind what\u0026#39;s heavy\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSee which pages carry the most layers, which components are large on their own, and which small components add up across every instance. A component placed on every page is often the real weight.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpot hidden layers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHidden isn\u0026#39;t deleted. Those layers still load and still cost you. Project Analyzer shows exactly which pages and components are carrying them, and how many.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJump straight to the problem\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eClick any finding to open a filtered list of exactly those items, or go straight to the page, component, code file or collection it is about.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTune it to your project\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSet your own thresholds for every check, or switch off the ones you don\u0026#39;t need. What counts as too heavy is different for every project.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFree, fast and completely local\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo account, no sign up, no API key, no external service. Project Analyzer reads your open project right there in Framer, scans it in seconds, and nothing ever leaves the editor. It\u0026#39;s free.\u003c/p\u003e84:T6cb,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePDF Export for Framer — Export Framer Designs as PDF in Seconds\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe easiest way to export any Framer frame as a professional PDF. Select a frame, preview the output, download your PDF. No screenshots, no stitching, no third-party tools required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat is PDF Export for Framer?\u003c/strong\u003e PDF Export is a Framer plugin that converts any Framer frame directly into a downloadable PDF file. If you\u0026#39;ve ever searched for \u0026quot;how to export Framer as PDF\u0026quot; or \u0026quot;Framer to PDF\u0026quot; — this is the answer. No workarounds, no manual steps, just a clean PDF straight from your Framer canvas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy PDF Export for Framer?\u003c/strong\u003e Exporting Framer designs as PDF used to mean screenshotting section by section and stitching files together manually. PDF Export for Framer replaces that entire workflow with a single click — directly inside Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c/strong\u003e → Client proposals \u0026amp; project pitches → Invoices \u0026amp; bills → Style guides \u0026amp; moodboards → Manuals \u0026amp; documentation → Design handoffs for developers \u0026amp; stakeholders → Portfolio exports \u0026amp; case studies → Print-ready flyers \u0026amp; one-pagers\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow to export Framer as PDF:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpen PDF Export on your Framer canvas\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eComplete the one-time setup in under a minute\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSelect your frame, preview the output, download your PDF\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFree vs Pro\u003c/strong\u003e The free tier lets you test PDF Export for Framer on real projects before committing. Pro unlocks 300 exports per month for a Monthly Subscription.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRequirements\u003c/strong\u003e Your Framer site must be published for the plugin to work. \u003c/p\u003e85:T93d,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImage \u0026amp; Video Lightbox Gallery\u003c/strong\u003e is a powerful Framer plugin that enables you to integrate smooth, responsive lightbox popups into your projects with ease.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt supports static images, CMS-driven content, and now YouTube and Vimeo videos, making it a versatile solution for various use cases.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNow with improved performance and new customization features!You can now customize overlay background, button and text colors, icon styles, animations, and much more — all without writing code.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSee Tutorial:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iTAXtEDlXGE\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iTAXtEDlXGE?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" start=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" data-youtube-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iTAXtEDlXGE\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSee live:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://image-video-lightbox-gallery-demo.framer.website/\"\u003ehttps://image-video-lightbox-gallery-demo.framer.website/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith this plugin, you can:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDefine a Gallery Name:\u003c/strong\u003e Organize your media by assigning them to named galleries.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Lightbox Integration:\u003c/strong\u003e Add a fully responsive lightbox popup to any Framer project with minimal effort.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSupports Images \u0026amp; Videos (Static \u0026amp; CMS):\u003c/strong\u003e Works with manually added images and videos, as well as dynamically loaded content from the Framer CMS (including YouTube and Vimeo links).\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFully Customizable:\u003c/strong\u003e Adjust overlay, icons, animations, colors, and more using the new Customize panel.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImproved Performance:\u003c/strong\u003e Now faster and more reliable than ever.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOne-Time Payment – $14 per Project:\u003c/strong\u003e Pay once and use the plugin for a single project with no recurring fees.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re building portfolios, product showcases, or interactive media experiences, Image \u0026amp; Video Lightbox Gallery brings a sleek and functional media viewing experience to your Framer projects.\u003c/p\u003e86:T611,\u003ch2\u003eStart building your store for free:\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShopiframe\u003c/strong\u003e lets you connect your Shopify store with Framer easily. Build your store quickly with drag-and-drop components or ready-made templates.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LItRcPqPmEI\u0026amp;t=29s\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LItRcPqPmEI?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" start=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" data-youtube-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LItRcPqPmEI\u0026amp;t=29s\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eSetup E-commerce In 15 Minutes With Framer and Shopify\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch2\u003eEasy to Use\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo coding needed! Start in \u003cstrong\u003eTest mode\u003c/strong\u003e and drag components onto your page or use a pre-made template. When you’re ready, connect it to your Shopify store.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eSync with Shopify\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eStay in sync and update your products with one click. Cart data and product data (prices, inventory, variants, availability) are always live.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHighly Customizable\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustomize every component to match your brand’s unique style and requirements. Need deeper customization? Reach out to us, and we’re here to help!\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhat’s Next?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe’re working on adding Sign In, Sign Up, User Dashboard, and Shopify Apps integration to give you a complete e-commerce experience with \u003cstrong\u003eShopiframe\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e87:T7fd,\u003cp\u003eFramer's native tables only work inside CMS Rich Text fields. Table Creator works on any page — landing pages, dashboards, documentation, pricing comparisons, product specs, or anywhere you need structured data.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow It Works\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpen the plugin, set your columns and rows, pick a theme, and hit Create. Edit data directly in the plugin or paste from a spreadsheet. Your table appears on the canvas, styled and ready to publish.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCreate Tab\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSet table dimensions with column and row controls. Toggle column headers, row headers, and zebra striping. Choose your size from the visual grid selector, then pick a theme — Minimal Light, Soft Grid, or Dark Pro.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEdit Tab\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdd or remove rows and columns. Edit cell values inline. Paste data from spreadsheets or import CSV files. All changes reflect instantly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStyle Controls\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFull typography control — font family, body size, header size, line height, text alignment, header weight, body weight. Adjust head padding, body padding, column gap, and row gap to match your design system.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThemes\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThree built-in themes to get started fast:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMinimal Light — clean, professional look\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSoft Grid — subtle grid lines, softer feel\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDark Pro — dark background for dashboards and technical content\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInteractive Features\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eToggle sorting, filtering, and pagination independently. Configure items per page and pagination style. Your visitors can interact with the table on your published site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eData Input Options\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eManual entry — type directly in cells\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePaste — paste from any spreadsheet\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCSV import — upload CSV files\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt by \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://FramerHub.io\"\u003eFramerHub.io\u003c/a\u003e — makers of Framer CMS Filter (#1 on Framer Marketplace) and Form Kit.\u003c/p\u003e88:T672,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBest Video Player\u003c/strong\u003e is the most advanced, code-free video solution built natively for Framer. Stop settling for rigid, default embeds. Design cinematic viewing experiences and fully custom, branded video players with complete visual control—no coding required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you need a sleek product demo, a hero background video, or a custom YouTube embed, Best Video Player gives you the ultimate design flexibility.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🚀 \u003cstrong\u003eTwo Ways to Design\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePre-built Templates:\u003c/strong\u003e Drop a fully styled, highly responsive video player onto your canvas with a single click.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e19+ Modular Components:\u003c/strong\u003e Mix, match, and build your UI from scratch. Drag in custom play buttons, volume sliders, progress bars, speed toggles, captions, and more.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e🎨 \u003cstrong\u003eAdvanced UX \u0026amp; Seamless Customization\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYouTube, Vimeo \u0026amp; MP4 Support:\u003c/strong\u003e Paste any public video link or ID directly into the Framer properties panel.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart State Syncing:\u003c/strong\u003e All components dropped inside the same frame automatically connect and communicate with each other instantly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerformance First (SEO Friendly):\u003c/strong\u003e Built with responsive touch events, lazy-loading, and smart auto-pausing when scrolled out of view to save browser resources and keep your site lightning fast.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e💬 \u003cstrong\u003eQuestions \u0026amp; Support\u003c/strong\u003e Reach out anytime at \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:hello@sillyweb.in\"\u003ehello@sillyweb.in\u003c/a\u003e — I'm happy to help.\u003c/p\u003e89:Td63,\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/KPZrsguFVaI?si=MZoAjFqn47M--5jl\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/KPZrsguFVaI?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" start=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/KPZrsguFVaI?si=MZoAjFqn47M--5jl\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eIntroduction to our Before After Image Slider for Framer App\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHorizontal or Vertical layout\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLabel Color and Background Change\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDisable Overlay\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMouse Hover Options\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy-to-use option panel\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e9 Preview Styles Slider\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWatermark for Before and After Images\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustom Width \u0026amp; Height - Alignment\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAuto Slider\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn Scroll Slider\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUploaded Before and After Image Preview\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor Before and After images Filters\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHandle and Label Customization position, color, liquid glass effect\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat You Can Do\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreate and manage before/after slider items.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePreview slider behavior in the Framer canvas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUpdate existing sliders without rebuilding them from scratch.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eKeep slider content organized for easier iteration.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow To Use The Plugin\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpen the Beaf plugin in Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdd a new slider entry or select an existing one.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConfigure the before and after content.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInsert or update the slider on the canvas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eReview the preview and make adjustments as needed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRecommended Workflow\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStart by preparing the images or content you want to compare.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreate the slider entry first, then place it on the canvas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCheck the preview after each major change.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eReuse existing slider entries when you only need small updates.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTips\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUse clear names for slider items so they are easy to find later.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eKeep before and after assets aligned for the best comparison effect.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRefresh the canvas preview after making content changes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eIf Something Looks Wrong\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConfirm the slider entry was saved before inserting it again.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCheck that the before and after content are both assigned.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf the preview does not update, reopen the plugin and verify the slider state.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eHow It Works: \u003c/h3\u003e\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/gaCneE-tdcg?si=ovS5EYa8wauQ-fjF\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gaCneE-tdcg?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" start=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/gaCneE-tdcg?si=ovS5EYa8wauQ-fjF\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eHow to Use Before After Image Slider for Framer | Easy Framer Image Comparison Slider Tutorial\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e8a:Ta5d,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRouter\u003c/strong\u003e sends each visitor to the right page on your Framer site by \u003cstrong\u003ecountry, continent, region/city, language, device, or VPN/proxy\u003c/strong\u003e. Set the rules once, enforced on every visit.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLocation is resolved \u003cstrong\u003eserver-side from the visitor\u0026#39;s real IP\u003c/strong\u003e: no API keys in your site, no visitor data stored, a fast check before the page shows.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhy Router?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eRoute by anything\u003c/strong\u003e: country, region, language, device or VPN, alone or combined\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eRedirect or suggest\u003c/strong\u003e: send visitors straight there, or show a dismissible \u003cstrong\u003esuggestion banner\u003c/strong\u003e (Airbnb-style)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eTamper-proof\u003c/strong\u003e: decided on our servers, instant, unbypassable\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eTest console\u003c/strong\u003e: simulate any country, language or device, no VPN\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eNo account needed\u003c/strong\u003e: a built-in \u003cstrong\u003edemo\u003c/strong\u003e opens the whole plugin first\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eHow it works\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eBuild your rules\u003c/strong\u003e: match by geo/language/device/VPN, set a path or URL\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eChoose the action\u003c/strong\u003e: a hard redirect or a styled suggestion banner\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eTest, then publish\u003c/strong\u003e: preview visitors, then one click injects it site-wide\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eBuilt for control\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eVPN \u0026amp; proxy aware\u003c/strong\u003e: reuses the Vanssay Bouncer engine so geo rules can\u0026#39;t be faked\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eConditional \u0026amp; scheduled rules\u003c/strong\u003e: route by geo + device, or only in set time windows\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eAnalytics\u003c/strong\u003e: traffic and redirects by rule, country, language\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf anything goes wrong, Router does nothing and the visitor just stays, so it never breaks your site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePricing\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFree\u003c/strong\u003e: 1 rule · country redirect · whitelist + fallback · internal paths · visitor memory · test console\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePro, $9/mo\u003c/strong\u003e: \u003cstrong\u003eunlimited rules\u003c/strong\u003e · external URLs · blacklist · continent/region/city · language combos · \u003cstrong\u003eVPN/proxy\u003c/strong\u003e · \u003cstrong\u003esuggestion banner\u003c/strong\u003e (custom + translations) · UTM preservation · analytics\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAgency, $29/mo\u003c/strong\u003e: all of Pro · \u003cstrong\u003eper-device rules\u003c/strong\u003e · \u003cstrong\u003escheduled routing\u003c/strong\u003e · \u003cstrong\u003ewebhooks\u003c/strong\u003e · \u003cstrong\u003eCSV export\u003c/strong\u003e · priority support\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne subscription covers all your Framer projects · 7-day money-back guarantee.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eLinks\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eWebsite: \u003ca href=\"https://vanssay.net/router\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://vanssay.net/router\u003c/a\u003e · Support: \u003ca href=\"mailto:support@vanssay.net\"\u003esupport@vanssay.net\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e8b:T5b6,\u003ch2\u003eFeedify Brings Your Content to Every Reader\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eGenerate validated RSS feeds from your Framer CMS collections. Your content flows to feed readers, newsletters, and aggregators with one-click updates.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eOne Click Sync\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eUpdate all your feeds with a single click. Your latest Framer CMS content instantly flows to every subscriber and platform.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eUniversal Compatibility\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eWorks with Feedly, podcasts, newsletters, RSS readers, and thousands of other platforms. Your content goes everywhere RSS does.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eRealtime Updates\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003ePublish in Framer, sync in Feedify, and your subscribers see it immediately. Fresh content delivered the moment it's ready.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eAuto-Discovery Tags\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eYour feeds include built-in auto-discovery tags. RSS readers and browsers automatically detect your feeds when visitors browse your site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow it works\u003c/h2\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpen Feedify in your Framer project and select which CMS collection you want to turn into an RSS feed. We'll automatically detect all your fields.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAssign which CMS field is your title, which is your content, and optionally map author, images, categories, and publish dates.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGenerate your RSS, Atom, and JSON feed URLs with auto-discovery tags. Click 'Sync' to populate your feed, then share the URLs anywhere - site footer, social media, or aggregators. Each time you publish new content in Framer, hit 'Sync' to update your feed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e8c:T77a,\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOverview\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eMy Project Cleaner\u003c/em\u003e is your go-to tool for \u003cstrong\u003escanning\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003ecleaning up\u003c/strong\u003e your Framer \u003cstrong\u003ecanvas\u003c/strong\u003e. Find layers cluttering your project and remove them in seconds, keeping your canvas clean and project more organized!\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eDetects:\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ehidden layers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ezero opacity layers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ezero size layers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eoff-canvas layers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003esingle character text layers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eempty image layers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eempty components\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow does it work?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith \u003cstrong\u003eone click\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cem\u003eMy Project Cleaner\u003c/em\u003e scans your entire page and flags every problematic layer by category. No manual hunting through the layers panel. \u003cstrong\u003eRescan anytime\u003c/strong\u003e after making changes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSee, Review, and Delete with Precision\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eClick \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eSee Layer\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e to jump directly to any flagged layer on your canvas. Delete individual layers one by one, or remove an entire category at once with the \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eDelete All \u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003ebutton. Use the usual ⌘Z in Framer at any time to restore deleted layers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe fun part: tidiness score! \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"sparkles\"\u003e✨\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSee your real-time Page \u003cstrong\u003eTidiness Meter \u003c/strong\u003ethat reflects how clean your Framer project is. Watch your score improve as you clean up and hit 100 for a perfectly clean canvas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYou choose what to scan\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustomize your scan by \u003cstrong\u003etoggling\u003c/strong\u003e which \u003cstrong\u003elayer types\u003c/strong\u003e to include. Only care about hidden and off-canvas layers? Turn off the rest. My Project Cleaner adapts to your workflow.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eI don\u0026#39;t know about you, but I\u0026#39;m sold!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e· Made by Arta from Jelly Studio ·\u003c/p\u003e8d:T9ac,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGradient Noise Background\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cem\u003e(Mesh Studio)\u003c/em\u003e is a charm-filled generative plugin crafted to add modern depth, rich color transitions, and tactile grain textures to your Framer landing pages, hero banners, and digital UI components. Combining smooth mesh gradients with custom noise overlays, these generative assets seamlessly blend vibrant aesthetics with complete creative control.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat it does\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePreset Library:\u003c/strong\u003e Curated style presets—including Aurora Borealis, Sunset Glow, Cyberpunk Neon, and Glassmorphic Sky—to instantly jumpstart your creative workflow.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI \u0026amp; Shuffle Studio:\u003c/strong\u003e One-click color palette and mesh layout randomization to discover fresh design combinations effortlessly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGreat for\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eModern SaaS \u0026amp; AI Landing Pages:\u003c/strong\u003e Create eye-catching hero section backgrounds, feature cards, and interactive glow areas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Banners \u0026amp; Editorial Layouts:\u003c/strong\u003e Add subtle atmospheric warmth or bold gradient focal points behind your primary content.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGlassmorphic Cards \u0026amp; UI Layers:\u003c/strong\u003e Enhance translucent components with underlying color blooms and fine-grain textures.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRapid Prototyping:\u003c/strong\u003e Experiment with custom aspect ratios (1:1, 16:9, 9:16, 4:3, 2:1) and apply generated art directly to canvas frames in seconds.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat you can customize\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasily tweak and adapt every element to fit your project design system:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eColor Palette \u0026amp; Stops:\u003c/strong\u003e Add up to 12 color stops, edit hex codes directly, or lock favorite colors while shuffling.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMesh \u0026amp; Blur Controls:\u003c/strong\u003e Fine-tune blob count, size, spread, and blur softness to achieve exact gradient density.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNoise \u0026amp; Grain Texture:\u003c/strong\u003e Control grain contrast, grain particle size, and opacity for subtle or retro analog feel.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeed Value Reproducibility:\u003c/strong\u003e Lock or enter precise seed numbers to recreate and export exact background compositions anytime.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNeed help?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eHave questions or feature suggestions? Reach out anytime at \u003ca href=\"mailto:karimsaif010@gmail.com\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ekarimsaif010@gmail.com\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e or on X \u003cstrong\u003e@karimsaif0\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e8e:T505,\u003cp\u003eImport and export your CMS collections with JSON files, making it easy to manage your data outside of Framer and backup or move your data, and use CMS content with other tools that may not support CSV files.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eImporting\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eUpload a .json file, drag and drop, or paste from the clipboard to instantly add items to your collection. Any conflicts, such as items with the same slug as an existing item, are resolved in an easy to use interface.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eExporting\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eExport your CMS collections as JSON files, for moving or backing up your data. JSON Import \u0026amp; Export shows you a convenient preview of the JSON before you download the file, allowing you to verify and check the results.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFeatures\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrag and drop a file or paste from the clipboard to instantly import items.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConflict resolution system handles conflicting values when importing.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eImport and export all field types.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupports exporting all types of collections.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eImport and export image alt text.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eOpen-Source\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eJSON Import \u0026amp; Export is open source! You can find the source code on \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://github.com/madebyisaacr/framer-json-sync\"\u003eGitHub\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e8f:T430,\u003cp\u003eLottieFiles for Framer allows you to seamlessly embed ultra lightweight and highly customizable Lottie animations onto your web pages. Inserting animations has proven to increase user engagement and conversions on a webpage.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLottieFiles is trusted by over 8 million designers \u0026amp; developers worldwide, and over 275,000 brands now build with Lottie.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e🌐 Core Features:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOver 500,000+ free and premium, ready-to-use Lottie animations to get you started. New animations for diverse industries and use cases added daily.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou can access your team's private animation library and insert animations directly onto Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFramer natively supports Lottie and dotLottie file formats for faster web page load speeds.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEffortlessly personalize your animations with Lottie Theming, along with Framer's dark \u0026amp; light mode.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWorks seamlessly with Framer’s interactivity features.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003eEngage users, tell better stories, and improve conversions with LottieFiles.\u003c/p\u003e90:T898,\u003cp\u003eFramerForms supercharges Framer's native forms with everything they're missing. Multi-step flows, file uploads, conditional logic, \u0026amp; reCAPTCHA. \u003cstrong\u003e25+ input types \u003c/strong\u003e- all built \u0026amp; styled directly on your canvas, without iframes or third-party widgets. Forms that look like the rest of your site, because they're built the same way.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow It Works\u003c/h2\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpen the plugin \u0026amp; click 'New Form' - choose Single or Multi-Step.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdd your inputs by clicking to drop them in.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStyle everything on the canvas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnect your destination - email, Google Sheets, Zapier, or Make.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePublish. Your form is live, responsive, and working.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lr5JumtrRbY\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lr5JumtrRbY?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" start=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" data-youtube-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lr5JumtrRbY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eWatch the quick trailer above to see it in action\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch2\u003eKey Features\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003eMulti-step forms\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eGuide users through pages with previous/next navigation, like Typeform but inside Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eFile uploads\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eCollect documents \u0026amp; images directly through your form.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eConditional logic\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eShow or hide fields based on a user's previous answers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eCalculators\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuild live pricing estimators, ROI calculators, and quote builders.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eQuizzes\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eScored quizzes with custom result cards and redirect logic.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eHidden fields\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eCapture UTM tags, referrer URLs, \u0026amp; page URLs in the background without cluttering the form.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e25+ input types\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eSliders, country selectors, star ratings, phone inputs, \u0026amp; more.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003ereCAPTCHA\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt-in spam protection to keep your submissions clean.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eFull design control\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eStyle every element to match your site. It lives on the canvas like anything else.\u003c/p\u003e91:T4f7,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShieldPage\u003c/strong\u003e lets you password-protect any page in your Framer site — static pages, CMS collections, portfolio projects, blog posts — all without writing a single line of code.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow it works:\u003c/strong\u003e Open the plugin, pick the pages you want to protect, set a master password or 6-digit PIN, and publish. That's it. Visitors who land on a protected page see a stunning dark-themed lock screen. Once they enter the correct code, all protected pages unlock for their session.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ Password or 6-digit PIN protection (your choice)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ Works on static pages and CMS collection pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ Beautiful glassmorphism lock screen with smooth animations\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ Custom background image upload or elegant default gradient\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ One master code unlocks all protected pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ Session persistence — visitors only enter the code once\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ Change your password or PIN anytime\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ Error shake animation on wrong entries\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ Fully mobile responsive\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ No external servers, no accounts, no dependencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c/strong\u003e Client previews, gated portfolio pieces, work-in-progress pages, members-only content, or any page you want to keep private.\u003c/p\u003e92:T8d9,\u003ch2\u003eOverview\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eBring your WordPress content into Framer the fast way. WP Sync by \u003ca href=\"https://19.studio\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e19.studio\u003c/a\u003e removes the manual work of migration, letting you import posts, custom post types and woocommerce productsi, directly into Framer CMS with just a few clicks.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re redesigning in Framer or migrating a large wordpress website, this plugin keeps everything fast and clean.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGet to know more on the \u003ca href=\"https://19.studio/wp-sync\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eWP Sync website.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDo you need help with your new Framer website? \u003ca href=\"https://19.studio/contact\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eLet\u0026#39;s chat.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhy Use WordPress Sync?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003eLightning-Fast Migration\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eMove hundreds of posts into Framer in seconds. This includes images, video, media, rich text content. No copy-paste, no CSV juggling, no plugins to maintain.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eCustom Post Type Support\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eImport exactly what you need: posts, news, blog, woocommerce products, or any custom post type from your WordPress setup.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSync When You Need It\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eImport once or re-sync any time. Keep your Framer CMS up to date as your WordPress site changes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eField Mapping Made Easy\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eMap WordPress fields to Framer CMS fields with an intuitive visual interface.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eBuilt to Scale\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFrom small blogs to 1,000+ posts, imports stay smooth, stable, and fast. Even for heavy media libraries.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow It Works\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003e1. Connect your WordPress site using your plugin dashboard.\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ch3\u003e2. Choose what to import: posts, products, or custom posts.\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eNote: you cannot import your wordpress pages.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e3. Map your fields to Framer CMS collections.\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ch3\u003e4. Import and watch your content appear instantly inside Framer.\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThat’s it. No exporting, no re-formatting, no headaches.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWordPress Sync makes migration effortless, so you can focus on what matters: designing your new Framer site, not wrestling with legacy content.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re launching a fresh redesign or rebuilding a large WordPress archive, this plugin gives you a smooth and reliable workflow from start to finish.\u003c/p\u003e93:T70d,\u003cp\u003eYouTube Sync connects your YouTube channel to a Framer CMS collection and keeps it up to date. Point it at a channel, hit Sync, and your videos appear as structured CMS items, ready to design with.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat it does\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFetches all public videos from a YouTube channel\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMaps video metadata (title, description, thumbnail, publish date, URL) to CMS fields\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupports channels of any size\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTwo sync modes: Full Sync (adds, updates, and removes stale items) or Add Only (never removes)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePreserves any manual edits you make in the CMS across re-syncs\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCMS fields created automatically\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTitle, Description, Published Date, Thumbnail, Video URL, Video ID\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHidden (boolean, user-editable: the plugin never overwrites it)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSetup takes under two minutes:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreate a free YouTube Data API key in Google Cloud Console\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEnter your API key and Channel ID in the plugin\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHit Sync\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003ch2\u003ePricing\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFree\u003c/strong\u003e: sync up to 5 videos to try it out.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e$99 one-time\u003c/strong\u003e: unlimited videos, lifetime access, dedicated support. One license per Framer project.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eRequirements\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eA YouTube Data API v3 key (free, from Google Cloud Console)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eA YouTube Channel ID\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eA Framer CMS collection\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eSupport\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor setup help and troubleshooting, email us at support@framerlabs.com.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eRoadmap\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eadd support for Transcripts (requires YouTube OAuth)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eoption to sync a specific playlist instead of all channel uploads\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eadd more custom user-editable fields\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e94:T971,\u003ch2\u003eMembership sites in Framer\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdd user accounts, gated content, and Stripe payments to your Framer site without touching code. Built specifically for Framer - so everything from sign-up to checkout lives right where you already work.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLearn more at \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://thenty.io\"\u003ethenty.io\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow It Works\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpen the plugin \u0026amp; create your Thenty account.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrop in your components - sign-up, login, dashboard, gated sections.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnect Stripe \u0026amp; set who can see what.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePublish.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f5IyhgqKRN0\u0026amp;t=5s\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/f5IyhgqKRN0?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" start=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" data-youtube-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f5IyhgqKRN0\u0026amp;t=5s\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch2\u003eKey Features\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMembership sites\u003c/strong\u003e - Create a member-only home with sign-up, login, \u0026amp; SSO out of the box.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGated content\u003c/strong\u003e - Protect pages \u0026amp; content for specific users or tiers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStripe payments\u003c/strong\u003e - Sell one-off products or subscriptions directly on your site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGoogle SSO\u003c/strong\u003e - Let users sign in with Google in one click.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMember dashboards\u003c/strong\u003e - Show user-specific data like name, email, or saved content.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUser management\u003c/strong\u003e - Track \u0026amp; manage all your members from inside the plugin.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntegrations\u003c/strong\u003e - Connects with Zapier, Rewardful, \u0026amp; Intercom.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFully PCI compliant\u003c/strong\u003e - Member data is secure \u0026amp; protected.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eMembership Models\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFree access\u003c/strong\u003e - Let anyone sign up \u0026amp; create an account.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePaid access\u003c/strong\u003e - Require a Stripe purchase before granting access.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTiered access\u003c/strong\u003e - Offer free \u0026amp; paid tiers, letting members upgrade.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInvite only\u003c/strong\u003e - Manually invite members \u0026amp; keep a community closed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e95:T22d5,\u003cp\u003ePair a Latin font with a Japanese font and apply them automatically across Preview and the published site — without writing custom CSS.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFeatures\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDual font pairing\u003c/strong\u003e — Pick a Latin family and a Japanese family independently.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThree font sources\u003c/strong\u003e — Google Fonts presets, Adobe Fonts (Kit ID + PostScript name), and custom families from Framer uploads.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAuto weight detection\u003c/strong\u003e — Scans the canvas and only loads weights actually used.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePer-language weight remapping\u003c/strong\u003e — Remap each declared weight to a different actual weight per language when Latin and Japanese need different weights for visual balance (Google Fonts only).\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOpt-out layers\u003c/strong\u003e — Keep specific layers with their original fonts instead of overriding them.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive summary\u003c/strong\u003e — The footer shows the currently applied fonts, weights, and opt-out count.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eQuick start\u003c/h2\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpen the plugin from the plugin menu.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn the \u003cstrong\u003eFont Settings\u003c/strong\u003e tab, choose a Latin family and a Japanese family.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e(Optional) On the \u003cstrong\u003eOpt Out\u003c/strong\u003e tab, add layer names that should keep their original fonts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e(Optional) Toggle \u003cstrong\u003eWeight adjustment\u003c/strong\u003e on to remap per-language actual weights.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClick \u003cstrong\u003eApply\u003c/strong\u003e. Once active, the button switches to \u003cstrong\u003eUpdate\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpen Preview or publish the site to confirm the result.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClick \u003cstrong\u003eRemove\u003c/strong\u003e twice to clear everything the plugin has injected.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003ch2\u003eUsing Adobe Fonts\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdobe Fonts is supported, but a one-time setup in your Adobe Fonts account is required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eStep 1 — Create or open a Web Project (Kit)\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eSign in to \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://fonts.adobe.com\"\u003efonts.adobe.com\u003c/a\u003e, open \u003cstrong\u003eMy Adobe Fonts → Web Projects\u003c/strong\u003e, and create a new project or open an existing one containing the fonts you need.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eStep 2 — Whitelist your deploy domains\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdobe Fonts only serves fonts on domains listed in the Kit. Add your published site's custom domain, the Framer-hosted preview domains you use (copy them from the address bar when Preview is open), and any staging URL.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eStep 3 — Get the Kit ID and PostScript name\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Kit ID is shown in the embed code of the Web Project (for example, abc1234). The PostScript name is on the font family page, under the \u003cstrong\u003eWeb\u003c/strong\u003e tab, next to font-family (for example, adobe-caslon-pro) — lowercase and hyphenated, not the display name.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eStep 4 — Enter the values\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn Font Settings, open the \u003cstrong\u003eFont Family\u003c/strong\u003e dropdown, choose \u003cstrong\u003eAdobe Fonts\u003c/strong\u003e, paste the Kit ID and PostScript name. Repeat for the other language if it also uses an Adobe font. Click \u003cstrong\u003eApply\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eStep 5 — Verify\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpen DevTools Network tab and confirm the Kit CSS returns 200 and the chosen font file loads. If the font falls back to a system typeface, check the domain whitelist first.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eNotes\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eWeight Mapping is not available when either side uses Adobe Fonts. Unpublished Kits will not serve fonts — always publish after editing.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eKnown limitation: Opt Out does not apply in Preview\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe opt-out feature identifies layers through DOM attributes that only exist on the published site. In Preview, all layers — including opt-outs — will render with the newly applied font pair. Verify opt-out behavior on a published or staging site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eRequirements\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFramer (Web version and desktop app both supported)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor Adobe Fonts: a published Web Project (Kit) with every deploy domain whitelisted\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e---\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e欧文フォントと和文フォントを別々に指定し、Preview と公開サイトに自動適用する Framer プラグイン。独自 CSS を書かずに、日英混植のタイポグラフィを実現します。\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e特徴\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eデュアル指定\u003c/strong\u003e — 欧文と和文を独立して選択可能。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3 種類のフォントソース\u003c/strong\u003e — Google Fonts プリセット、Adobe Fonts (Kit ID と PostScript 名)、Framer アップロードのカスタムフォントに対応。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eウェイト自動検出\u003c/strong\u003e — キャンバス上で実際に使われているウェイトだけを読み込みます。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e言語別ウェイトマッピング\u003c/strong\u003e — 欧文と和文で見栄えのバランスが取れない場合、基準ウェイトに対して言語ごとに別の実ウェイトをマッピング可能(Google Fonts のみ)。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e除外レイヤー\u003c/strong\u003e — 特定レイヤーだけ元のフォントを維持します。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eライブサマリー\u003c/strong\u003e — 適用中のフォント・ウェイト・除外レイヤー数をフッターに常時表示。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eクイックスタート\u003c/h2\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eプラグインメニューから Type Bridge を開きます。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFont Settings\u003c/strong\u003e タブで欧文と和文のファミリーをそれぞれ選びます。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e(任意) \u003cstrong\u003eOpt Out\u003c/strong\u003e タブで、元フォントを維持したいレイヤー名を追加します。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e(任意) \u003cstrong\u003eウェイト調整\u003c/strong\u003e スイッチを ON にして、言語ごとの実ウェイトをマッピングします。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eフッターの \u003cstrong\u003e適用\u003c/strong\u003e をクリック。反映後はボタンが \u003cstrong\u003e更新\u003c/strong\u003e に切り替わります。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePreview を開くか、公開サイトで反映を確認します。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e削除\u003c/strong\u003e を 2 回クリックすると、挿入内容が全てクリーンアップされます。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003ch2\u003eAdobe Fonts の使い方\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdobe Fonts に対応していますが、Adobe Fonts 側での事前準備が必要です。\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e手順 1 — Web プロジェクト(Kit)を用意\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://fonts.adobe.com\"\u003efonts.adobe.com\u003c/a\u003e にサインインし、\u003cstrong\u003eマイフォント → Web プロジェクト\u003c/strong\u003e を開きます。新規作成、または使いたいフォントを含む既存プロジェクトを開きます。\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e手順 2 — 公開ドメインを登録\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdobe Fonts は Kit に登録されたドメインのみでフォントを配信します。公開用の独自ドメインに加え、Preview を開いたときにブラウザのアドレスバーに表示される Framer のドメイン、およびステージング URL も登録します。\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e手順 3 — Kit ID と PostScript 名を取得\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eKit ID は Web プロジェクトの埋め込みコードに表示される値(例: abc1234)。PostScript 名は各フォントファミリーのページの \u003cstrong\u003eWeb\u003c/strong\u003e タブにある font-family 欄の値(例: adobe-caslon-pro)で、小文字とハイフン構成のため表示名とは異なります。\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e手順 4 — Type Bridge に値を入力\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFont Settings タブで \u003cstrong\u003eFont Family\u003c/strong\u003e ドロップダウンから \u003cstrong\u003eAdobe Fonts\u003c/strong\u003e を選択し、Kit ID と PostScript 名を貼り付けます。もう一方の言語でも Adobe Fonts を使う場合は同じ手順を繰り返し、\u003cstrong\u003e適用\u003c/strong\u003e をクリックします。\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e手順 5 — 動作確認\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eブラウザの DevTools の Network タブで、Kit CSS が 200 を返し対象のフォントファイルが読み込まれているかを確認します。システムフォントにフォールバックする場合は、まずドメインのホワイトリスト設定を確認してください。\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e注意\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eどちらか一方でも Adobe Fonts を使っている場合、ウェイト調整は無効化されます。Kit が非公開状態だとフォントは配信されないため、編集後は必ず公開してください。\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e制限事項: Preview では Opt Out が機能しません\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e除外機能は公開サイト側の DOM 属性を手がかりにレイヤーを識別します。そのため Preview 画面では Opt Out は反映されず、登録済みの除外レイヤーも新しいフォントで描画されます。Opt Out の動作確認は \u003cstrong\u003e公開 (Publish) 後または Staging 環境\u003c/strong\u003e で行ってください。\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e動作要件\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFramer (Web 版・デスクトップアプリの両方で動作確認済み)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdobe Fonts を使う場合: 公開先と Preview 用のドメインをすべて登録した Web プロジェクト (Kit)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e96:T6d7,\u003cp\u003eRun Claude Code or Codex inside the Framer canvas, using the AI subscription you already pay for. Connected runs don\u0026#39;t consume Framer AI credits, and every run reports tokens used and estimated provider cost.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRequires Claude Code or Codex installed locally.\u003c/strong\u003e Setup takes one command.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSelect a layer and describe the change. Dexter reads the relevant context, plans the work, applies real changes to the canvas, and shows progress as it happens with the option to redirect or stop a run mid-flight.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith Dexter, you can:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreate pages, sections, and components\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEdit layouts, copy, typography, colors, spacing, and images\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnect Claude Code or Codex through a guided setup\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFollow planning, progress, and canvas changes\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProvide additional direction or stop an active run\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eReview and undo supported changes\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eReopen conversations with their context and history\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSee reported token usage and estimated provider costs\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUse your existing AI subscription instead of paying for another one\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnected Claude Code and Codex runs do not consume Framer AI credits. Your provider subscription, limits, and billing remain separate. Cost information is clearly marked as estimated when authoritative billing data is unavailable.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupport for more AI agents is coming soon.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eStart with a 7-day free trial, then unlock lifetime access for a one-time $29 payment—no recurring Dexter subscription.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLearn more and watch Dexter in action:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://dexterplugin.online\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://dexterplugin.online\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e97:T490,\u003ch2\u003eBuild and launch your website faster with Frameblox in Framer. Create websites more quickly with Drag \u0026amp; Drop!\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSimply drag and drop prebuilt components and sections, and your website will be ready in minutes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFrameblox is the ultimate Framer UI kit, design system, and prebuilt website template library. Save hours and enhance your website with the Frameblox Plugin. Simply drag and drop sections and layouts to publish your site quickly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eCreate Websites Faster with Drag \u0026amp; Drop!\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith the Frameblox Plugin, just drag and drop prebuilt components and sections to have your website ready in minutes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eExplore our library of over 450 Framer components, elements, sections, and templates. Copy and paste easily with one click. With hundreds of options, building stunning websites has never been easier.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eColor and Typography Style Generator\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eAutomatically create color and typography styles for your websites.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eReady-made Website Pages\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eAccess prebuilt Framer pages like landing, about, team, and contact pages. Designed with Frameblox UI, these pages are ready for quick customization and publishing.\u003c/p\u003e98:Tb0b,\u003ch2\u003eImage Compressor — WebP compression, built for Framer.\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eCompress images to WebP and add them directly to your canvas — without leaving Framer, without uploading anything, without slowing down your workflow.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eAbout this Plugin\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eImage Compressor is the only Framer plugin that compresses both new images and existing canvas images to WebP — the modern format built for fast-loading websites. Whether you're importing fresh assets or cleaning up an existing project, everything happens locally in your browser. Your files never leave your machine.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhat makes it different\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eMost compression tools only handle new uploads. Image Compressor goes further — switch to Canvas Mode, select any images already on your Framer canvas, and compress and replace them in place. One click. No re-importing, no layer disruption, no manual swapping.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWebP Output\u003c/strong\u003e — converts all images to WebP, the format browsers love and Google rewards.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCanvas Replace Mode\u003c/strong\u003e — select existing canvas images and compress them directly in place.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBulk Processing\u003c/strong\u003e — compress and replace 20, 30, 50 images at once with a single click.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuality Control\u003c/strong\u003e — choose Web (85%), High (95%), Max (100%) or dial in a custom quality level.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e100% Local\u003c/strong\u003e — all compression runs in your browser, nothing uploaded, nothing stored.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReal-time Progress\u003c/strong\u003e — live progress bar per image, cancel anytime mid-batch.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFramer-native UI\u003c/strong\u003e — light and dark mode, built to feel like part of Framer itself\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWho is it for\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFramer Designers\u003c/strong\u003e — keep your canvas clean without ever touching an external tool\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDevelopers\u003c/strong\u003e — ship lighter pages without rebuilding your asset pipeline\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAgencies \u0026amp; Freelancers\u003c/strong\u003e — optimize entire client projects in minutes, not hours.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eStop re-importing. Stop switching tools. Compress, replace, and ship — all from inside Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eReview Instructions:\u003c/h3\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpen the plugin in a Framer project with at least one page open.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFrom Computer mode: drop any image into the drop zone — it should compress and appear on the canvas as a WebP file.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFrom Canvas mode: place an image on the canvas, select it, switch to From Canvas tab — the image should appear in the list automatically. Hit Compress \u0026amp; replace.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTest bulk: select multiple images on canvas and compress all at once.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTest light/dark: switch your OS theme to verify both modes render correctly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e99:T8ed,\u003cp\u003eFramerFlo brings complete e-commerce functionality to your Framer sites. Add a fully functional online store with product listings, shopping cart, checkout, and customer accounts — all without writing code.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWHAT\u0026#39;S INCLUDED:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Product Grid — Display products in a customizable, responsive grid\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Product Cards — Feature individual products anywhere on\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eyour site\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Dynamic Product Pages — SEO-friendly product URLs with full details\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Shopping Cart — Cart button with badge + slide-out cart\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003edrawer\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Checkout — Secure Stripe-powered checkout with shipping\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026amp; payment\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Customer Accounts — Login, registration, order history,\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eaddress book\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eKEY FEATURES:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• 16 ready-to-use e-commerce components\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Supports product variants (size, color, etc.)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Built-in search, filtering, and sorting\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Light and dark mode support\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Mobile responsive design\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Secure payments via Stripe, PayPal, or Square\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eREQUIREMENTS:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• FramerFlo merchant account (free signup at \u003ca href=\"http://app.framerflo.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eapp.framerflo.com\u003c/a\u003e)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• FramerFlo subscription required after 7-day free trial\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSETUP:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. Sign up at \u003ca href=\"http://app.framerflo.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eapp.framerflo.com\u003c/a\u003e and add your products\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. Connect your Stripe account for payments\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3. Install this plugin and log in\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e4. Add FramerFlo Config to your page, then add components\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupport: \u003ca href=\"mailto:help@framerflo.com\"\u003eframerflo.app@gmail.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAPI KEY \u0026amp; DATA:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• FramerFlo stores your publishable API key and merchant ID in the browser (localStorage) so the storefront components can make product, cart, checkout, order, and account requests for your store.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• This is a publishable key, similar to a Stripe publishable key, and is meant to be used in the browser. It is limited in scope: it only authorizes public storefront operations and is bound to your store. It cannot access your account settings, payouts, payment processor secrets, or any other merchant\u0026#39;s data. It is not your secret or admin key.\u003c/p\u003e9a:Ta72,\u003cp\u003e✅ Why Frame Audit?\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFrame Audit is your built-in quality partner.\u003c/strong\u003eIt automatically scans your template, flags missing requirements, and gives you a clear pass/fail breakdown. On top of that, you can run full Google PageSpeed tests directly inside Framer, no external tools required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e🔑 Core Features\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e📋 \u003cstrong\u003eMarketplace Checklist Audit\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFlags missing meta tags, broken links, accessibility gaps, inconsistent styling, and unresponsive layouts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGuarantees your template checks \u003cem\u003eevery box\u003c/em\u003e before submission.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong\u003eIntegrated Google PageSpeed Insights\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTest your template’s loading speed directly inside the plugin.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGet real-time insights into \u003cstrong\u003eCore Web Vitals\u003c/strong\u003e: performance, accessibility, best practices, and SEO.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOptimize before you submit—without switching tabs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e♿ \u003cstrong\u003eAccessibility Checker\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDetects missing alt text and accessibility issues.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEnsures your template is \u003cstrong\u003eusable for everyone\u003c/strong\u003e and marketplace-compliant.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e🔍 \u003cstrong\u003eSEO Essentials\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eScans for proper meta titles, descriptions, canonical tags, and heading structure.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eImproves discoverability and drives more organic traffic to your templates.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e📱 \u003cstrong\u003eResponsiveness Validator\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eChecks your template across all breakpoints.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGuarantees a flawless experience on every device.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e🌟 Benefits at a Glance\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAccessibility = More Reach. \u003c/strong\u003eInclusive templates perform better and stand out in the marketplace.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSEO = More Visibility \u003c/strong\u003eBuilt-in SEO checks help your templates rank, attract traffic, and boost sales.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResponsiveness = Better Reviews \u003c/strong\u003eA seamless experience across devices leads to happier customers and higher ratings.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e🎯 Who It’s For\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTemplate Creators\u003c/strong\u003e who wants publish quality templates and better sales.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFreelancers \u0026amp; Agencies\u003c/strong\u003e delivering premium, marketplace-compliant Framer sites.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e🏆 Why Top Creators Love It\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFrame Audit isn’t just a plugin. It’s your silent QA partner—catching details you might overlook and giving you confidence that your template is \u003cstrong\u003emarketplace-ready, fast, and optimized to sell.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e👉 \u003cstrong\u003eInstall Frame Audit today. Ship faster. Sell more.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e9b:T865,\u003cp\u003eCookie PRO\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe ultimate cookie consent and privacy compliance solution for Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCookie PRO doesn\u0026#39;t just show a banner — it actually blocks trackers. GA4, Meta Pixel, TikTok Pixel, and Google Tag Manager stay neutralized until your visitor consents, with full Google Consent Mode v2 support. Build GDPR and CCPA-compliant sites without compromising design, performance, or user experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhy Cookie PRO?\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMost cookie banners hide trackers behind a popup while they load anyway. Cookie PRO enforces consent at the script level, with real blocking, category-based control, and Consent Mode v2 built in.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeatures\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrivacy \u0026amp; Compliance\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- GDPR \u0026amp; CCPA Compliance • Google Consent Mode v2 • Consent Category Management • Privacy Preference Center • Configurable Consent Expiration • Privacy-First Script Loading\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eScript Blocking Engine\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Real script blocking, not visual hiding • GA4, Meta Pixel \u0026amp; TikTok Pixel support • Google Tag Manager support • Custom script blocking for any third-party tag • Automatic activation on consent • Persistent consent across sessions\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAnalytics \u0026amp; Marketing\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- GA4 \u0026amp; GTM Integration • Consent-Based Tracking • Automatic Consent Updates • Data Layer Integration\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign \u0026amp; Customization\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- 7 Banner Positions \u0026amp; Layouts • Custom Colors \u0026amp; Typography • Border Radius \u0026amp; Spacing Controls • Logo \u0026amp; Branding Support • Custom Buttons \u0026amp; Links • Built-In Animations\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eUser Experience\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- Mobile Optimized • Accessibility Focused • Multi-Language Support • Fast \u0026amp; Lightweight • Production Ready\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect For\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- SaaS Products • Marketing Websites • Startups • Agencies • Client Projects • E-Commerce Stores • Landing Pages • Portfolios • Enterprise Websites\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you\u0026#39;re launching a startup or scaling a large business, Cookie PRO helps you implement real privacy compliance in minutes — trackers actually blocked, not just visually hidden.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt for Framer. Trusted for Compliance. Engineered to Block.\u003c/p\u003e9c:T8ea,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://checkoutpage.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eCheckout Page\u003c/a\u003e lets you sell your products, subscriptions and event tickets on your Framer site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuild fully customized checkout pages that match your branding.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePayments run through your own Stripe account, so money goes straight to you.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat you can add\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCheckout pages for digital and physical products, subscriptions and pay what you want pricing\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvents with ticket types, add-ons and sales windows\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eForms for registration, lead gen and lead magnets\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMatch your brand\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCheckout pages are fully themeable: your fonts, your colors, your corners, light or dark.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTheme them once in the Checkout Page dashboard and every buy button, embed and popup on your Framer site matches your brand.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow it works\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpen the plugin and connect your Checkout Page account\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSelect the checkout page, event or form you want to add\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdd a buy button, or embed the whole checkout on the page. Click to insert it, or drag it exactly where you want it.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003eInserted buy buttons are ordinary Framer components. Set the label, colors, radius, padding and border in the property panel, and choose whether the checkout opens in a pop-up or as a link.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRun more than one store? Connect them all and switch between them in the plugin.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat you need\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA Checkout Page account. The plugin will not show anything until you connect one, and you can create one from the plugin if you do not have it yet.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePricing\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe plugin is free.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCheckout Page itself has a Free plan covering up to $3,000 in sales a month, and paid plans from $29 a month. See \u003ca href=\"https://checkoutpage.com/pricing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://checkoutpage.com/pricing\u003c/a\u003e for current pricing.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSupport\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHelp center: \u003ca href=\"https://checkoutpage.com/docs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://checkoutpage.com/docs\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmail: \u003ca href=\"mailto:support@checkoutpage.com\"\u003esupport@checkoutpage.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e9d:T87e,\u003cp\u003e💳 Accept real payments in Framer — without writing a single line of code.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eStripe Payment Gateway adds a drop-in checkout button to any Framer page. Paste your Stripe key, customize the look, drag it onto the canvas, ship.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✨ WHAT YOU GET\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• A fully customizable \"Pay with Stripe\" button — color, text, radius, padding, font weight, behavior\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Real-time live preview as you tweak\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Opens Stripe Checkout in a new tab or redirect — your choice\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Works with any Stripe Payment Link (one-time, subscriptions, donations)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• 🌍 46+ countries, 40+ payment methods (cards, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Link, Klarna, Cash App, bank transfers, more)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e⚡ HOW IT WORKS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. Paste your Stripe publishable key (pk_test_ or pk_live_)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. Paste your Stripe Payment Link\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3. Style the button to match your brand\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e4. Insert the component, drop on canvas, publish\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🚀 FREE vs PRO\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Free — fully functional with test keys (pk_test_). Perfect for development \u0026amp; demos.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Pro ($19 one-time) — unlock live keys (pk_live_) for real payments. No subscription. Lifetime updates.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🎯 WHY THIS PLUGIN\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• No backend, no servers, no Stripe API code to write\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• You own the Stripe account, you own the money — we never touch your funds\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Built by KDX Studios\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eQuestions? 📩 \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"mailto:hardik@mynuora.com\"\u003ethekhushaldewra@gmail.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eREVIEWS \u0026amp; PROOF:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/1116-stripe-payment-gateway-VdwM0WLqiK3WvTXsY1vXQuMIs6VQHx\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/1116-stripe-payment-gateway-8rtDr51q30jKr2dvQgyTyhglt1TPQR\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/1116-stripe-payment-gateway-sEkeOdiUsEAX3GkH8lQ7JVTT013iX3\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/1116-stripe-payment-gateway-MKH0JEXqOvSrTJ77KZCoB156y231Qa\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e9e:T897,\u003cp\u003eFramer has no HTML export and no self-hosting. Full Site Export reads your published site the way any visitor does, and gives it back as files you keep.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTHREE WAYS OUT\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Perfect Copy — a pixel-exact static copy of every page and asset. Upload it to any host. Block the network entirely and it still renders: images, fonts, video and CMS data are all local.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Exact (Next.js) — the same copy inside a Next.js project with real routes and a build. Identical rendering, including WebGL.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Readable (React / Next.js) — your pages rebuilt as components with their own stylesheet. Source you can edit.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWHAT COMES WITH IT\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Every page, not one at a time\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• CMS collections, captured from what your site actually requests at runtime\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Scroll reveals, their stagger and looping marquees, re-emitted as CSS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Framer\u0026#39;s badge, editor bar and analytics stripped\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWHAT IT CANNOT DO\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• The Readable export is close to your site, not pixel-identical. A component driven frame by frame — a WebGL background, for one — survives in the exact copies and not in the rebuilt source.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Your site must be published. An unpublished project has nothing to read.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• It does not change what you are licensed to own. Framer templates are sold under their own terms.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eACCOUNT AND PRICING\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThree free exports of three pages each, with no account. After that, a licence key: $10 USD a month for 50 pages a month, or $99 USD a year, with a 7-day trial. Paste the key in the plugin\u0026#39;s Settings — \u0026quot;Clear licence key\u0026quot; in the plugin menu removes it at any time.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEXTERNAL SERVICE\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eExporting runs on our server at \u003ca href=\"http://api.getfull.site\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eapi.getfull.site\u003c/a\u003e, because reading a published site needs a real browser. Two things are sent: the address of your published site, and your licence key. Your Framer project is never uploaded.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDocs and support: \u003ca href=\"https://getfull.site\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://getfull.site\u003c/a\u003e — \u003ca href=\"mailto:hello@getfull.site\"\u003ehello@getfull.site\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e9f:T55d,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blink.store/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eBlink\u003c/a\u003e brings powerful, beautiful e-commerce to Framer. Effortlessly connect your Blink store to instantly drop fully functional \u0026quot;Buy Now\u0026quot; buttons right into your canvas and sync your Blink products with Framer CMS.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"sparkles\"\u003e✨\u003c/span\u003e Features:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOverlay Checkouts\u003c/strong\u003e: Keep users on your site. Blink opens a stunning, frictionless checkout overlay directly over your Framer design without redirecting your customers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAuto-Sync Products\u003c/strong\u003e: Connect your account to automatically import and sync your entire product catalog directly into the Framer CMS.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFully Customizable\u003c/strong\u003e: Match your brand effortlessly by applying your custom Blink checkout templates straight inside Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSell and grow on autopilot with \u003ca href=\"https://blink.store/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eBlink\u003c/a\u003e \u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"rocket\"\u003e🚀\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrive more sales with automated cart recovery, built-in affiliate programs, revenue splits, broadcasts, real-time analytics, and frictionless checkouts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreate your store → \u003ca href=\"https://blink.store/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://blink.store/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003ea0:T516,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVideoFrame\u003c/strong\u003e lets you customise your video player without any limitations. Be on brand every single time. Add video files, YouTube, or Vimeo content and design stunning, interactive video players without compromise.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow it works:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSimply drag \u0026amp; drop components from the Videoframe plugin to build and customise your video player.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/dbuxFoFBQ9o\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dbuxFoFBQ9o?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" start=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/dbuxFoFBQ9o\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePower up your videos:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustom playback controls\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInteractive progress bar\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTime labels and animations\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFull-screen mode\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePicture-in-picture support\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePlayback speed and volume controls\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eZero sacrifice\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy setup\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO friendly\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eZero code (really)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne-time fee\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003ea1:T95f,\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeCommerce - WooCommerce Plugin for Framer\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeCommerce is a \u003ca href=\"https://www.fecommerce.co/framer-fecommerce\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003efree WooCommerce plugin for Framer\u003c/a\u003e that turns Framer into a full WooCommerce storefront. Sync your products into Framer CMS in one click, or pull them live via API, then build a complete shop with drag-and-drop components, so you can add WooCommerce to a Framer site with no code, no theme, and no backend. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFramer is a fast-growing no-code website builder, but it has no native WooCommerce integration and no built-in ecommerce. FeCommerce is the Framer ecommerce plugin that closes that gap and takes you from products in WooCommerce to a Framer site that takes orders.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow to add WooCommerce to Framer\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnect your store with your store URL and WooCommerce REST API keys. Choose your data source, CMS (synced) or API (live).\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSync and drag. Products load automatically. Drag the product listing, product pages, variant selector, cart, and checkout onto the canvas, each auto-wired to your live store.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStyle and publish. Shoppers buy on-page with no redirect the moment your site goes live.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey features\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne-click WooCommerce to Framer CMS sync: titles, prices, images, variants, stock, categories\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eShop / Product Listing with live search, sorting, and pagination\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFull component library: Product Page, Variant Selector, Add to Cart, Buy Now, Cart Drawer, Cart Page, Checkout, Mobile Sticky Cart, Price, SKU, Rating, Reviews\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn-page checkout: Cash on Delivery native, optional inline Stripe card,optional Paystack redirect,live shipping rates and coupons\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCard animations, deep styling controls, and full responsiveness across desktop, tablet, phone\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy use FeCommerce\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuild and launch a complete Framer storefront in minutes, sell physical and digital products, and keep product data synced automatically. Ideal for creators, store owners, and Framer agencies. Free plugin, no code required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSupport\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eLet\u0026#39;s create something amazing together. Get in touch with us:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMail: \u003ca href=\"mailto:connect@fecommerce.co\"\u003econnect@fecommerce.co\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003ea2:T60d,\u003cp\u003eYou’ve got creativity, but let’s face it—learning 3D tools like Blender takes time you don’t have. That’s why I made this plugin. With the \u003cstrong\u003eSVG to 3D\u003c/strong\u003e plugin, you can transform your \u003cstrong\u003eSVG\u003c/strong\u003e logos, icons, and designs into sleek 3D models without leaving your comfort zone in Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✨ \u003cstrong\u003eWhat Makes It a Game-Changer?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSVG to 3D, Instantly\u003c/strong\u003e: Drop your SVG file into the plugin, and boom—it’s now a 3D model. No steep learning curve, just results.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFully Editable\u003c/strong\u003e: Adjust the depth, lighting, field of view, and flip your model—all in a clean, intuitive interface.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Integration\u003c/strong\u003e: Your 3D creations are automatically placed in your Framer canvas, perfectly positioned and ready to go.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-Res Exports\u003c/strong\u003e: Need a stunning render for a client or presentation? Export high-resolution screenshots with one click.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMade for Designers\u003c/strong\u003e: No fiddling with complex 3D software. It’s fun, simple, and designed to fit into your workflow.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re spicing up a landing page, designing a pitch deck, or simply experimenting, this plugin is the quickest way to add a professional 3D touch to your work. Impress your clients, wow your audience, and save hours of effort—all with zero 3D experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e🔑 Get a licence key here : https://memselon.gumroad.com/l/hwysco\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003ea3:Tb30,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBouncer\u003c/strong\u003e blocks unwanted visitors on your Framer site by \u003cstrong\u003ecountry\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eVPN/proxy\u003c/strong\u003e — set it up in the plugin, enforced on every visit.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eChoose who gets in once, and Bouncer guards your published site automatically. Verification runs \u003cstrong\u003eserver-side from the visitor\u0026#39;s real IP\u003c/strong\u003e, so there are no API keys in your site and no visitor data stored — just a fast check before your page shows.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhy Bouncer?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eCountry + VPN in one\u003c/strong\u003e — blacklist or whitelist countries, and stop proxy/VPN/hosting IPs\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eServer-side \u0026amp; tamper-proof\u003c/strong\u003e — decided on our servers from a local geo database, so it\u0026#39;s instant and can\u0026#39;t be bypassed client-side\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eMatches your site automatically\u003c/strong\u003e — the block \u0026amp; loading screens read your colors, fonts and radius; fine-tune after\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eLive preview before you arm it\u003c/strong\u003e — and it never blocks you in the editor\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003e3 ways to block\u003c/strong\u003e — a styled message, a redirect, or silently hide the page\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eHow it works\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003ePick your countries\u003c/strong\u003e — blacklist the ones to block, or whitelist only the ones you allow\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eStyle the screens\u003c/strong\u003e — or let Bouncer match your site automatically\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eArm protection\u003c/strong\u003e — one click injects it site-wide, or target specific pages\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003ePublish\u003c/strong\u003e — Framer pushes it live; the check runs on every visit\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eBuilt for control\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eVPN \u0026amp; proxy detection\u003c/strong\u003e — catch visitors masking their real location\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eConditional \u0026amp; scheduled rules\u003c/strong\u003e — block by country + device, or only during set time windows\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eAnalytics\u003c/strong\u003e — traffic, block rate, top blocked countries, device split and VPN attempts stopped\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePricing\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFree\u003c/strong\u003e — block up to \u003cstrong\u003e3 countries\u003c/strong\u003e · whole-site protection · full \u003cstrong\u003eloading-screen\u003c/strong\u003e styling · fail-open safety\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePro — $6/mo\u003c/strong\u003e — \u003cstrong\u003eunlimited countries\u003c/strong\u003e · whitelist mode · \u003cstrong\u003eVPN/proxy blocking\u003c/strong\u003e · \u003cstrong\u003ecustom block screen\u003c/strong\u003e · redirect \u0026amp; hide actions · per-page protection\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUltra — $14/mo\u003c/strong\u003e — all of Pro · \u003cstrong\u003econditional rules\u003c/strong\u003e (country + device) · \u003cstrong\u003escheduled blocks\u003c/strong\u003e · \u003cstrong\u003efull analytics\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne subscription covers all your Framer projects · 7-day money-back guarantee · cancel anytime.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eLinks\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eWebsite: \u003ca href=\"https://vanssay.net/geoblock\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://vanssay.net/geoblock\u003c/a\u003e · Support: \u003ca href=\"mailto:support@vanssay.net\"\u003esupport@vanssay.net\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003ea4:Tad7,\u003cp\u003eOptimo checks your published Framer site the way Google and AI crawlers read it, then helps you fix what it finds. You stay in the editor the whole time.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt for Framer. No external dashboards, no pasting your URL into five different tools. Open the plugin, scan, fix, publish.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWHAT OPTIMO DETECTS: 25+ CHECKS\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cem\u003eSEO\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMissing, short, long, or duplicate page titles\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMissing, short, long, or duplicate meta descriptions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMissing H1, multiple H1s, skipped heading levels\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePages set to noindex (invisible to Google)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMissing canonical, language attribute, favicon, social image\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cem\u003eAccessibility\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eImages missing alt text\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eForm fields missing labels\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLinks without readable text\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFrames missing titles\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cem\u003eQuality\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBroken links\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMissing custom 404 page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cem\u003eAI Visibility\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI crawlers (ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI) blocked\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMissing robots.txt, sitemap.xml, or llms.txt\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMissing structured data (JSON-LD), site and page level\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMissing FAQ schema that AI answers cite\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery issue explained in plain words: what\u0026#39;s wrong, why it matters, what to fix first.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWHAT OPTIMO FIXES\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAI alt text applied in one click — per image or whole site (Pro)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO-ready titles and meta for every page (Pro)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePage-specific structured data, JSON-LD (Pro)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ellms.txt in seconds (Pro)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRescan and watch your score climb (Free)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eFREE\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eScan up to \u003cstrong\u003e10 pages\u003c/strong\u003e on \u003cstrong\u003e1 website \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFull score, every issue explained\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo card, no trial clock\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePRO — $12/MONTH\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAll AI generation: alt text, meta, structured data, llms.txt\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eScan up to\u003cstrong\u003e 30 pages\u003c/strong\u003e, across \u003cstrong\u003eunlimited websites\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFresh \u003cstrong\u003e500 AI credits\u003c/strong\u003e every month\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://whop.com/checkout/Plvp1pb8EcvqxQFLb-2T9Y-cr8n-gutm-rbxYyFZqnbje/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUpgrade to Pro\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003ePRIVACY\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eNothing leaves Framer until you agree — a first-run screen shows exactly what each feature sends (full details in Settings).\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eREFUNDS\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003ePro includes AI credits consumed on use, so subscriptions are non-refundable — cancel anytime to stop future billing. If something\u0026#39;s broken, reach out and we\u0026#39;ll make it right.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eOpen, scan, fix, publish. Built for Framer.\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003ea5:T51d,\u003cp\u003ePlugin Studio — design and export real Framer plugins visually. No code required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuild multi-screen plugins with a drag-free visual editor: add text, buttons, and graphics, style backgrounds with solid colors or gradients, and wire up button actions like screen navigation or opening URLs. Preview exactly what users will see, then export a production-ready plugin project in one click.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWHAT YOU GET\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Visual builder for Framer plugin UIs (390px canvas, true plugin dimensions)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Multi-screen support with go-to-screen navigation\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• 8 ready-made templates: Login Form, AI Copywriter, Asset Library, Theme Sync, Script Installer, Section Library, Pro Paywall, CMS Sync\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Gradient picker with presets, angle control, and named swatches\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Undo/redo and per-screen element isolation\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• One-click export: complete Vite + React + TypeScript project (framer.json, src, configs) ready for npm install and publish\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• AI prompt export: get a ready prompt to refine your plugin with any AI\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePRICING\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFree to design. Export with a subscription ($12/mo, unlimited exports) or a one-time single export ($5).\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect for designers shipping their first plugin and developers who want a fast UI scaffold instead of writing boilerplate.\u003c/p\u003ea6:T88d,\u003ch2\u003eThe form system Framer\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eFramer gives you beautiful pages. FormKit gives you forms that actually work.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://framerformkit.com/templates?utm_source=framer_marketplace\u0026amp;utm_medium=referral\u0026amp;utm_campaign=framer_form_kit_listing\u0026amp;utm_content=templates_cta\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eBrowse Form Templates (FREE)\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrop in 35+ field components — text, email, date pickers, file uploads, star ratings, signature pads and configure everything from the Properties Panel. No code. No embeds. No switching tools.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhat you get\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReal validation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRequired fields, email/phone/URL format checks, character limits, regex patterns, min/max ranges. Errors show inline on blur. Custom error messages that match your brand voice.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMulti-step forms\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBreak long forms into steps with progress bars, step indicators, and navigation buttons. The Next button validates the current step before advancing. Auto-saves to localStorage so users never lose progress.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConditional logic\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShow, hide, enable, or disable any field based on other field values. Eight operators (equals, contains, greater than, is empty, etc.) with AND/OR matching. Hidden fields automatically skip validation.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull styling control\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery component exposes Input Styles, Label Styles, Error Styles, Focus Styles, and Success Styles directly in the Properties Panel. Style one field, then Ctrl+Alt+C / Ctrl+Alt+V to copy styles across your entire form.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eURL parameter prefill\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePre-populate fields from URL query strings. Link from email campaigns, ads, or landing pages with `?\u003ca href=\"mailto:email=user@example.com\"\u003eemail=user@example.com\u003c/a\u003e\u0026amp;source=newsletter` and fields fill automatically.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e35+ components\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ch3\u003e3 steps to your first form\u003c/h3\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpen FormKit from the Plugins bar\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClick any component to insert it into your Framer Form\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSet the field name, label, and validation in the Properties Panel\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003eThat\u0026#39;s it. Preview your page and the form works.\u003c/p\u003ea7:T1b37,\u003cp\u003eConnectfic is the easiest way to connect your Framer website with your Shopify store.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re a designer, developer, or business owner, Connectfic helps you use Framer for beautiful store design while keeping Shopify as your eCommerce backend. It gives you the best of both platforms in one simple setup.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eStop choosing between a beautiful website and a powerful online store. With \u003cstrong\u003eConnectfic\u003c/strong\u003e, you get both in one simple setup.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo exports. No custom code. No complicated setup.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/KVaOGlQK6ho?si=0xklZeJeJss5x3NY\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/KVaOGlQK6ho?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" start=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/KVaOGlQK6ho?si=0xklZeJeJss5x3NY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eIntroduce to our Framer App Connectfic - (Connect your Framer site with multiple Shopify stores)\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWho is Connectfic For?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnectfic is built for anyone who wants Framer’s design freedom with Shopify’s selling power. It is perfect for:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFramer designers who want to build custom Shopify storefronts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eShopify store owners who need a more flexible frontend.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAgencies building headless eCommerce websites for clients.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBusinesses that want full design control while keeping Shopify checkout intact.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eKey Features of Connectfic\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003e1. Framer to Shopify Integration\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnectfic connects your Framer website with your Shopify store, so you can use Framer for design and Shopify for eCommerce management.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e2. Use Shopify as Your eCommerce Backend\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eManage products, inventory, orders, and checkout from Shopify while displaying your store beautifully on Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e3. Build Headless Shopify Stores with Framer\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreate a modern headless Shopify storefront using Framer\u0026nbsp; without building everything from scratch.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e4. Product Syncing\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eSync Shopify products to your Framer site and keep your product data updated easily.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e5. Advanced Field Mapping\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnectfic gives you advanced field mapping options, allowing you to sync Shopify products with custom settings based on your needs.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e6. SEO Metadata Support\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnectfic supports SEO metadata syncing, helping you preserve important SEO information such as meta titles, meta descriptions, and other search engine optimization settings when syncing content between Shopify and your storefront.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e7. Inventory Syncing\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eKeep inventory information connected between Shopify and Framer, so your store stays accurate.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e8. Shopify Checkout Support\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eLet customers complete purchases through Shopify’s reliable checkout system.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e9. No Coding Required\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnectfic is built for designers, developers, and business owners who want a simple way to connect both platforms without complex development work.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e10. Real-Time Component Updates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnectfic’s built-in components update automatically when you make changes to your Shopify products. With real-time sync, your storefront stays accurate and up to date.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eStorefront Component Library \u0026amp; Templates\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith Connectfic, you get access to a growing collection of modern, ready-to-use storefront components. This helps you build beautiful Framer storefronts faster without spending hours designing everything from scratch.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSimply drag, customize, and publish using our pre-built components.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Components:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct Hero Sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDynamic Product Grids\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct Cards \u0026amp; Grid Items\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct Galleries\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdd-to-Cart Panels\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct Details Sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrice \u0026amp; Stock Badges\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe're continuously expanding our library, with more components and complete storefront templates coming soon.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose Connectfic?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilding a headless Shopify store on Framer used to mean hiring developers, dealing with complex API setups, and spending weeks getting everything to work. Connectfic changes that completely.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHere is why thousands of designers, store owners, and agencies choose Connectfic:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNo developers needed.\u003c/strong\u003e Set up your entire Framer Shopify integration without writing a single line of code or hiring a developer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSave time and money.\u003c/strong\u003e Skip the expensive custom development work and get your store live in minutes instead of weeks.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAlways in sync.\u003c/strong\u003e Products, inventory, checkout logic, and checkout steps update automatically so your store is always accurate.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKeep your Framer design.\u003c/strong\u003e Build any layout or visual experience you want in Framer without touching your Shopify backend.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePowered by Shopify checkout.\u003c/strong\u003e Your customers enjoy Shopify's trusted and secure checkout process right inside your Framer site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt for everyone.\u003c/strong\u003e Whether you are a solo designer, a growing brand, or a busy agency, Connectfic is built to work for you.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNo manual exports or updates.\u003c/strong\u003e Forget copying and pasting product data. Connectfic handles everything automatically in the background.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHeadless commerce made simple.\u003c/strong\u003e Get the benefits of a headless eCommerce setup without the complexity or the cost.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReady-to-Use Components. \u003c/strong\u003eAccess a library of ready-to-use storefront components and templates to design faster and launch your storefront more easily.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHow It Works\u003c/h2\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnect your Shopify store\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSelect your Framer CMS collection\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMap Shopify fields to CMS fields\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eImport products instantly\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEnable Auto-Sync for continuous updates\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/6bWD3awqnGY?si=OBnkgsEpAlp8CwRR\"\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6bWD3awqnGY?color=white\u0026amp;autoplay=0\u0026amp;controls=1\u0026amp;rel=0\" start=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"395\" data-youtube-url=\"https://youtu.be/6bWD3awqnGY?si=OBnkgsEpAlp8CwRR\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003eHow to use Connectfic on Framer\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003ch2\u003eNeed help getting started?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eOur team is ready to assist with setup, synchronization, and best practices for building Shopify-powered websites in Framer.\u003c/p\u003ea8:T929,\u003cp\u003eAdd a smart, custom-trained AI chatbot to your Framer site — fast, and no code.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eChatloom is a full AI chatbot platform, not just a widget. Train it on your own content, automate support with visual workflows, and deploy across 7 channels — all from one dashboard, without leaving your Framer workflow.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eKey Features\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ Trained on Your Content (RAG)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eUpload docs and PDFs, or crawl your website. Your chatbot answers only from your verified content — no hallucinations. Built-in confidence scoring with automatic human handoff when unsure.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ 10 Built-in Tools\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBook appointments (Google Calendar, \u003ca href=\"http://Cal.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eCal.com\u003c/a\u003e, Calendly), capture leads, send emails and WhatsApp messages, trigger webhooks (Zapier / Make), create support tickets, and more. Your bot takes real actions — not just answers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ Visual Workflow Builder\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrag-and-drop canvas with 11 node types — triggers, AI responses, conditions, tool calls, intake forms, human handoffs. 18 ready-made templates + 4 industry starter kits.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ 7-Channel Deployment\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWeb widget, WhatsApp Business, Telegram, Instagram DM, Facebook Messenger, Email, Discord. One brain, consistent answers everywhere.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ Live Human Handoff\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMonitors confidence, sentiment, and complexity, then routes the conversation to your team with full context when it matters.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ 3 AI Providers, Auto-Failover\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpenAI GPT, Anthropic Claude, and Google Gemini. If one fails, Chatloom switches automatically. Smart routing cuts costs by 20–40%.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ Total Design Control\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eColors, fonts, bubble styles, avatars, animations. 4 launcher modes: floating button, compact panel, sidebar, fullscreen overlay. White-label on paid plans.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ 95+ Languages\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAuto-detects and replies in the visitor\u0026#39;s language instantly. Platform UI in 10 languages.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ Lead Capture \u0026amp; Forms\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eConversational form builder with custom fields, validation, and conditional logic.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePricing\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFree plan — 1 chatbot, 100 messages/month, all core features. No credit card required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupport: support@chatloom.app\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWebsite: \u003ca href=\"https://chatloom.app\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://chatloom.app\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003ea9:T6a4,\u003cp\u003eImage Library handles your entire image workflow in one place: browse, optimize, replace, fix alt text, and copy image URLs without switching between plugins.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBrowse and reuse without re-uploading\u003c/strong\u003e Every image in your project is surfaced automatically. Deduplicated, searchable, and ready to insert onto the canvas or apply to a selected layer in one click.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGenerate alt text with AI\u003c/strong\u003e One click writes descriptive alt text for any image and applies it to every instance. Generate in any of 20 languages to match your site\u0026#39;s audience. Available on Pro and Agency plans.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEdit alt text across every instance at once\u003c/strong\u003e Click any image to edit its alt text. Changes apply to every node using that image, not one layer at a time.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompress images without leaving Framer\u003c/strong\u003e Resize by width, set WebP quality, and preview estimated file size savings before applying. Works on Canvas and CMS images.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReplace an image everywhere, safely\u003c/strong\u003e Swap an image across your entire project, the current page, or just your selection. A confirmation shows exactly how many instances will change and where they live before anything happens.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpot issues before you publish\u003c/strong\u003e Image Library flags missing alt text and large files (over 1MB) so accessibility and performance problems get caught before they go live.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFind anything on the canvas\u003c/strong\u003e Locate jumps straight to any node using an image. Used in multiple places? Click again to cycle through every instance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCopy image URLs instantly\u003c/strong\u003e Grab the direct URL of any project image in one click.\u003c/p\u003eaa:T92f,\u003cp\u003e📱 Scan \u0026amp; Pay buttons for Framer. One drop-in component, every payment app.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrop a QR + Pay button on any page. Customers tap on mobile — their payment app opens. Or scan on desktop — a styled QR pops up. Pay via UPI, Stripe, PayPal, or any HTTPS payment link. No backend, no transaction cut, no monthly fees.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✨ WHAT YOU GET\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• QR + Pay button, ready to drop on any page\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• 4 payment methods: UPI, Stripe Link, PayPal Link, Custom Link\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Mobile deep link (opens payment app) + desktop scannable QR popup\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Live URL / VPA validation with friendly errors\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Custom button: text, color, radius, font weight, padding, logo\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Custom QR styling with logo at the center\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• After-payment continue URL (new tab or replace current page)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Multiple UPI VPAs — rotate across handles\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Buyer-entered amounts — donations, tips, custom totals\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e⚡ HOW IT WORKS\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. Open the Scan \u0026amp; Pay Button plugin in Framer\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. Pick a payment method (UPI, Stripe Link, PayPal Link, or Custom Link)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3. Paste your VPA, paypal.me URL, Stripe Checkout link, or any HTTPS payment link\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e4. Customize the button — text, color, radius, padding\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e5. Click \u0026quot;Insert ScanPayButton\u0026quot; — the component lands in Assets → Code Components\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e6. Drop on your page\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🚀 FREE vs PRO\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Free — UPI payments, single VPA, fixed amount, styled button, mobile deep link + desktop QR\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Pro — adds all 4 payment rails, multiple UPI VPAs, buyer-entered amounts, success redirect, custom QR styling with logo\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🎯 WHO IT\u0026#39;S FOR\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Indie creators selling digital products on a Framer landing page\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Designers shipping client portfolios with a \u0026quot;support my work\u0026quot; button\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Freelancers collecting one-time fees, retainers, or deposits\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Anyone running donations, tips, course sales, or one-shot e-commerce drops\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🛡 WHY THIS PLUGIN\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• 100% client-side, zero backend\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• No third-party services for the plugin, no API keys to manage\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Works on every device — mobile deep link + desktop QR popup\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• 7-day money-back guarantee\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Built by KDX Studios\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eQuestions? 📩 \u003ca href=\"mailto:thekhushaldewra@gmail.com\"\u003ethekhushaldewra@gmail.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e4b:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"resource-listing-module-scss-module__5st7MW__gridAnchor\",\"id\":\"marketplace-grid\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4d\",null,{\"anchorId\":\"marketplace-grid\"}],[\"$\",\"$8\",null,{\"fallback\":[\"$\",\"$L4e\",null,{\"category\":\"$undefined\",\"fallbackData\":{\"data\":[{\"id\":\"446\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"MCP\",\"body\":\"$4f\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Framer MCP\",\"slug\":\"mcp\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"72e6ad2e-95e0-4e3a-9831-7d2f681ed72e\",\"name\":\"Tommy D. Rossi\",\"slug\":\"unframer\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/29595/avatar-VnwsfFjinujsKl2PI83QMDayj7xiPw.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/446-nlBg8NyAtIRHaRABqP6o52L6w3IXfJ\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(344 79% 22%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/446-9f1U6GZLPrS5pDdSbXhCESA7rK0dJQ\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019873d9-4b2d-7bd7-bf1d-8426fc89c769\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":254,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":11},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-07-30T14:22:54.444Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-03-12T20:18:41.931Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-08-04T06:51:17.165Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"nw12xtr7iedsczg1le9s9pqfl\",\"paid\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"bde1e72b-b4a6-4ecc-8eee-417be77494e8\",\"name\":\"AI\",\"slug\":\"ai\"}]}},{\"id\":\"119\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Frameship\",\"body\":\"$50\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Connect to Shopify\",\"slug\":\"frameship\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"ba90876b-848a-4d1c-bbe3-016394b0d57d\",\"name\":\"Insert Frame\",\"slug\":\"insertframe\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/101008/avatar-ehjigJp2l2cQ7XGmUkjNDaVqdk4Vag.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/119-cOGUXloFHO6mOqkxS0MK4JbBhCBirj\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/119-dtKtuZAZ5x9BQNB1hybHCwsljIqVHQ\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/119-bB8adY7za1UFEg4SaRWNIgo03Roru9\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/119-MgT4Fi5CE8pAxLB0mMJ2g9YZpWjYoS\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01934eab-de20-7c30-9aff-fd070541763f\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":68,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":9},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2024-11-06T09:27:40.580Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-03T09:43:51.797Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-03T09:43:51.787Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"5sty6o8n22smpbcb4oypsggk6\",\"paid\":true,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"c4868181-e303-4aac-8074-bd683d4debe8\",\"name\":\"E-Commerce\",\"slug\":\"ecommerce\"}]}},{\"id\":\"1308\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Patterns \u0026 noise\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eEight pattern styles ❯❯ \u003cstrong\u003eGrainy noise, Checker, Grid, Lines, Rhombus, Wave, Polka, Diagonal.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAll the patterns have live controls for \u003cstrong\u003ebackground color, pattern color, scale, intensity, and opacity.\u003c/strong\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrop already optimized\u003cstrong\u003e .WEBP\u003c/strong\u003e format pattern straight onto your canvas \u0026amp; customize as needed. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow to Customize\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrop pattern onto the canvas \u0026amp; set BG and pattern color independently;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eControl scale, intensity, and opacity with live sliders;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePreview every change instantly before inserting.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Eight pattern styles ❯❯ \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Grainy noise, Checker, Grid, Lines, Rhombus, Wave, Polka, Diagonal.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"All the patterns have live controls for \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"background color, pattern color, scale, intensity, and opacity.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Drop already optimized\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" .WEBP\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" format pattern straight onto your canvas \u0026 customize as needed. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"How to Customize\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Drop pattern onto the canvas \u0026 set BG and pattern color independently;\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Control scale, intensity, and opacity with live sliders;\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Preview every change instantly before inserting.\"}]}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"8 customizable geometric patters\",\"slug\":\"patterns-noise\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"a2eef493-fdfc-4cfb-8eaa-2d5db1312bb0\",\"name\":\"Lera\",\"slug\":\"lera-aligns\",\"avatar\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/avatars/users/a2eef493-fdfc-4cfb-8eaa-2d5db1312bb0/CRrLTUbR-\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/a2eef493-fdfc-4cfb-8eaa-2d5db1312bb0/019f5559-2579-725c-9e2c-db509bdf2c1d.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(60 70% 35%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019eff1e-0eb8-75e4-8750-9c749d297b2b\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Hey people! \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"wave\",\"emoji\":\"👋\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" I'm Lera, and I'm so happy to announce my very \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"FIRST PLUGIN\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" for \"},{\"type\":\"mention\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"a7cd9fe6-cf81-4a41-8e93-bca0291dba80\",\"slug\":\"framer\",\"label\":\"Framer\",\"mentionSuggestionChar\":\"@\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"♪┏(・o･)┛♪\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I really love patterns \u0026 use them often in my work, including my personal portfolio. So, I've built a plugin. It's easy to use, adapts to Framer \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"dark/light\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" modes, and, most importantly, offers \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"8 highly customizable\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" creative patterns to drop onto the canvas. Enjoy, I made it \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"free for everyone\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"! ᕙ( •̀ ᗜ •́ )ᕗ\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":121,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":12},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-25T14:10:20.393Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-20T21:11:29.492Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-06-25T14:10:20.636Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"78pmwpl4cp45ly8v1lapwy4hc\",\"paid\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3fc802d9-7527-48e0-9403-c9bd534ab520\",\"name\":\"Utilities\",\"slug\":\"utilities\"},{\"id\":\"676f63da-b192-4974-930d-73185802088a\",\"name\":\"Assets\",\"slug\":\"assets\"},{\"id\":\"b238ea64-0ce9-413a-848d-43b73f0eea0f\",\"name\":\"Design Workflow\",\"slug\":\"design-workflow\"}]}},{\"id\":\"150\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Framer Commerce\",\"body\":\"$51\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Build standout Shopify stores\",\"slug\":\"framer-commerce\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"0507cd8a-2eaf-4492-9ce0-fdb1