your breakpoints.\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Updated Weekly\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"10+ sections and components added every Tuesday so you can stay up to date with evolving web design trends.\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"💬 What Users Love\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"“I’m turning around entire websites in the same timeframe single pages used to take me.”\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"– Luca Da Corte (Product specialist @ Framer)\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"“I’ve been way more profitable, which when you’re self-employed means food on the table and a roof over your head.”\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"– Sam Anthony (Freelance designer)\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"👥 Who can use it\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ideal for:\"}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Freelancers\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" wanting faster, more efficient project delivery\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Agencies\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" needing team alignment and styling consistency\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Template creators\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" leveraging a Framer-reviewed, universal system\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Beginners\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" seeking a polished starting point without the overwhelm\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"💎 Great price\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"One‑time purchase\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — no subscriptions, ever. Pay once and keep it forever. All updates are free and automatic.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Try before committing\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — the free version includes core tools like text and color styling, plus basic components\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"📖 Support\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Enjoy responsive support via the plugin, with same-day responses.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Access live help by scheduling a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"30-minute video calls\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Kompa\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" is packed with ready-made, responsive components, styled fast, updated weekly, and built to save time without compromising quality. If you're looking for a design toolkit that scales with your creativity, Kompa has your back.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Build better sites, faster\",\"slug\":\"kompa\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"73cecec4-4830-4ea3-8947-002649450327\",\"name\":\"Kompa\",\"slug\":\"kompa\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/104355/avatar-L5InaNJKPetO6Jd03YDlBYEC4jSdwg.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/30-qf3Z7rbfnBQpDWnOXzSWXjCHwoZJyu\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/30-RpCwqaeJo5YS7t14N0Fq1qv4qW6K6L\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/30-tphCBmArbRhG9rGSuys7WTRJFPUlWQ\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/30-CZfv1rt8rhAcUX700aRCaJoKmChl1M\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(216 94% 25%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019232eb-c01e-7056-ac96-a3b562395362\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"We were the first UI kit plugin to ever ship to Framer. We built it to be the last one you'd need.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":151,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":9},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2024-09-27T09:37:48.818Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T08:22:27.856Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-17T08:22:27.848Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-07-13T18:49:26.563Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"d9oltpzx17jv41rd6166x4p5z\",\"paid\":true,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"79a3568a-05f3-4f98-b70f-6c9ff9e301c4\",\"name\":\"UI Kits\",\"slug\":\"ui-kits\"}]}},{\"id\":\"737\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Framer Forms Connect\",\"body\":\"$53\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Framer Forms Connect\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://framerformsconnect.com/\",\"class\":null,\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" is the easy way to use Framer’s native design tools to build beautiful forms that connect directly to your favorite CRM and email marketing platforms.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Features:\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"🎨  \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Keep Your Design:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Use your design. No ugly iframes or generic widgets. All types of fields are supported.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"📨 \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Custom States: \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"choose what to show after a submission, add a redirect - all Framer functions are supported.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"⚡ \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Quick setup:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" log into a service with Framer Forms Connect, it will fetch the data automatically.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"♾️ \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Unlimited forms\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": add as many forms as you need, no restrictions.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"🛡 \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Privacy:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" No third-party services. No data retention. No need for Zapier or Make.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"🏷️ \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Transparent pricing\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": $10/mo, $69/year (save 40%), $99 \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"lifetime access\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"🏷️ \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"7 days free trial:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" try until you buy. \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Note: Lifetime purchase is instant. We suggest to try the monthly trial before buying lifetime access.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Supported Services:\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"HubSpot CRM\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://framerformsconnect.com/resources/send-framer-forms-to-hubspot\",\"class\":null,\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Mailchimp\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://framerformsconnect.com/resources/send-framer-forms-to-mailchimp\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Brevo\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://framerformsconnect.com/resources/send-framer-forms-to-brevo\",\"class\":null,\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Beehiiv\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://framerformsconnect.com/resources/send-framer-forms-to-beehiiv\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"MailerLite\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://framerformsconnect.com/resources/send-framer-forms-to-mailerlite\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Jotform\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://framerformsconnect.com/resources/send-framer-forms-to-jotform\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Discord\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://framerformsconnect.com/resources/send-framer-forms-to-slack-discord\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Slack\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://framerformsconnect.com/resources/send-framer-forms-to-slack-discord\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Drip\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://framerformsconnect.com/resources/send-framer-forms-to-drip\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Missing a service? Let us know, and we'll add it!\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"👌 Easy: just click log in to connect to a service.\"}],\"att