xt\",\"text\":\" - manage your subscription \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Support\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"mailto:annyeong@romans.design\",\"class\":null,\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" - voted world's friendliest support (by the support itself)\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Connect Framer with anything\",\"slug\":\"framer-forms-connect\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"61548af4-c093-4c71-bfe8-e91e21b7146f\",\"name\":\"Roman Avshalumov\",\"slug\":\"hellaroman\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/668027/avatar-mYckcg1v6pw0Bj3F49A9O6fXDZvIhL.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/737-IooykDCg3pHX4n9w6y1ZhMYS3M1o76\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 16%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/737-YGPk9mTdpXSFdfQtIFFF4EYIVyCSfy\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(180 53% 42%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/737-PS7WO2Krrm3mJ09DyfNaoRVlFDxUPf\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/737-TXMbxgLHmGozGiDKOPl4RDrhouKeF1\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019bfbf8-c805-7e90-b8b1-7d755cfac3bf\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Added Slack and Discord tutorials\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":55,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":15},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-24T21:11:07.017Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-03T15:56:06.170Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-18T22:31:53.905Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"8ylcacmpvid7i7a8auhbi5p7z\",\"paid\":true,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3176e858-a9a6-426f-894a-e1ef01750d76\",\"name\":\"Forms\",\"slug\":\"forms\"},{\"id\":\"3fc802d9-7527-48e0-9403-c9bd534ab520\",\"name\":\"Utilities\",\"slug\":\"utilities\"},{\"id\":\"f6795017-0256-4955-b31a-c81a28ef20ff\",\"name\":\"Integrations\",\"slug\":\"integrations\"}]}},{\"id\":\"153\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"ShaderGradient\",\"body\":\"$54\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Animated gradients\",\"slug\":\"shadergradient\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"61a67d0e-ba1a-4816-8de6-1b448ceff352\",\"name\":\"Shader Gradient\",\"slug\":\"shadergradient\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/292834/IO8A-Rwme-DWdqlP0lGVexRel3qdAfzGZEVTTOU0\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/153-pwUcprK2zHA769EWGMP3xPZBvPD39T\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 94% 25%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/153-nKHV4uBQVNmJICpx7NJAofzoC4mZXK\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/153-jllfRzSz5Gne2CZ6h9i5dJYSoRXsah\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 94% 25%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/153-pbxE2Rf2NYzhKpsaDtBlKxyvin5Hyh\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 16%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01936304-646b-7d22-90db-7c60a5cfcfb5\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":210,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2024-11-24T11:52:12.127Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-11-24T11:53:20.279Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-11-25T11:10:52.523Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-07-13T18:49:30.928Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"etnr5sluqpri7ic50jpoh4ihx\",\"paid\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"676f63da-b192-4974-930d-73185802088a\",\"name\":\"Assets\",\"slug\":\"assets\"}]}},{\"id\":\"1307\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Context Picker\",\"body\":\"$55\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Context Picker\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Framer's native AI agent can see what you've selected on the canvas, using its built in select tool. External agents like Claude Code, Cursor, and Codex don't get that. They only see plain text, so prompts like \\\"make this headline red\\\" leave them guessing which node \\\"this\\\" actually is.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Context Picker closes that gap. Select any layer on the canvas or in the layer sidebar, and it instantly copies a compact JSON payload describing that selection: node ID, name, and the surrounding scope (web page, design page, or component). Paste it straight into your external agent's prompt for precise, unambiguous edits.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"What gets copied\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Node ID and name of the selected layer\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Scope type and ID, whether you're on a web page, design page, or inside a component\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"URL path, when the scope is a real website page\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Replica metadata (original node ID), when the selection is a variant or inherited component layer\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"How to use it\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"orderedList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Open Context Picker\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Select any layer on the canvas or sidebar\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The JSON is copied automatically, no extra click\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Paste it into your external agent's prompt\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Need an earlier selection? Recent picks are saved and one click away\"}]}]}],\"attrs\":{\"type\":null,\"start\":1}},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Why it matters\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"If you're driving Framer edits from an external coding agent like Claude Code, Cursor, or Codex, the agent is flying blind without canvas context. Context Picker gives it the same precision Framer's native agent has with its select tool, so instead of vague prompts and trial and error edits, you can say exactly which node to touch and watch it land correctly the first time.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Free and open source.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Layer context for external agents\",\"slug\":\"context-picker\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"5adc9354-58b8-41ef-8dc9-9b6c8b000586\",\"name\":\"David McBacon\",\"slug\":\"david-mcbacon\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/140422/avatar-NVixyvekUcyiULLqZX1744W2h9tJlQ.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/5adc9354-58b8-41ef-8dc9-9b6c8b000586/n6bpw7si\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/5adc9354-58b8-41ef-8dc9-9b6c8b000586/88fgipom\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019efe4c-7b69-7534-9e18-dd82702b7cdb\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Context Picker is live, free and open source \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"fire\",\"emoji\":\"🔥\"}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Framer's native agent can see what you select on canvas.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"External agents like Claude Code, Cursor, and Codex couldn't, until now.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Select a layer, copy its context, paste it into your agent. Done.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":99,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":11},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-25T10:21:25.714Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-25T13:18:16.921Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-06-25T13:18:16.909Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-07-09T14:12:42.329Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"1irlj4ze2tscjvbp64630es0f\",\"paid\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3fc802d9-7527-48e0-9403-c9bd534ab520\",\"name\":\"Utilities\",\"slug\":\"utilities\"},{\"id\":\"b238ea64-0ce9-413a-848d-43b73f0eea0f\",\"name\":\"Design Workflow\",\"slug\":\"design-workflow\"},{\"id\":\"bde1e72b-b4a6-4ecc-8eee-417be77494e8\",\"name\":\"AI\",\"slug\":\"ai\"}]}},{\"id\":\"952\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Design to AI\",\"body\":\"$56\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"TRY IT OUT FOR FREE.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Two ways to use the plugin\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Copy Prompt — Best for AI coding\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Select a component, copy the prompt, paste into your AI tool. The AI reads your component and integrates it into your project.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Download ZIP — Standalone React code\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Prefer to work without AI? Download your component as a self-contained React package. Drop it into any React project — Next.js, Vite, Remix, whatever you use.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"How it works\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"customYoutube\",\"attrs\":{\"src\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IXsZSIYvNLI?color=white\u0026autoplay=0\u0026controls=1\u0026rel=0\",\"width\":700,\"height\":395,\"caption\":\"How it works\",\"data-youtube-url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IXsZSIYvNLI\"}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"1. Select: Click on any component in your Framer project\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"2. Choose: Copy Prompt for AI, or Download ZIP for standalone code\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"3. Done: Your AI implements it, or drop the ZIP into your project\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Works with\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Claude Code\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Cursor\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Codex\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Lovable\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"v0\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Replit\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Bolt\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"and other AI coding tools\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Pricing\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Free 5-day trial\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": Try both Prompt and ZIP modes on your components. No charge if you cancel before day 5.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"After trial:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Quarterly\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — €9.99/month (billed every 3 months at €29.97)\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Monthly\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" — €19.97/month\"}]}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Manage Subscription : \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Visit \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"https://design-to-ai.lemonsqueezy.com/billing\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://design-to-ai.lemonsqueezy.com/billing\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to manage subscription, update payment details, or cancel your trial.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"14-day refund\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" on your first charge, no questions asked — email \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" olalekanisaaccb@gmail.com\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"mailto:hey@design-to-ai.com\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Framer to AI and Code\",\"slug\":\"framer-to-ai\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"6ae4fdd9-b976-4828-b4f5-364f785f3d37\",\"name\":\"Olalekan Isaac\",\"slug\":\"olalekan-isaac\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/407079/avatar-1wsfmgZ1rQXx5nQrlivtSienOrmD35.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/6ae4fdd9-b976-4828-b4f5-364f785f3d37/019fc445-73c3-701e-8c31-3bcec865cbac.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(150 67% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/6ae4fdd9-b976-4828-b4f5-364f785f3d37/019fc445-e5a5-711a-acda-d4c0851d6671.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/6ae4fdd9-b976-4828-b4f5-364f785f3d37/019fc445-b9b0-76d1-ba44-9f31008f77bb.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/6ae4fdd9-b976-4828-b4f5-364f785f3d37/019fc445-fb1b-772f-98c4-cfa6d85a6f2f.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019d1c55-9ab6-75bc-8f9d-715d1154591a\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":46,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-23T16:38:05.139Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-14T21:03:59.729Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-14T21:03:59.723Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"5m1nwwamvugyhvo4khye8eu9z\",\"paid\":true,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"bde1e72b-b4a6-4ecc-8eee-417be77494e8\",\"name\":\"AI\",\"slug\":\"ai\"}]}},{\"id\":\"1439\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Asset Analyzer\",\"body\":\"$57\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Complete Asset Overview\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Asset Analyzer gives you a complete overview of every asset in your Framer project. It scans images, videos, PDFs, audio files, and documents across pages, components, CMS collections, and rich text, showing exactly where each asset is used.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Search \u0026 Discover\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Quickly find the assets you're looking for by searching filenames, layer names, page paths, CMS fields. Use automatically detected image characteristics like orientation, colours, and content type as tags to further improve search.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Alt Text\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"See accurate alt text coverage across your project with tracking per image placement, not just per image. Update alt text across every instance at once or edit individual placements when needed, making accessibility audits fast and straightforward.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Note:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Due to current limitations of Framer's Server API, some image placements cannot be updated by plugins. This includes images embedded inside formatted (rich text) fields and a few other unsupported locations. These placements are clearly identified in Asset Analyzer so you know which ones require manual updates.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Find \u0026 Replace Images\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Replace images individually or in bulk without manually editing every instance. Asset Analyzer lets you swap an image everywhere it's used, including images inside component instances, making project-wide updates fast and consistent.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Private \u0026 Free\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Asset Analyzer runs entirely inside Framer with no account, sign-up, or API key required. Your project stays local, and the plugin is completely free to use.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Best way to find all your assets\",\"slug\":\"asset-analyzer\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"a98ea6e9-fbce-48ab-aa45-9277135015b9\",\"name\":\"Maxime Vandenberge\",\"slug\":\"maxime-vandenberge-9700\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/a98ea6e9-fbce-48ab-aa45-9277135015b9/xqkmlkad\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/a98ea6e9-fbce-48ab-aa45-9277135015b9/019fd771-a69b-700a-9770-f6585fe458be.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.569377990430622}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/a98ea6e9-fbce-48ab-aa45-9277135015b9/019fd771-a63e-71e2-93d7-cf15ea905b10.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.569377990430622}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/a98ea6e9-fbce-48ab-aa45-9277135015b9/019fd771-a65f-708d-9f29-3c3279b37271.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.569377990430622}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019fd3ce-b733-71eb-ab26-4bcd8f0194bd\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Want an Asset Manager that actually helps you find things?\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"When I looked at how other tools approached this problem, I realized they quickly become messy once you're working on projects with more than 50 files. So I decided to build a better solution.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Instead of endless scrolling, you can instantly find what you're looking for with powerful search and filtering. And it doesn't stop at images, it works across all asset types. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I even build extra features that let you bulk edit alt text, making it much faster to organize and optimize your project's assets.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":56,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":5},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-05T21:22:47.224Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-22T09:54:12.478Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-22T09:54:12.468Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-08-06T17:00:20.265Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"3m8mz53cvrb2jc5vfdc3kx9df\",\"paid\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3fc802d9-7527-48e0-9403-c9bd534ab520\",\"name\":\"Utilities\",\"slug\":\"utilities\"},{\"id\":\"676f63da-b192-4974-930d-73185802088a\",\"name\":\"Assets\",\"slug\":\"assets\"},{\"id\":\"d42b39e6-e921-4d46-be20-263eb61efbf9\",\"name\":\"Developers\",\"slug\":\"developers\"}]}},{\"id\":\"1163\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Image Manager\",\"body\":\"$58\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Image Manager\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" finds every image in your Framer project - on pages, inside components, and in your CMS - and lets you audit, fix and optimize them without ever leaving the canvas.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Stop hunting through pages for that one bloated hero image. One panel, every image, grouped by where it actually lives.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"What it does\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"- \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Full project scan\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" - pages, components, design pages and CMS collections, in seconds\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"- \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"CMS included\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" - image fields and gallery fields, with alt text and one-click optimization\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"- \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"No duplicates\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" - one entry per image, not one per breakpoint or component variant\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"- \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Smart audit\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" - file size, dimensions, format and missing alt text at a glance\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"- \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"One-click optimization\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" - resize and convert to WebP, applied directly to your project\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"- \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Bulk actions\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" - optimize, edit alt text, download or delete a whole selection at once\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"- \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Group by source\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" - Pages, Components, CMS collections, or everything at once\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"- \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Inline editing\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" - rename layers, write alt text, locate images on the canvas\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Built for\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"- Designers who care about performance scores on client work\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"- Agencies juggling dozens of Framer projects\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"- Teams chasing alt text coverage and Core Web Vitals\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Why it matters\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Heavy images drag down Core Web Vitals and search rankings. Missing alt text costs you on both accessibility and SEO. Image Manager surfaces both instantly and lets you fix them in seconds, without Photoshop, Squoosh, or a single export and re-upload round trip.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Available in English, French and Spanish. Dark and light themes.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Need help? Contact: \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"lacompagnieduweb@gmail.com\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"mailto:lacompagnieduweb@gmail.com\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Scan, optimize, ship faster\",\"slug\":\"image-manager\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"02e6cbc6-b734-4ed5-b5a1-2268209cd4c3\",\"name\":\"La Compagnie du Web\",\"slug\":\"la-compagnie-du-web\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/237673/avatar-bAqxCU1EkcxGVUVaXmJhvhekiVoAgi.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/501J7Qldkxf702zzMBzG00NpOydZ99E21zIP01Ze3Pdukmk.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/501J7Qldkxf702zzMBzG00NpOydZ99E21zIP01Ze3Pdukmk/thumbnail.webp?time=19.567\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":21.376}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/02e6cbc6-b734-4ed5-b5a1-2268209cd4c3/019fcd2b-febd-738e-af13-309719fcd94d.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(257 50% 22%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/02e6cbc6-b734-4ed5-b5a1-2268209cd4c3/019fcd2b-fea1-72fa-949f-98746c5fc158.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(257 50% 22%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/02e6cbc6-b734-4ed5-b5a1-2268209cd4c3/019fcd2b-fe86-77e2-ba15-2f6450887015.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(257 50% 22%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/02e6cbc6-b734-4ed5-b5a1-2268209cd4c3/019fcd2b-fe69-7605-b47c-d0afafe25f0a.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(257 50% 22%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019ea907-ee74-7b7b-b59e-f630319c5528\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"},{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"rocket\",\"emoji\":\"🚀\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" 2 years of manually compressing images in Framer. I finally built a plugin to do it for me.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"},{\"type\":\"italic\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Hey everyone,\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I've been building Framer sites for about two years, and the same boring task slowed me down on basically every project: image optimization.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Right before launch I'd go through the whole site checking file sizes, compressing the heavy ones, converting to WebP, and adding alt text for SEO and accessibility. Nothing hard, just tedious, and way too easy to miss an image or two.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"So a few months ago I built a little tool for myself to handle it without leaving Framer. I used it on a bunch of client projects, cleaned it up, and ended up putting it on the Marketplace as Image Manager.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"What it does:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Scans every background image across all your pages in a single panel\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Flags issues at a glance - oversized files, missing alt text, PNGs that should be WebP\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Compresses + converts to WebP in one click, applied right on the canvas\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Bulk actions - fix dozens of images at once instead of one by one\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Inline alt text editing to clean up SEO and accessibility\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"It started as a personal productivity thing, but heavy images wreck your Core Web Vitals and missing alt text quietly hurts your SEO, so I figured other Framer folks were hitting the same wall.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Genuinely curious how you all handle this today: by hand, with external tools like Squoosh / TinyPNG, or honestly just skipping it? And if there's a feature that would actually save you time, I'm taking notes.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Full disclosure, it's my own plugin - here if you want a look ($5, lifetime): \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Link\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://short-url.cc/1sbmh\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Happy to answer anything \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"wave\",\"emoji\":\"👋\"}}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":35,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":5},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-12T11:46:42.007Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-14T15:35:06.975Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-04T16:09:08.208Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"cfg6y68wyrlszy7eqxw39b9t3\",\"paid\":true,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"1ad3e7b2-bc61-42ce-b01a-7c8bb2278f1a\",\"name\":\"CMS\",\"slug\":\"cms\"},{\"id\":\"3fc802d9-7527-48e0-9403-c9bd534ab520\",\"name\":\"Utilities\",\"slug\":\"utilities\"},{\"id\":\"9e4479a9-bb0e-4137-8ac0-4a975eb9b882\",\"name\":\"SEO\",\"slug\":\"seo\"}]}},{\"id\":\"7\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"ASCII\",\"body\":\"\u003ch2\u003eOverview\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdd a unique visual flair to your website with the ASCII plugin for Framer. This tool transforms your images and text into stunning ASCII art, giving your project a retro and artistic feel.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eConvert Images and Text\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasily turn any image or text into ASCII art with just a few clicks. Whether you want to create something eye-catching or nostalgic, this plugin offers endless creative possibilities.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFull Typography Control  \u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustomize your ASCII art by adjusting typography settings to match your design style. From font selection to size and spacing, you have full control to craft the perfect look.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eCreate Unique Website Art  \u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eUse ASCII art to give your website a cool and distinctive touch. Perfect for adding creative elements that stand out and make an impact on your visitors.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eElevate your design game with the ASCII plugin and turn simple visuals into creative masterpieces.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Retro effects with text\",\"slug\":\"ascii\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"a7cd9fe6-cf81-4a41-8e93-bca0291dba80\",\"name\":\"Framer\",\"slug\":\"framer\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/107446/xpZr8yYS_400x400-2-MqZMjb2zlessnXickTqkyAzkfqz6le.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"framer\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/7-feq0UOmxNzi1CYmhKFf3u7dxFPvAH2\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/7-M1ByxH29reVnjImLVFVEcDQhCMjOce\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"0192482c-55da-7fb8-b174-5d6d2d62c9ac\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":142,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2024-09-25T16:39:06.756Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-02-19T18:45:38.923Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-10-01T13:01:58.106Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"81se5lrkenro2qofyi61hy5ug\",\"paid\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"676f63da-b192-4974-930d-73185802088a\",\"name\":\"Assets\",\"slug\":\"assets\"}]}},{\"id\":\"1155\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Figma Sync\",\"body\":\"$59\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Import Figma styles \u0026 assets\",\"slug\":\"figma-sync\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"ccd8aecf-9639-4bcf-ae46-d9b936296e82\",\"name\":\"Benjamin Barak\",\"slug\":\"benjamin-barak\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/ccd8aecf-9639-4bcf-ae46-d9b936296e82/1ufpt7p2\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/1155-2J9twQ8czdn85AjlJaDJEA63p0N3G1\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(280 93% 30%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/1155-ZxMQOQGa2bePSyant7lybIcNxCQzHC\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(280 93% 30%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019e176b-f434-7bbd-a690-9dc242dc5d5b\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":97,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":5},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-10T07:34:32.397Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-05-10T07:34:36.215Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-05-11T14:23:31.380Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"4sd7sc7bzojt6wvfmxeulptih\",\"paid\":true,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"b238ea64-0ce9-413a-848d-43b73f0eea0f\",\"name\":\"Design Workflow\",\"slug\":\"design-workflow\"}]}},{\"id\":\"872\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Scroll Sequence\",\"body\":\"$5a\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Scroll Sequence\",\"slug\":\"scroll-sequence\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"fb6b3eab-fefc-4950-b739-6d3eb19ae1f4\",\"name\":\"Fabian Albert\",\"slug\":\"fabian-albert\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/29162/avatar-XtcB8JOFOBWTfkZQZV1z0TDNUGtBTM.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/872-uTnhlnU7lewXnD5ckJVSw4RWxK1zNN\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/872-3YgnwAVyDD8H20BzIK6nL7IH31Jdsz\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 58%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019cd7f3-a429-7988-8e56-36448013c557\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":67,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-10T13:21:57.114Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-03-10T16:09:15.335Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-03-10T13:33:14.665Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-06-15T14:28:46.467Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"7bmuoxrzsek36e0ve0hrkxl7y\",\"paid\":true,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"b238ea64-0ce9-413a-848d-43b73f0eea0f\",\"name\":\"Design Workflow\",\"slug\":\"design-workflow\"}]}},{\"id\":\"8\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Dither\",\"body\":\"\u003ch2\u003eOverview\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eTransform your images with a retro-inspired dither effect using the Dither plugin for Framer. Perfect for adding artistic, pixelated vibes to your designs, this plugin gives you full control over the look and feel of your images.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eMultiple Dither and Color Modes  \u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eChoose from various dither patterns and color modes to perfectly match your design vision. Experiment with different combinations to achieve the exact style you want.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFull Pixelation Control  \u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eTake charge of the pixelation, brightness, and quantization levels for your images. Fine-tune every detail to ensure the perfect balance of color and texture in your artwork.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBring unique, vintage aesthetics to your website designs with the Dither plugin, and give your images a cool, artistic edge.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Dither effect for images\",\"slug\":\"dither\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"a7cd9fe6-cf81-4a41-8e93-bca0291dba80\",\"name\":\"Framer\",\"slug\":\"framer\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/107446/xpZr8yYS_400x400-2-MqZMjb2zlessnXickTqkyAzkfqz6le.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"framer\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/8-ArbxAyGTpYQQppHXoHtX4yqF4StgqJ\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/8-1H3nfff71RFvUHgwgC5UTCH9wrwE1x\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019248cf-bbce-7486-8fa1-c48e4ebe1ca4\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":150,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2024-09-25T17:05:47.370Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-09-30T08:46:49.531Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-10-01T16:00:26.574Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-06-15T14:31:05.000Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"qbtu7lnuxao7w5188cblpk32c\",\"paid\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"676f63da-b192-4974-930d-73185802088a\",\"name\":\"Assets\",\"slug\":\"assets\"}]}},{\"id\":\"1222\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"SEO Toolkit\",\"body\":\"$5b\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"SEO Toolkit, the All-in-One SEO Plugin for Framer\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Rank your Framer site on Google without juggling five different tools. SEO Toolkit is a complete Framer SEO plugin that audits your active page in real time and tells you exactly what to fix. It checks meta tags, analyzes your focus keyword, validates headings, flags missing alt text, generates schema markup, previews your search and social cards, and runs a real speed test, all inside the Framer canvas. No code and no developer needed.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Why Framer creators need an SEO plugin\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Framer gives you a few SEO fields in settings, but it does not tell you whether your title is the right length, whether your keyword appears in the first paragraph, or whether your images are missing alt text. There is no SEO score, no schema generator, and no on-page audit built in. SEO Toolkit fills those gaps and turns guesswork into a clear checklist.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"What you get\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Live SEO score from 0 to 100 that updates as you edit your title, description, and focus keyword.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Meta tag editor with title and description length guidance for search results.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Issue analyzer that sorts problems into errors, warnings, and notes with plain-language fixes.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Alt text manager with optional AI generation using your own OpenAI key.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Google SERP previews plus Facebook, X, and LinkedIn social card previews.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"JSON-LD schema generator for FAQ, Article, Product, LocalBusiness, Event, Review, Breadcrumb, and Organization rich results.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Nine-point technical checklist for H1 rules, canonical URLs, indexability, and OG images.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Real Lighthouse speed audit for Core Web Vitals via Google PageSpeed Insights.\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Built the right way\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The core toolkit is free. AI alt text is bring-your-own-key, so there are no hidden fees. Nothing is injected into your live site, no tracking, and drafts auto-save per page.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Who it is for: solo designers, agencies managing client sites, and any Framer site owner who wants to rank on Google, Bing, and AI search.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Support: \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"connect@fecommerce.co\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"mailto:connect@fecommerce.co\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"All-in-one Framer SEO tool\",\"slug\":\"seo-toolkit\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"7e63332c-77d2-4e00-a6ca-d9c98c3d7dcf\",\"name\":\"FeCommerce\",\"slug\":\"fecommerce\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/1522163/avatar-O3mD0A25QB3hEFuyWMXPGD4iqS1Dlf.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/1222-NzdVYCc0FZEm5dvvFqt9ucqkpqPShG\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/1222-7aocbYrR9Nwnv5eGlOsBWRJotb1h5j\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/1222-r2GMWjfUwY2zKc2KBg7HUXbZzoJp5P\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/1222-c8VepBjQdnRP2MIsyUh7JQGgaQGMPs\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(258 77% 20%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019e62e7-a0cd-721d-a8ae-c7507de5a3c2\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":73,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-25T14:37:29.902Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-03T10:08:47.678Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-05-26T06:10:07.693Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"by9yhrvpviyt0zdha2aupe1vm\",\"paid\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"9e4479a9-bb0e-4137-8ac0-4a975eb9b882\",\"name\":\"SEO\",\"slug\":\"seo\"}]}},{\"id\":\"913\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"3D Shapes\",\"body\":\"$5c\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Free abstract 3D shape assets!\",\"slug\":\"3d-shapes\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"af6b5c1e-9f7f-41b0-983d-7f97f99d7c72\",\"name\":\"Isaac Roberts\",\"slug\":\"framestack\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/35028/kSFjV8bIu-AKT3u2pg7PrZL7rowyGEY3MFSLial5\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/913-10ko38lVw1EnJ7sxhBEpFz1OLWfmpy\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/913-6L79Pcsvmmw7O9EJRZy7D7dw2pRXbi\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/913-rldVYXpzcZnhWI4Xn3putmX9n4LbOs\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/913-bUsAdysrzlJ8aOwSDXXLSnfQp0jGz0\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019d0167-0ded-7b87-ad10-616e22fddb26\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":110,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-18T14:14:50.612Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-25T17:39:31.767Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-06-25T17:39:31.755Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"bdot376cc9b0578kmhh8fvn7i\",\"paid\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"676f63da-b192-4974-930d-73185802088a\",\"name\":\"Assets\",\"slug\":\"assets\"}]}},{\"id\":\"829\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Edit Image\",\"body\":\"$5d\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"AI Agent\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"AI agent just landed into the plugin! \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"robot\",\"emoji\":\"🤖\"}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Founder members have received 10 free credits to try it out, and new users get 5 credits on signup.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Features\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"AI agent for image generation and edits from text/reference images\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Drag \u0026 Drop, clipboard, URL or file image import\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Zoom, undo/redo, revert, copy, download, export, save\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Crop tools with presets and manual control\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Manage presets: clone, save, reset, shuffle\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Fine-tune brightness, color, and style settings\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Apply powerful image effects\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Upscale images up to 4× resolution\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Remove backgrounds with one click\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Browse stock images and favorites\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Project history and gallery access\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Web App\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Your edits now sync between the plugin and the web app. Open an image anywhere, continue editing, keep your history, favorites, and assets in sync.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"👉 \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"https://editimage.studio\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://editimage.studio\",\"class\":null,\"target\":\"_blank\"}},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Edit Image\",\"slug\":\"edit-image\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"d964b8ab-c3fb-476c-8a64-2d6b0d0e82f4\",\"name\":\"Fehmi Özüseven\",\"slug\":\"fehmi\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/29053/avatar-sC6u2gv1FmfEhc4ntS5D8chz25MNc8.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/XFeE7muxlCfN1Vor5n8SOeA6qfjbCWK5PjB4fWAM01L8.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/XFeE7muxlCfN1Vor5n8SOeA6qfjbCWK5PjB4fWAM01L8/thumbnail.webp?time=58.8\",\"aspectRatio\":\"769:540\",\"duration\":117.6}},{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/NRojNJZK7B9QhUb2JniQvHJMvRTXWRj9PAoG5J3aCsY.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/NRojNJZK7B9QhUb2JniQvHJMvRTXWRj9PAoG5J3aCsY/thumbnail.webp?time=2.1\",\"aspectRatio\":\"787:540\",\"duration\":28.533333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/829-LtjaqdisLXh2Axhw3BeJqe6kYRW9r0\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/829-Bi17fYvTBMmCdWpq1y3hw4bQNJbQC8\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/829-jEcK5367r6h3MlJUVUcHRU06qN8YKz\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019c9bda-04a5-7ca7-8057-a5396a50ee41\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Working on the next phase of the Edit Image plugin. AI edit is coming soon!\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":79,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":7},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-02-26T16:39:03.419Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-20T05:33:57.473Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-06-24T11:09:59.155Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"awllk6vcsmt0mbcafecawd48h\",\"paid\":true,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3fc802d9-7527-48e0-9403-c9bd534ab520\",\"name\":\"Utilities\",\"slug\":\"utilities\"},{\"id\":\"676f63da-b192-4974-930d-73185802088a\",\"name\":\"Assets\",\"slug\":\"assets\"},{\"id\":\"bde1e72b-b4a6-4ecc-8eee-417be77494e8\",\"name\":\"AI\",\"slug\":\"ai\"}]}},{\"id\":\"305\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Blur it\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat is Blur it?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlur it lets you add beautiful blur effects to your images without slowing down your Framer site. Instead of using Framer's blur filters which can hurt performance especially at high values, this plugin applies the blur directly onto the image itself. You get the same stunning visual result with \u003cstrong\u003ezero performance cost\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGaussian Blur\u003c/strong\u003e for an uniform effect\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProgressive Blur\u003c/strong\u003e for a dynamic gradient-style blur\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlur strength\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSaturation\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHue shift\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUse Cases\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHero sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBackgrounds\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eImage overlays\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLoading states or transitions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy to Use\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eJust select your image, tweak the settings and apply the effect. No extra setup, no performance hit — just clean and fast results.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Blur it\",\"slug\":\"blur-it\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"fb6b3eab-fefc-4950-b739-6d3eb19ae1f4\",\"name\":\"Fabian Albert\",\"slug\":\"fabian-albert\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/29162/avatar-XtcB8JOFOBWTfkZQZV1z0TDNUGtBTM.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/305-2c1WE4lREFTIVVbQ6o4UuRNVN0bZGB\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/305-ud6eelYQEzMR1QhJ39IWAWE5f6EtRO\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01961055-9666-7f6a-b0c6-8e265af2e28d\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":84,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-04-05T17:39:31.530Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-03-09T10:29:26.195Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-04-07T12:59:26.694Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"31f7mfvg18n1bg5ir73ui5z2z\",\"paid\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"b238ea64-0ce9-413a-848d-43b73f0eea0f\",\"name\":\"Design Workflow\",\"slug\":\"design-workflow\"}]}},{\"id\":\"1353\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Shaders by Paper\",\"body\":\"$5e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Shaders by Paper brings \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"paper.design\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"http://paper.design\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"'s open source WebGL shader library into Framer as native components. Insert a shader from the gallery and every setting shows up as a regular Framer control: colors, sliders, toggles, and image inputs.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Native Framer variants and transitions\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The most valuable and unique feature of this plugin is the support for Framer variants: you can wrap a shader inside a native Framer component and create as many variants as you need.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"This allows you to play with scroll triggers, scroll variants, hover states, clicks, etc. Basically all native Framer events and transitions.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Demos \u0026 walkthrough\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Demo Site (Live link)\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://shadersbypaper.framer.ai/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Demo Video (YouTube)\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://youtu.be/pxw9YFggXqg\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Walkthrough tutorial\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://youtu.be/G5kWeZIlQAU\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"More demos and examples\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://x.com/fw3d/status/2082772796430540974\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (x.com)\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Native easing curves\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"For each of your variant, you can pick the easing and duration in the Transition control. Visitors who prefer reduced motion get the end state directly.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"29 shaders, infinite combinations\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The library has 29 shaders in three categories:\"}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Image filters (6), such as Paper Texture and Fluted Glass\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Logo animations (3), such as Heatmap and Liquid Metal\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Effects (20), such as Mesh Gradient and Dot Orbit\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Each shader ships with its original presets.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Import straight from Paper\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"If you design in Paper, there is a shortcut: copy a shader on the Paper canvas and paste it into the plugin's Paste import tab. It becomes a Framer component with the same settings, ready to use.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"License\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The first shader in each category is free forever, with no watermark: Paper Texture, Heatmap, and Mesh Gradient. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A one-year license unlocks the other 26 shaders and the paste import:\"}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"39€ for one Framer account\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"or 149€ for a team key that covers five Framer accounts \"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"There is no subscription, and everything you placed keeps working even if the license expires.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"About\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Read the documentation here\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://framerlabs.com/documentation/paper-shaders-intro\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Shaders by Paper for Framer is an independent product, not affiliated with \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"paper.design\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"http://paper.design\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The shaders come from the open source \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Paper Shaders\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://github.com/paper-design/shaders\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" library, released under the Apache 2.0 license.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Library of interactive shaders\",\"slug\":\"shaders-by-paper\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"e4963e7a-50a2-4343-9e4b-cd660f2a3c6e\",\"name\":\"Fred Moon\",\"slug\":\"fredmoon\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/28835/IMG_2764-fYoHMRDuXpfEvr4mKyO4ziQuI0kHFO.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/Z7mDBgUonImGGaQwuD7L602oxSxiCBdt6wFweByuNvFM.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/Z7mDBgUonImGGaQwuD7L602oxSxiCBdt6wFweByuNvFM/thumbnail.webp?time=2.617\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":4}},{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/T6q1AeYN6s1Gq00ztSDt4bJzUH2QXYLx6LwXDsB00YLJE.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/T6q1AeYN6s1Gq00ztSDt4bJzUH2QXYLx6LwXDsB00YLJE/thumbnail.webp?time=4.783\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":10.25}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/e4963e7a-50a2-4343-9e4b-cd660f2a3c6e/8ntqg03m\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(216 85% 65%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/e4963e7a-50a2-4343-9e4b-cd660f2a3c6e/tx7wletw\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(216 85% 65%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3348164627363737}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/e4963e7a-50a2-4343-9e4b-cd660f2a3c6e/5y8f83yl\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f42bd-0696-7328-b1b0-64d559f42577\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"My newest plugin brings the entire library of Paper Shaders directly inside Framer, with native controls and support for component variants and scroll triggers. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Give it a try!\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":75,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-08T17:18:31.764Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-10T09:50:24.639Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-10T09:50:24.621Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-07-09T14:12:15.201Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"c9wj7pir35knjycdjmcmifbve\",\"paid\":true,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"676f63da-b192-4974-930d-73185802088a\",\"name\":\"Assets\",\"slug\":\"assets\"},{\"id\":\"b238ea64-0ce9-413a-848d-43b73f0eea0f\",\"name\":\"Design Workflow\",\"slug\":\"design-workflow\"},{\"id\":\"f6795017-0256-4955-b31a-c81a28ef20ff\",\"name\":\"Integrations\",\"slug\":\"integrations\"}]}},{\"id\":\"46\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Logofy\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eEasily access over 3k logos from simpleicons.org and drop em' directly onto your Framer canvas.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Drag \u0026 drop 3k+ SVG logos\",\"slug\":\"logofy\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"811ce95a-3c4b-453f-965d-835e208c522b\",\"name\":\"traf ‎\",\"slug\":\"traf\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/811ce95a-3c4b-453f-965d-835e208c522b/shu1fa6t\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/46-O2yjQ7s30Kg4tun8zhZtsdbZSAUQKk\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/46-PwQ7ZO828JVIU28GfALZWDXTNRYPK3\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019258cf-48a9-7abe-abff-988a413aa4c6\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":134,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2024-10-04T17:43:10.311Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-10-04T17:43:10.308Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-10-04T18:33:52.553Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-06-15T14:32:24.103Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"a4tq4t3hh7wtzz2ciw283ho8p\",\"paid\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"676f63da-b192-4974-930d-73185802088a\",\"name\":\"Assets\",\"slug\":\"assets\"}]}},{\"id\":\"825\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Tweaker\",\"body\":\"$5f\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Fast CSS custom code\",\"slug\":\"tweaker\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"fb6b3eab-fefc-4950-b739-6d3eb19ae1f4\",\"name\":\"Fabian Albert\",\"slug\":\"fabian-albert\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/29162/avatar-XtcB8JOFOBWTfkZQZV1z0TDNUGtBTM.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/825-xWG0jQkOQuPSD2pboGyht5UQ6gNAEX\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 22%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/plugins/825-s2sbc9EovcM6LHTsRnNq7PGRJfkbYD\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 58%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019c95f2-8508-77ba-abd9-abc1560500f7\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":47,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-02-25T15:52:39.568Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-02-25T20:13:34.962Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-02-25T17:57:04.904Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-06-15T14:29:22.102Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"1u54c723hkabxn6xv5ajravnp\",\"paid\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3fc802d9-7527-48e0-9403-c9bd534ab520\",\"name\":\"Utilities\",\"slug\":\"utilities\"}]}},{\"id\":\"1309\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"ShopifyConnect\",\"body\":\"$60\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Shopify Connect - Build a Shopify storefront in Framer\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Shopify Connect brings your Shopify store into Framer and lets you build a complete, fully custom storefront without leaving the design tool. Sync your catalog into the Framer CMS in one click, or pull products live via API, then assemble product pages, listings, cart, and checkout with ready-made, drag-and-drop components. No themes, no code. Built on Framer Plugins 3.0 and free to use.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"How it works\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"orderedList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Connect your store with your shop domain and a Storefront API access token.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sync products into a Framer CMS collection, or fetch live by handle in API mode.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Drag components onto the canvas. They auto wire to your store and render real data.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Shoppers add to cart and check out through Shopify's secure hosted checkout.\"}]}]}],\"attrs\":{\"type\":null,\"start\":1}},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Storefront Components\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"  \"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Product Page, Product Listing (search, sort, pagination), Variant Selector (pills, swatches, image switch), Add to Cart, Buy It Now, Quantity, Cart Drawer, Cart Page, Cart Icon, Mobile Sticky Cart, Price, Price Discount, SKU, Inventory Label and Counter, Tabs, Related Products, Share, and more. Changing a variant updates price, SKU, stock, and image everywhere on the page.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Two data modes\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"  \"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"CMS mode syncs products into Framer CMS with no API calls required. API mode fetches live data on demand. Switch anytime.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Designed for designers \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Toggleable animations (scroll reveal, tab cross fade, hover zoom), deep styling controls, sale badges, light and dark mode, and full responsiveness across desktop, tablet, and phone.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Secure by design\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Your Storefront token is never embedded in your published site. It is stored locally and used server-side through a secure proxy, with PCI handled by Shopify checkout.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Setup requires a Shopify Storefront API access token (public token). In Shopify admin: Sales channels, Headless, Manage API access, Storefront API, Public access token.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Connect Framer to Shopify\",\"slug\":\"shopifyconnect\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"7e63332c-77d2-4e00-a6ca-d9c98c3d7dcf\",\"name\":\"FeCommerce\",\"slug\":\"fecommerce\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/1522163/avatar-O3mD0A25QB3hEFuyWMXPGD4iqS1Dlf.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/7e63332c-77d2-4e00-a6ca-d9c98c3d7dcf/4d20gpdp\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(160 75% 13%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/7e63332c-77d2-4e00-a6ca-d9c98c3d7dcf/r1hmk495\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/7e63332c-77d2-4e00-a6ca-d9c98c3d7dcf/dwzrgqqv\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(180 50% 6%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/7e63332c-77d2-4e00-a6ca-d9c98c3d7dcf/gytjszb9\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019eff2d-7c19-76e8-b184-d4aa1a79788e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":46,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":5},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-25T14:27:11.479Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-25T07:24:06.116Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-25T07:24:06.105Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"63os6qkygakve6yv9z9lph0ed\",\"paid\":false,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"1ad3e7b2-bc61-42ce-b01a-7c8bb2278f1a\",\"name\":\"CMS\",\"slug\":\"cms\"},{\"id\":\"c4868181-e303-4aac-8074-bd683d4debe8\",\"name\":\"E-Commerce\",\"slug\":\"ecommerce\"},{\"id\":\"f6795017-0256-4955-b31a-