01-29T22:28:42.198Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"plugin\",\"attributes\":{\"framerPluginId\":\"9xzubsjzlyru0omm8u1h9wuux\",\"paid\":true,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"9e4479a9-bb0e-4137-8ac0-4a975eb9b882\",\"name\":\"SEO\",\"slug\":\"seo\"},{\"id\":\"c4868181-e303-4aac-8074-bd683d4debe8\",\"name\":\"E-Commerce\",\"slug\":\"ecommerce\"},{\"id\":\"f6795017-0256-4955-b31a-c81a28ef20ff\",\"name\":\"Integrations\",\"slug\":\"integrations\"}]}},{\"id\":\"582\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"WEBP Image Converter\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eThe WEBP Converter plugin eliminates the need for external tools or multi-step processes to convert images into the WEBP format.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt automatically scans all images within any selected layer inside your Framer project, identifies each file’s format, and converts them into WEBP to Instantly boost your website’s speed and deliver a faster, smoother experience for your visitors.If an image is already in WEBP, the plugin intelligently notifies you instead of reprocessing it.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe plugin displays:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFormat of the image selected\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFile sizes for comparison\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe exact percentage of size saved\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis ensures full transparency and lets users preview, convert, and replace images instantly. All while maintaining no loss in quality.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"WEBP Image Converter\",\"slug\":\"webp-converter\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"032f128e-5c96-4bb7-9fe8-3591074d9bc0\",\"name\":\"Adheeb\",\"slug\":\"adheeb\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/32754/avatar-RI9Pi1QlJdbAUbJ5Zjqqmyz9UQk8Zi.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image